    <item>
      <title>GW37: The FPL Watchlist</title>
      <description>https://www.sumup.com/en-gb/business-account/making-tax-digital/

The landscape for Sole Traders has changed with Making Tax Digital for Income Tax now live in the UK.  Since 6th of April 2026 sole traders earning over £50,000 must keep digit records and submit quarterly updates to HMRC using approved software. That’s where SUMUP comes in.  SumUp has built a free, simple software solution to support sole traders through this change. The best thing - it’s free and there is no monthly fee! Getting started is easy — just search “SumUp MTD”

