      <title>Club World Cup Fantasy #1: How To Play</title>
      <description>Club World Cup Fantasy #1: How To Play

Welcome to the first Fantasy Club World Cup episode of the summer. We've borrowed the boys from the @uefafantasypod to cover the inaugural tournament - a month long loan we'll call it - are they on big money like CR7? 

No. No they're not. 

BUT, will they cover everything you need to know before and during the tournament - yes!

JOIN OUR LEAGUE: https://play.fifa.com/fantasy/join-league/OAM9E4JT
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
