      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p><strong>Club World Cup Fantasy #1: How To Play</strong></p>
<p>Welcome to the first Fantasy Club World Cup episode of the summer. We've borrowed the boys from the @uefafantasypod to cover the inaugural tournament - a month long loan we'll call it - are they on big money like CR7? </p>
<p>No. No they're not. </p>
<p>BUT, will they cover everything you need to know before and during the tournament - yes!</p>
<p><strong>JOIN OUR LEAGUE: </strong><a href="https://play.fifa.com/fantasy/join-league/OAM9E4JT"><strong>https://play.fifa.com/fantasy/join-league/OAM9E4JT</strong></a><strong></strong></p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>]]>
      </content:encoded>
      <itunes:duration>2643</itunes:duration>
      <guid isPermaLink="false"><![CDATA[8d2f7f4c-4306-11f0-9130-f3daa03aff60]]></guid>
