    <item>
      <title>FPL MEET THE MANAGER: Academic Researcher</title>
      <description>Over the summer, we'll be sharing episodes from Joe's MEET THE MANAGER series. 

In this episode, recorded in March 2022, Joe chats to academic Daniel Whittaker (@FPL_Tikka) who has just completed new research on how FPL managers consumer information and use it to decide on their weekly transfers, captain calls and strategies.

Here he exclusively reveals his initial findings and why the whole world can learn from the successful ways FPL managers consume information. 



