    <item>
      <title>FPL SUMMER: Meet the Manager #3</title>
      <description>Over the summer, we'll be sharing episodes from Joe's MEET THE MANAGER series. 
In this episode, recorded in April 2022, Joe chats to another FPL manager with a unique insight into the game, Chama. Who is in the top 300 during the final few Gameweeks of the 21/22 season after resolving to improve his captaincy scores.
With a raft of stellar armband hauls over the season he reveals how he makes his decisions and the plans he put in place to do well this season before the campaign began. Essential listening for FPL managers looking to improve how they pick their captain!
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
