        <![CDATA[<p>Fantasy Football Scout editor Neale joins Joe to look at the latest team news developments and injuries to arise from this week's press conferences. Will Arsenal's doubts make this week? And what of the players from Luton and Bournemouth, who play twice during Double Gameweek 28?</p><p><br></p><p>Want to win at FPL? 20% OFF - JOIN US! - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbDBNR29xQmJ3U1F6U2JpWGF3WW5iaHZxZlJZUXxBQ3Jtc0trdkoyNGVjTXhpZUlnYkRyX3p1YXBFQzdtLTBWT2c0ZFRBWlZ4VXdxTjhsalZHbmFIWXpUQ1k0bm5GUEJRNU5wcDBXOWFZWkZLQjZ2bzIxSkUybGhGU19pdUFZNHlPWk9NVmRWallsSk0tUDZPYkdhVQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2Fjoinffscout&amp;v=ho5R92PYaWs">https://bit.ly/joinffscout</a></p><p><br></p><p>Now is THE BEST time to join FFScout as a member and get everything mentioned and much, much more. Join the Home of Fantasy Football TODAY and save 20% at Pre-Season prices!</p><p>Want to join the Home of Fantasy Football?!</p><p><br></p><p>20% OFF - JOIN US! - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbXJSTHhjeFlVbTY1a1l3eHhVUWkxb2Z5M3JNd3xBQ3Jtc0tscUJLbEo1dmxwNC1lak05eHB1UjNBSThZcE5TM21uSkxSMWFkaVo0am82YlFrdmNrQndoYXM5Qk1lRllfcF9HYU9vMXlKUFZjdGJTb3pnbU93TWw0UTQ0TU00cV9MU3VrTjNIelpub1BjUFE1ZklJMA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2Fjoinffscout&amp;v=ho5R92PYaWs">https://bit.ly/joinffscout</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>️ Subscribe to the channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa1FvcEd5ZHhXcUN3cm12UXlWam1kdE5PQWlBUXxBQ3Jtc0tud3JjRE8ydXl1Q0tSTlh2UlE0Y1JfZUw3ZmlTd2YteVBPS0JzZTNrbFlZZGhDRXhVOWJNaWlBU0VESXhELU0ycFdEQ28xbUNhM1hiQWhBSHRpcEhOdGxsam5oUHc1V2ZBQTF1bDJlVkEwZTNrMUtEUQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F3yg0I28&amp;v=ho5R92PYaWs">https://bit.ly/3yg0I28</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>All our video content is also available as audio only, on Spotify, Apple, or anywhere else you get your podcasts <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redi