        <![CDATA[<p>Joe catches up with the latest moves of the elite managers in Fantasy Football Scout's Great and the Good League ahead of GW28. With a Double Gameweek for Bournemouth and Luton, their assets will be of interest to this group of managers. Joe also looks to see which will Free Hit in Gameweek 29 and he also analyses Andy's Wildcard plans.</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✔️ Subscribe to the channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqblFMUDFQZ1FaeHV1dVpVVjQzRnM5dUYyMEN5UXxBQ3Jtc0tsTWNWRnp2Y3FlbkNzYlRyQkJ6YVZTLUZYQk9udWFseXR2cElCbWR2dmFMc1FLaV9rMmZ2MEE2WHNOalo1a1phTkFPakhrRnptTDJIMWFwc3F5V2MyR3ZlYmNuVlczNUV4UUt6TU1BVTdaNU9tWHROOA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F3yg0I28&amp;v=hzCPqPP14UY">https://bit.ly/3yg0I28</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>All our video content is also available as audio only, on Spotify, Apple, or anywhere else you get your podcasts <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa1IzQmtKWXZKb3JHdHROQTlWMUFfLUtmZGFvd3xBQ3Jtc0ttUWtjR05IZVd0SXI1VFdFWlJYZk45dEJ2WWxEdXVRd0hqUGFiMEZiTHJxYUdxVFBsXzAzZm9Db1dGMXY2ODVNbFZnVnFVMjIwb29sMDg3bXBJeGJSb0t6RXJ5UEU2dHNHSmVWTENtZU9USEZnT3BPNA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Flinktr.ee%2FFantasyFootballScout&amp;v=hzCPqPP14UY">https://linktr.ee/FantasyFootballScout</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✍️ Win at FPL: Click here to sign up for a FFScout Membership - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbGQ5TEdfOWpVWGM5VTVXRUJHTUt3VlotTFN5UXxBQ3Jtc0ttLXJSM1liSGw4U1F2bl9Oa1JuRmlNTkZhWkJOeWNqdDNlYm0tcTNmb3lsemFLVHBEamNtWXlzOEFpM0pLWlRSb21McmdOdHM4dzFtUUd1ZGx6Y25iQzY0ODZWVnB2NmRhelNPcnpQYlNwNnVVdVZsMA&amp;q=http%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2FFFSYouTubeMembership&amp;v=hzCPqPP14UY">http://bit.ly/FFSYouTubeMembership</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>]]>
