        <![CDATA[<p>Ryan and Marc take stock of a busy week for FPL news, including Solanke's injury, KDB and Haaland's rekindled partnership at Luton, and the fall out from the cup games so far. Just how will these developments impact our chip strategy and transfers ahead of the weekend?</p><p>Plus - your questions answered!</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✔️ Subscribe to the channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa25MMG4zTlJuQWFkQk1vNWFsN200NWVOdW1XZ3xBQ3Jtc0trNkh3Q2t2dDM4T3FDUGRXWnZQc2d6Q08tamtSOUFUOHA5Z2QxRnpiRF8xbUFfRVh1alZoNXVsU2VzdUlaS3JkbTl2NUtsdk9penFwVlBIQkVqcEQ1c25sdE5PQUNWZnpKV3JDckp1R3VYbDBPZERScw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F3yg0I28&amp;v=2wJWg-XyezE">https://bit.ly/3yg0I28</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>All our video content is also available as audio only, on Spotify, Apple, or anywhere else you get your podcasts <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa3dsTExKdVVncGhNTGEyMjF1Y0x5TElXamlZUXxBQ3Jtc0trLWc4OFo4Q0hyWkROVWZ1S0tDQTg2ZndXX1dhN3AydEVaYVdFTTlCeU5kc1dPUWNRdjg2VUUxT01OOUZ4aXdEVzJMdVJySHlmell2ZV9GRFEtdjZDWldlVlVPV04wME9EelBQRmlrQWJIRmptQVVXaw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Flinktr.ee%2FFantasyFootballScout&amp;v=2wJWg-XyezE">https://linktr.ee/FantasyFootballScout</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✍️ Win at FPL: Click here to sign up for a FFScout Membership - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa210MlBJdF95Um1rSHdZWUpjNXdMLU40Q0FhUXxBQ3Jtc0ttdkFQSHg0ZEd6WFRZaERRUFVUNVR1N0M0NURfRVoxeVNkb0tvYXJ1Z1J2UVlVNm1rWEhJZkozdmJFT3dIcW1GY1RkNktMZXc0TU1MMFpCXzZ4RjFpbTFLVXlSS00tMV8yc2ZBVl9hdExYTERmWGptaw&amp;q=http%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2FFFSYouTubeMembership&amp;v=2wJWg-XyezE">http://bit.ly/FFSYouTubeMembership</a></p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>]]>
