      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>ElFozzie and Ed Gray launch a new regular focused squarely on the rough side of FPL Gameweek 25.</p><p>Those suffering the slings and arrows of outrageous fortune, bad captaincy decisions or transfer regret can share their tales of woe and find solace on the MLC couch. Think of it as FPL self help and the start to your fantasy healing!</p><p>Big hauls need not apply!</p><p><br></p><p>Want to win at FPL? 20% OFF - JOIN US! - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbDFHeUlRejRIb2NKYjE1S2FSNklVMGdkX29uZ3xBQ3Jtc0tucVRPU183UHhiclFUYncyOE92UDJJMmNQUzE1Z0RHbkRBVkNWbnd6NGtzazZHQmd2dzI0SVBXYXREdnRFUUctbk01bVdiVVpTWUFOTm1GZWtjTVhZa250cXR5eE1SZmZ4UXd5WHBfa2g2WTJyeTNCWQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2Fjoinffscout&amp;v=d90BRiMlzqI">https://bit.ly/joinffscout</a></p><p><br></p><p>Now is THE BEST time to join FFScout as a member and get everything mentioned and much, much more. Join the Home of Fantasy Football TODAY and save 20% at Pre-Season prices!</p><p>Want to join the Home of Fantasy Football?!</p><p><br></p><p>20% OFF - JOIN US! - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqay1INEk5Q0VER3FyWFI4bDlfS1l0NDlyMmdUd3xBQ3Jtc0trbnAwV0JJTTNFdFpwcXZlbHpzQmNIUWVlcnJQRlhfb0RnVEpoaXkzeW9aWWJxR1E5a2o2OTdEbkJsY1ZMUl9wWHVROE9VRUlBQnNMQ1IyLTB5b1JjU1lNLTlKbzdBeEpnaXh4ZnViMGR2ZmFwVTZXcw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2Fjoinffscout&amp;v=d90BRiMlzqI">https://bit.ly/joinffscout</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>️ Subscribe to the channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqazZIQlJwam10LUtIWVozV2tESWQyVEFybGZBZ3xBQ3Jtc0tuS2ZQdTZTdHZDd1g1Y2swY1hTSUVBSENRalEyNGhCYzRyNktLcVpLeGlMNE1aWDZaNlY1d01XRjY0bXhJR016TWJ3Qi13cDlGTWV3a3EwVkhMMFNJLXZ6M3ZTYUlsd1dPVVFUMnJ0ZmZubGZwX3FXdw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F3yg0I28&amp;v=d90BRiMlzqI">https://bit.ly/3yg0I28</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>All our video content is also available as audio only, on Spo