        <![CDATA[<p>Rich joins Pras to focus on the upcoming Double Gameweek headaches. Can they persuaded by a certain Manchester City defender, who may now be nailed on? With Alexander-Arnold seemingly out it looks like there is a space in defence for many teams. And what of a possible return for Liverpool's Salah?</p><p><br></p><p>Want to win at FPL? 20% OFF - JOIN US! - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbGVVMXBqTVJkVWI1SWMzU3ZjdU1fa1lfbG5Zd3xBQ3Jtc0tsaWtralgwcVdnSXl5eWhYZEpmcV9kN3RMT040SzR6VmxSTzhraTVYZUM2MHZhUVRlUEJDWHZZM1J4WFlXUWhDbVAyOGFRc3d4NnJVUzZ2bFBmOHZqdUg5TkFNSHZ1NEJjZlNGM3o3VkVHODZJMWRaYw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2Fjoinffscout&amp;v=iIgsMcFx3So">https://bit.ly/joinffscout</a></p><p><br></p><p>Now is THE BEST time to join FFScout as a member and get everything mentioned and much, much more. Join the Home of Fantasy Football TODAY and save 20% at Pre-Season prices!</p><p>Want to join the Home of Fantasy Football?!</p><p><br></p><p>20% OFF - JOIN US! - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbFZ6d2ZpTWdGcHdaLWZ4clJqbXRaeFhLa3JOZ3xBQ3Jtc0ttTnVXeVhHTE5wb1RZdDhpazF5R25iN3Fyd0FVUmtrTXh1YzZITHhTMFBlZkxfaGI3TUsyaTFPUUU2VGQwaF9YTElRcEJKdnd2Wmp2a2pscUs2MTc4VmNDSndCZ3RxWko3eUNrRnExU1ZrOFNuSG9NRQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2Fjoinffscout&amp;v=iIgsMcFx3So">https://bit.ly/joinffscout</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>️ Subscribe to the channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbmRVUGVXeUhNVWV4RDJLX0NSbXlPemhQZWdHZ3xBQ3Jtc0tsMlZSblJZaGhYbHdMQmpNZXRrcWU0ZFo3bWJUcGI5elZtZlh1SG13bjBtNzFuMEhJRHA5Mkp2S3VCVDNBYkdYdDB2MWY3ejEzSC15REgyX2s0ai1BOTJ0TkpWVUxhOGlpVHhxWG9YSDJuNWdPdGw5bw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F3yg0I28&amp;v=iIgsMcFx3So">https://bit.ly/3yg0I28</a></p><p> ━━━━━━━━━━━━━ </p><p> All our video content is also available as audio only, on Spotify, Apple, or anywhere else you get your podcasts <a href="https:/