        <![CDATA[<p>Joe and Tom (16x Top 10k finishes between them) use their trusty goals and assists imminent tables to try to predict future returns. With title chasing Liverpool and Manchester City's double fixture on the horizon, all eyes are on their goal scoring talent. </p><p> </p><p>Plus Live Chat Q&amp;A. <a href="https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/fantasypremierleague">#fantasypremierleague</a> </p><p><br></p><p>Want to win at FPL? 20% OFF - JOIN US! - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqblp1WkVvSUNMWnIxT1RkREhxQTE3RHlueDRUd3xBQ3Jtc0trU3hPdTQzX05VbXNBTFZpT19KV2REN0pGckVSMi1jYm1aWlNocms3dm53aTdmX3lxMHh5OWlBU0FuN2FGYWZya2k4Nml1Y2dMUEVmZzJXS1htZ2MxUFJMZHBhYlBnTEZrUW9PMnE0VjRjdThEbEdvQQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2Fjoinffscout&amp;v=6mB5NPa_TYU">https://bit.ly/joinffscout</a></p><p><br></p><p> Now is THE BEST time to join FFScout as a member and get everything mentioned and much, much more. Join the Home of Fantasy Football TODAY and save 20% at Pre-Season prices!</p><p>Want to join the Home of Fantasy Football?!</p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>]]>
