        <![CDATA[<p>Joe and Greyhead take a look at how the pundits and elite managers in Fantasy Football Scout's Great and the Good league are doing and try to predict their future moves for <a href="https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/gw23">#gw23</a> and beyond. </p><p><br></p><p>It's been a controversial week for the league this week Joe and Greyhead explain why.</p><p><br></p><p>Want to win at FPL? 20% OFF - JOIN US! - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa2RpUW5tRG1QSWNQMlBja0s5Q2kyQlFIUzFFZ3xBQ3Jtc0tsRkFuX2lrcV9iTVpMbDRUNFdfQjNsaEJnT1dLZkhQbWxoNllZT2VDZGdRTjJKbkFtRU9vbmxiS1ZDb2l0d2tXRWJfUlR5N2diTG56R1c2eWN5NzdFLXFLeTNRNHlhRzRGenRpeXYzaU9za2VQcTZ2Yw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2Fjoinffscout&amp;v=BJSA-U_ZY7g">https://bit.ly/joinffscout</a></p><p><br></p><p> Now is THE BEST time to join FFScout as a member and get everything mentioned and much, much more. Join the Home of Fantasy Football TODAY and save 20% at Pre-Season prices!</p><p>Want to join the Home of Fantasy Football?!</p><p><br></p><p>20% OFF - JOIN US! - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbXJJckppTThSXzNVUXFOWkJKWE5OT2hPWUp2UXxBQ3Jtc0trM0ZCOVYxdTZITk56Y1hMVExOdHFtbDdJMTVBUkVZSWhQcVc1aEtIZXJTUG9wRXFEVVZoVVBmbzU4SmhzOHAxamFWSndQa2FhaEVzelBjc01PYzRSZWJZRzZqWHV4V3hVYlU0MTNjdzdyOEx3RVZ0RQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2Fjoinffscout&amp;v=BJSA-U_ZY7g">https://bit.ly/joinffscout</a></p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>]]>
