        <![CDATA[<p>Harry and Sonaldo drop by to answer the FPL community's 'burning questions'. After bringing in Crystal Palace's goal scoring hero Eze into his team in GW22, Harry is in fine mood going into GW23. Andy is pretty happy too, after his side South Korea mounted one of the greatest comebacks in international football. </p><p><br></p><p>Want to win at FPL? 20% OFF - JOIN US! - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbTQ1dzBXSkFvV2VHT2xyQWFCdlh6SW5BdC1Md3xBQ3Jtc0trZ3BsWmVWTUpoUlQ0RGg2LUpQRkItdE5kRk5Gd3dldHJpR1BSVGNRck4zMTJDZU5CMHlwV281c1RiR0N4eV9LR3NLTU5yRjRrTlBvcXhIdWpfLWZaMF9yUUctMFFlRDdtaE5iQ2hZa1A1SVhHeGFaYw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2Fjoinffscout&amp;v=OasgLKLa3AI">https://bit.ly/joinffscout</a></p><p><br></p><p> Now is THE BEST time to join FFScout as a member and get everything mentioned and much, much more. Join the Home of Fantasy Football TODAY and save 20% at Pre-Season prices!</p><p>Want to join the Home of Fantasy Football?!</p><p><br></p><p>20% OFF - JOIN US! - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbXNGSjd6NDBRT1ZCbGZhQkIxNTZPV3ctbk9qUXxBQ3Jtc0tsRUdESU02VDhtSENjeG1HMUdyWUluNWI5U2VFZmEyOXhMYV83bEdqRHBLbzRqTFBPamozd0N2SWZQZ2JKZnZOWVNzb091SGNPWmcyUnBpNTRxZjJLb29uYWVGbmNzV2h4RXNlUy0wc2V4YkpmdS1Obw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2Fjoinffscout&amp;v=OasgLKLa3AI">https://bit.ly/joinffscout</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━ </p><p>️ Subscribe to the channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa0JKSkxOQXFlMVdGUzF1TjlGWGt1T3dVWGtId3xBQ3Jtc0tuWXc1T1NJZml5aXNzRm5rS0JINzl6d2F4LU9ocXZCOTlIMzgzbzlmd0pyWGxNMDVPanIwZEp3c1VMMGZ6SDcxYmVVTzJaWGI3LWt4cDJtQnNoRUpNM3F3WXBnQjVyX3UxR3plY0tQYWZqaElGQ2VRdw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F3yg0I28&amp;v=OasgLKLa3AI">https://bit.ly/3yg0I28</a></p><p> ━━━━━━━━━━━━━ </p><p> All our video content is also available as audio only, on Spotify, Apple, or anywhere else you get your podcast