      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>Joe looks at the Fantasy Football Scout pundits' predictions for the best low owned players who are set to impress during the second half of this season. Who will the likes of FPL Blackbox's Az, and FPL Wire's Lateriser and Pras select?</p><p><br></p><p>Who are your top tips for second half of the season stars? Let us know in the comment section below. </p><p><br></p><p>Want to win at FPL? 20% OFF - JOIN US! - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbkFFZFV5RzZrN04zUkpQaU9ETkZ2RloydmE5Z3xBQ3Jtc0trYzljdGloSHM1VEpKdmVtd0s2T1Boemh1MzAzR3JoeTUtYVczV3ZaSzFaLVF2a0hTRzRaZ1llbGZIeGNCQnJOaTZDQXpIWkkxeFd2TEg0U2hqYktpY00zdzF1T0tXZTFQczgwRWFVYllvVWo0aDhXQQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2Fjoinffscout&amp;v=UIJzKX8ojK0">https://bit.ly/joinffscout</a></p><p><br></p><p> Now is THE BEST time to join FFScout as a member and get everything mentioned and much, much more. Join the Home of Fantasy Football TODAY and save 20% at Pre-Season prices!</p><p>Want to join the Home of Fantasy Football?!</p><p><br></p><p>20% OFF - JOIN US! - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbk1XRDNoRl9aYmxXY0NSRWl6QVoxUXFwODBHQXxBQ3Jtc0tuN0lVdnhFYm16YWFPWlBmUEQ4Mkx5TW1nZGtHTHFoY194QzI3WjFkdmFVNGFxcmZfOHF5NkZfMnd6Q2s0ejlZeDFMOTc5VjdLRTg2X1dsZUl3NWZlb0JrMWVmUFdMMC10UEt3eUJ3c2YyR2NZVFlvRQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2Fjoinffscout&amp;v=UIJzKX8ojK0">https://bit.ly/joinffscout</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━ </p><p>️ Subscribe to the channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbC12Q29oWW8yOHVqY21IUFFlVjRuSFZHYzhvZ3xBQ3Jtc0ttbUZiVk03aDNUSEhLZjVOb3Z3UVVJTXB3eENWZjRFdlVadFp1cXB2d3lvTzFabGVfSUM1VUFXTkpza042dWw5N0pCNEs3N1JCQV9DMTlBZTNsS01uM3JJZG5Nb1BaY1A1WVJUd2NuRDJTWHVzd19ucw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F3yg0I28&amp;v=UIJzKX8ojK0">https://bit.ly/3yg0I28</a></p><p> ━━━━━━━━━━━━━ </p><p> All our video content is also available as audio only, on Spotify, App