        <![CDATA[<p>Mark (aka The FPL General) is facing a red arrow in GW21 and considering refreshing his frontline in the coming weeks. In his chat with Joe he also wonders which Man City players to go for ahead of their GW22 clash with Burnley. Will one of Pep's troops get the armband? </p><p><br></p><p>Want to win at FPL? 20% OFF - JOIN US! - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbEUxZWNZRkxCRkhTY1FzR3NnU1lNeVV0akxWUXxBQ3Jtc0tteTZBeXEzTWFnLVk0MS0tVlI1dHh2VnJYM0JFMGxENWtrSjJHaEFaV0xZZHBQOUI3cmd1UDlrbF9vWjU1NWJycU9iNVBkQmJpYllGbzJHQk9Fa0tuc0JTNVRFcG1qb08yeGhxRXZNU2diOVViZDkycw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2Fjoinffscout&amp;v=DYzt525_xhU">https://bit.ly/joinffscout</a></p><p><br></p><p> Now is THE BEST time to join FFScout as a member and get everything mentioned and much, much more. Join the Home of Fantasy Football TODAY and save 20% at Pre-Season prices!</p><p>Want to join the Home of Fantasy Football?!</p><p><br></p><p>20% OFF - JOIN US! - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbVZqVWplZkRfb0NPUUdzRmM4dXlQR0s5R1V0d3xBQ3Jtc0tuUTd1UjlNbDA2QU1hSzVqWFRWeGlLdEVfbEFzb001UFE4S1dTcV9tZjVUYjRzMzdvck9Eak8tbWlyTkozSENfQXNLek4tQ01hck5HV0diS1N2ZGNFUS1ORmVpWFBsSjdyM0ZUYXF0bFRsVW04dlo5VQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2Fjoinffscout&amp;v=DYzt525_xhU">https://bit.ly/joinffscout</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━ </p><p>️ Subscribe to the channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbUNEN0RNR3lmTkhPWTlxY1ZGdGd3SExYT0xXQXxBQ3Jtc0tuZTdaTll2a3VhMVVxSEhtR3JWcFg1ZXJQeEpFZ003Z285cUw2Vi1OMllVR3dDQ2pyRUtPQldJY2NoVVJ0RE5YY0I4UlNyeUYxOV85emtNanU5dTNHM0pqdWRqLUh3SXQzZ0IyX1k5YTlLZG00VDlCYw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F3yg0I28&amp;v=DYzt525_xhU">https://bit.ly/3yg0I28</a></p><p> ━━━━━━━━━━━━━ </p><p> All our video content is also available as audio only, on Spotify, Apple, or anywhere else you get your podcasts <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect