        <![CDATA[<p>Joe and Tom (16 x Top 10K finishes between them) look ahead to Gameweek 21 and beyond with the help of their trusty goals and assists imminent tables. Salah and Son replacements and their reaction to the TAA injury news also feature on this week's show. </p><p>PLUS: Live chat Q&amp;A</p><p>Time Stamps </p><p><br></p><p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Xm0Mf5A8E-M&amp;t=0s">0:00</a> Lobby</p><p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Xm0Mf5A8E-M&amp;t=32s">0:32</a> Starts</p><p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Xm0Mf5A8E-M&amp;t=199s">3:19</a> Goals Imminent <a href="https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/gw21">#gw21</a></p><p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Xm0Mf5A8E-M&amp;t=1445s">24:05</a> Assists Imminent <a href="https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/gw21">#gw21</a></p><p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Xm0Mf5A8E-M&amp;t=1708s">28:28</a> TAA injury reaction</p><p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Xm0Mf5A8E-M&amp;t=2385s">39:45</a> Live Chat Q&amp;A</p><p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Xm0Mf5A8E-M&amp;t=3775s">1:02:55</a> Ends</p><p>Want to win at FPL? 20% OFF - JOIN US! - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbnZEVHl1WHRQcXRyZDhxRnFZVExrUGlDOEZVQXxBQ3Jtc0ttbzc2ZjlkQS1wRnRiOXNWWVpsNF9GdzhBeF9DV09yTUgtdWEzYW51aVAxTWp6M09BZWNvZkdTUWVZZFNkOEJRQXRJdk5IVGxZeTJLbm0xdzY0YmttMHZrVzh6emRObVEybTI0aFFHbHAzWkhZMzg0RQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2Fjoinffscout&amp;v=Xm0Mf5A8E-M">https://bit.ly/joinffscout</a></p><p>Now is THE BEST time to join FFScout as a member and get everything mentioned and much, much more. Join the Home of Fantasy Football TODAY and save 20% at Pre-Season prices!</p><p>Want to join the Home of Fantasy Football?!</p><p>20% OFF - JOIN US! - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbVBVVVlfVExwcVlEc2s0RTRjWWlMUDNKOUxwd3xBQ3Jtc0ttVVN1ZDBxaFJtNmhXT242b2lHbFJFTlI0aEZzTWNOb1BNZWJLZjFmcGllSzJKWkluSWVnVDcybF