      <title>FPL GW17 - Scout the Gameweek</title>
      <description>Ryan (@FootballChatbox)  and Lee from @FPLFamily analyse FPL Gameweek 16, looking ahead to Gameweek 17 and discussing if Son is essential, or whether Richarlison can cover him. Meanwhile, we also talk about one of the biggest talking points of recent times, assessing whether managers should get rid of Haaland to sign either Solanke or Watkins.
