      <title>FPL SCOUT REPORT: Christopher Nkunku | Fantasy Premier League 23/24</title>
      <description>New Chelsea signing Christopher Nkunku arrives in the Premier League amid much acclaim and has been one of the most-highly sought-after players of recent times. But can he do it on cold and rainy night in our FPL teams?

