        <![CDATA[<p>New Liverpool signing Alexis Mac Allister had a breakout FPL season with Brighton in 2022/23 but can he repeat that success in red? David Munday takes a closer look at the Argentina World Cup winner.</p><p><br></p><p>FULL SCOUT REPORT BY NEALE RIGG: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbFA1V3VvS0dLYUMzQ0JXVWp6bkZRN3ZCaGd4d3xBQ3Jtc0tseWVlYWtkc1FGd1JVZVBkb2lDMFFhOXZlQ0RDMWF2MFlsMmpIR18tMTMzWkM2M0RjSEJ4Q1M2Qzh2clRQdXBlT3l6aGhPQVhkU0QybWc5aXlFYlFtRmNsd2YyenVqbXdqdVVSMHJ5aVE5c201a2h0bw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.fantasyfootballscout.co.uk%2F2023%2F06%2F08%2Ffpl-new-signings-will-mac-allister-be-worth-buying-at-liverpool%2F&amp;v=pgCMc76ZmHw">https://www.fantasyfootballscout.co.u...</a></p><p><br></p><p>23/24 PRE-SEASON GUIDE: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbUk2YldjTUNCcWVuN1dfaV8wckZKdnZoZENSd3xBQ3Jtc0ttOExCMHRJSjhuTG1VWDM1MncyRmZ2eDRWWGYzOTZyWGF2NjlvSlJwMU5KbWYwZW1FaUNWTEowa0h2TDg3LWd1Uzh1bmtBXzFjbnZsX1pXQWZReVVLalNsRldoOEp2ZGNpZWhpb2EwUkg0Q2dfalgwYw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.fantasyfootballscout.co.uk%2Ffpl-pre-season-2023-24-guide-tips-best-players-fixtures-transfers-more%2F&amp;v=pgCMc76ZmHw">https://www.fantasyfootballscout.co.u...</a></p><p><br></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✔️ Subscribe to the channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbVhzaUtIOXgzMTdrZFNMRWpHeEJrMlByRk5uUXxBQ3Jtc0trU2lsWEVSQmFReVVldTlUcjVhMDZtUkpKSExyOVVPVnVxdEJDUGpNeEQydndPMURUZWdkWDVSajgxRVAzMjVCNTFYay1uVmZXanhlbmpfd0RpdlZkT0tDOXpnck5RYndpdkRTTGJKQmpUd3ZnTkJ1UQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F3yg0I28&amp;v=pgCMc76ZmHw">https://bit.ly/3yg0I28</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>All our video content is also available as audio only, on Spotify, Apple, or anywhere else you get your podcasts <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbWJrb0xvRjRINjRtMkVBTzNtb3g5UGFMN3lVd3xBQ3Jtc0trQTc2