      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>The best new FPL players are out there already. It's our job to find them before your friends do. With that in mind, David Munday examines Brentford's new goalkeeper Mark Flekken and whether he can be the new David Raya.</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>Scoutcast Community League standings <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqazg5b0FLSlc5YXhxZkIxUlFIVUxGbUpUd2kxZ3xBQ3Jtc0tsbTVab3pzaUdMVE1mQjRoUFhfZkY2WWpsWS11QUlYNnVKQ25UMHBfUFF4U2VyLWNyeEtVVG1RSjBSRm9nV1N4cnREckl4dFVhRVY5Z2M1SDlxREZOdXpER0xXRHdEVnU4TmVabVRZRXd4UjVYSHZMaw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Ffantasy.premierleague.com%2Flea..&amp;v=8MZxHnmOLUY">https://fantasy.premierleague.com/lea..</a>.</p><p>Scoutcast Community League code - myt9g1</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✔️ Subscribe to the channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbGhsUFJrQ3JxV212a1NxNlFpLW9Sa0I4ZmQ3QXxBQ3Jtc0ttRW83YzRWNGVhRVdhT3o3QkVHdHlOaHhYbGxMNktrLUdDbmg0djNKTEtPUVM3WDZaNzVienZfdUxyY3ZaS2FmRXRBSTB2TFZzcGZudHJmZEFMbjAxaXFNSFN3WUhGZWVueWZVNFotV1JSa2hUQmwtaw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F3yg0I28&amp;v=8MZxHnmOLUY">https://bit.ly/3yg0I28</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>All our video content is also available as audio only, on Spotify, Apple, or anywhere else you get your podcasts <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbC1NTzRCdlNjV1VnQUkyaFJtalc1cTlhSzdrZ3xBQ3Jtc0tsTjduQ2w0eE9PY3Myc1FZRDlQQU1IcC1YbWhNMDBEazdpVDUtZzE1VTZLeVo5V0lmNHhhS0h1TlJuUDBGX3RoY09BX0xaLWhEUnptbmhoLVdTYXloZGFrM1lhLUlFMGZ0RXRXbkhkLWQ2TnlUU1F1QQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Flinktr.ee%2FFantasyFootballScout&amp;v=8MZxHnmOLUY">https://linktr.ee/FantasyFootballScout</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✍️ Be Better at FPL: Click here to sign up for a FFScout Membership - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbm14NFQ3SDlMZHRUamhTSF9FcDJ1WjVDY1ZsQXxBQ3Jtc0tuSkxvMmRhYUF6dlNfUEt4QmdkbGpsZmljWUswN1o