      <description>David Munday is joined by FPL winner Ali Jahangirov, who held off the competition thanks to Callum Wilson, Ethan Pinnock and some very pragmatic deployment of chips. We find out the secret to his success, which came just 12 months after finishing 215th in 2021/22.
