    <item>
      <title>FPL SEASON REVIEW | Best Defenders | Fantasy Premier League 22/23</title>
      <description>FPL defenders were cut from a cheaper cloth in 2022/23 as the first time 'Big at the Back' became popular for Gameweek 1 proved to be a false dawn.
David Munday and Marc Jobling assess the best defenders of the campaign as part of the Fantasy Football Scout Season Review and Team of the Season series.
Vote for the FPL Team of the Season at www.fantasyfootballscout.co.uk.
━━━━━━━━━━━━
