      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>Joe chats to Neale about the latest team developments from this week's press conferences, ahead of Gameweek 38. Its the final matches of the campaign and rotation chaos looks set to decimate FPL managers squads.</p><p><br></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✔️ Subscribe to the channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbVR0YS1hbkYzQXNNeWhuZlFfc0hJVE9aTnJ5d3xBQ3Jtc0tsTXBrVmdLTFR0UlkybVVMRnJ1YnQ0YWFmdDV0dE1jWGt6cHhCb2VpbDVQbGdSZURqMnVodWQzUm91bnJfV3R1TkpyMWhQZHZoZTRXOURiSVVSWV9jSnB2aE92dloxV3JISnR3ZWRNc3lweWZjV0xGVQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F3yg0I28&amp;v=mn4RvIWGJ3Q">https://bit.ly/3yg0I28</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>All our video content is also available as audio only, on Spotify, Apple, or anywhere else you get your podcasts <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbGFPUEN2VzdUbFVTMjVXUGZDM2Mtd3FUOHFnQXxBQ3Jtc0tuYkZxSVBDaFVTTkpYVW1WZk10V045TUtXc2RRdmZzVi1ZUVZURnlFYmREemlZcmc0V0pXcUtiOEhYZ1MzSWdDdEw1UDlCUWk4YU1sX19LcW5ja2xVVW16TFVCM0lRQjNBVjh6NWh5V3YtLTg0NjNCcw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Flinktr.ee%2FFantasyFootballScout&amp;v=mn4RvIWGJ3Q">https://linktr.ee/FantasyFootballScout</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✍️ Be Better at FPL: Click here to sign up for a FFScout Membership - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbkpaQWNiaXl5djM2TkxzUlhDZVRQbkV4Tld4Z3xBQ3Jtc0tuMk9Ud3N6VVVnNUE1YklkcnpLMTZDU3hYT1NwN3lHTVRVVDlodGdaUURlUFRLUjVsYllXeExVTXdnNEZkMjF1VXRTVTVDNE1LQ1Q0Mm1raDFacVd0X0NMdkRka0VvMm5PeEoxM3F1Q0hhS2dXN2M4cw&amp;q=http%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2FFFSYouTubeMembership&amp;v=mn4RvIWGJ3Q">http://bit.ly/FFSYouTubeMembership</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>Follow Fantasy Football Scout:</p><p>💸 Twitter (News): <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa05xMm16dWdVYkw5a0JtOVJRMEV4b0x1R2FBd3xBQ3Jtc0ttUDVmMGJiazljUlJpME9fR0dLR0JfQmtYajNsLUhqU1lDUjR3Y3IwV2J6X2tLS3g5Zk04UHVTdkRO