      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>The Scoutcasters look ahead to the final Gameweek of the season. Where do they aim to finish in the overall rankings and which teams should they be targeting for their last transfers of the campaign?</p><p>Plus all the usual features, including Live Chat Q&amp;A.</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>Scoutcast Community League standings <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbjBvdHJBTzlEWTBsYXdpM3dha1pKTFExX29OQXxBQ3Jtc0tua09ielh2cklMSDU1VUx6c3g5OWY0MVRDdUlIWWtHbHIwcVlRSmlWZlFxVjg0eDZncFpZMGJvRnFHZmdKSGZwai1qRmljdWtrQlhfSHZISUxNc09HX1dQNmdFXy1mS1dWRnVDVWdvSDRmTE1uWl9VTQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Ffantasy.premierleague.com%2Fleagues%2F489731%2Fstandings%2Fc&amp;v=fCXquksM9KA">https://fantasy.premierleague.com/lea...</a></p><p>Scoutcast Community League code - myt9g1</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✔️ Subscribe to the channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa0VTZm1WR3h2QjlWZG5seG8ybnM5eHN5YThTUXxBQ3Jtc0tuTGdFamVVUlFreDRTZ1NaaWxYZmZZbVZrUVlzekFPTkJCQnVlN3N6cGtMc1NLRmJvQlFYRGhIMHA2QlhhdElsS3p6UjVEWFhSUXpFY25aSDhuQ1p4UnVGeEVFSDdhaldVSHh6ekFvMUtsanctMDkzcw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F3yg0I28&amp;v=fCXquksM9KA">https://bit.ly/3yg0I28</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>All our video content is also available as audio only, on Spotify, Apple, or anywhere else you get your podcasts <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbEIzQ0NVOHNudUdxVXE4ZWJtZDlvWWQzc0FyUXxBQ3Jtc0tsTmFjY2JnU0hqb2QyMDU1YWFONWlmRW04dDgwR2xFTUVReGtKMFpKM2RWa010TDJVZGpoMzB5UTJQZ3FiQWh3c0NkY2VhajRJREFKeUxjaHNWX2luakZfVVlxc183WHczNERVZEt3SGNncjBrdUpFMA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Flinktr.ee%2FFantasyFootballScout&amp;v=fCXquksM9KA">https://linktr.ee/FantasyFootballScout</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✍️ Be Better at FPL: Click here to sign up for a FFScout Membership - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbm92cXgwMHRWZmdBR