      <title>MANCHESTER MUTED! | FPL GW37 Team News | Fantasy Premier League 22/23</title>
      <description>Joe chats to Fantasy Football Scout editor Neale about the latest team news developments ahead of Gameweek 37 following Friday's press conferences. With a Double Gameweek, players from the two Manchester sides, Chelsea and Brighton will be in demand. But which of their assets will start?

