        <![CDATA[<p>Joe chats to Fantasy Football Scout editor Neale about the latest team news developments ahead of Gameweek 37 following Friday's press conferences. With a Double Gameweek, players from the two Manchester sides, Chelsea and Brighton will be in demand. But which of their assets will start?</p><p><br></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✔️ Subscribe to the channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbExDYXl4M3FCSWc5cjliMy1pb2NxQkdmbTgtUXxBQ3Jtc0tubUZTelJIUmFxVnhTenpoMkhpX0JxeVJkN1pheXBuZzUwZzN5MDFYeVZzSkhNSmxId3NkV1Q0RU9HOHFmWEdCMVFVYzBTa1c5SGV4alhCczlwbl9DSmFYQy1fVVVBZmpRVGItaXRXOVRocmlLbEFEUQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F3yg0I28&amp;v=08VWTs2nMdk">https://bit.ly/3yg0I28</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>All our video content is also available as audio only, on Spotify, Apple, or anywhere else you get your podcasts <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbmFWWWJxbWpxamxYM29rXzYtN1ZSRllqbkRSd3xBQ3Jtc0ttQTRMMl9IcXZUMjlsVFhDVjFfWkFsaHdEUzBhZ2lqM0h1ajhDUURjZE43bHBpQkFRTlpiNkhiTlE5LUJJbUNkY1M4YldkMExMekd6VkYxQ1BGX0VEMHZhTl9WMWxfMHBCMGpwM2QtaWVrbE5YcHh4SQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Flinktr.ee%2FFantasyFootballScout&amp;v=08VWTs2nMdk">https://linktr.ee/FantasyFootballScout</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✍️ Be Better at FPL: Click here to sign up for a FFScout Membership - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbWFQbnJYeFpYTWNiNk1ZdGJueGljMXRuZnVMUXxBQ3Jtc0trV2NMOGg4Qi1fZkRra0VGaGJwQVlHZFFzNFhETy1mYVhtNjdUN1ZFTWppeVhTRlJHQUlfWS01aTJ3dWc4MmlLTm00QV9MX1hEcGZjRmt5QnZtTVpvMGNsWmNtTU9LcG1zbFZWM05PQzZkSmNuZTdPZw&amp;q=http%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2FFFSYouTubeMembership&amp;v=08VWTs2nMdk">http://bit.ly/FFSYouTubeMembership</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>Follow Fantasy Football Scout:</p><p>💸 Twitter (News): <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbVY0aVdlR1hQTDRPUExNQ0pmdkRBSUl1VDNLQXxBQ3Jtc0t