      <title>BENCH-BACKABILITY | Scoutcast GW37 | Fantasy Premier League 22/23</title>
      <description>The Scoutcasters look ahead to Gameweek 37, when Brighton, Chelsea and the two Manchester sides play twice. There could be some tough benching decisions ahead. Benches are also pivotal for two of the crew, plus many other FPL managers during Gameweek 36, as they rely on some high scoring subs to replace injured and rotated players.
Plus all the usual features, including Live Chat Q&amp;A.
