        <![CDATA[<p>Danny (Move78_FPL) and Pras take a look at Gameweek 36 and the top picks from Brighton and Newcastle. As usual all the Burning Questions facing FPL managers are covered.</p><p>0:00 Start</p><p>2:49 Fixtures</p><p>16:25 Team data since GW26</p><p>24:34 Midfielders / Brighton discussion</p><p>38:15 Newcastle - Wilson vs Isak</p><p>1:05:25 Goalkeepers</p><p>1:17:08 Danny Bus Team</p><p>1:26:51 Pras Bus Team</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✔️ Subscribe to the channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbDM4eml1U0N5M0VRS3Z0TmFJbUUwZjFnb3R6UXxBQ3Jtc0trWVNOWXVVSkphMmUxYlRkOWlaaXVfRlEtNE1nbHE0TDZNeTg1TVJxTGdoTnY3ZnB1V19lUjdlQnUzY0JiSVAzRVAyOWF5VVJzYVdtdUQ5ZHZVZDhWNkpPM0dPTXEyVFUzRVJMRjNmNHE1R0Nqc1ZEaw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F3yg0I28&amp;v=NbmE02jrr1o">https://bit.ly/3yg0I28</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>All our video content is also available as audio only, on Spotify, Apple, or anywhere else you get your podcasts <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbWZSczh6eGVTU3R5ODJyUjN4cDJhOGdqRnNBZ3xBQ3Jtc0ttWF9VNDlHQUpIMXdTcF9rclNXalZ2b1FPQmh3dy1Mb1ZzMzJxQmRiRHVmZnh6MjV2SVYyY0VwcjdEeWkyNEFlbWoyR21wcVdNX2p6M04zN3Z2anZFaVh1Z1FaZ0JZa0NFMDN4MXFLVC1VZV8zcm5ZOA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Flinktr.ee%2FFantasyFootballScout&amp;v=NbmE02jrr1o">https://linktr.ee/FantasyFootballScout</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✍️ Be Better at FPL: Click here to sign up for a FFScout Membership - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbV9oaUJfSkxCNk1lcG5aWUM0bzFKUGpCSDhwd3xBQ3Jtc0tuYXZVa2FHMEIzcXZsOHBfd0o4WGR0MUtzTXo0QWdpbWZmWFRELXQ1eWI5dlY5emFKTWJpYk9jLUJsS2RfVUZ6OVcyS1o4LVg0dHo4OXFXMDlydC1JcWctdTl3dGVWMW1zOXZJMFF1YWozeXJwajZqOA&amp;q=http%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2FFFSYouTubeMembership&amp;v=NbmE02jrr1o">http://bit.ly/FFSYouTubeMembership</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>Follow Fantasy Football Scout:</p><p>💸 Twitter (News): <a href="https://www.youtube.