        <![CDATA[<p>David talks through his plans for Gameweek 36 while weighing up who the best Brighton and Newcastle players are for the Double Gameweek, with a specific focus on Mac Allister, Mitoma, Wilson and Isak.</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✔️ Subscribe to the channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbVB0WUJZZ0hUSnRBUFNTdDBQV3JwZDdDOFhvQXxBQ3Jtc0tsa0ZETmNvMkNreERzY0hvVjB3YzdmVmRWZldpeUJuSGNpQUpXcXZkdWpWZkg0R1pxbnBtYllfb3BOQmpGNGRtcEhqcE54b0ZYaVVVaG5ZRUZVbEsxMTYydVNuWnF0Y0RITzZJYU96OVY3dlRpOXhZRQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F3yg0I28&amp;v=S6nnoKMukXo">https://bit.ly/3yg0I28</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>All our video content is also available as audio only, on Spotify, Apple, or anywhere else you get your podcasts <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbjhFaEx5N0Y1MjczbFRSdUZ1VXV1SWNrdVI5UXxBQ3Jtc0tuWWtDZlBmZG9GVWhUTzk4clgtVUJkZ2plZ0hXajFKV2JjeUNVeWwtVnpZYnprVlQtMkUydTJjcW4wcVhBWUNYMEhtWS05QjZkc2FWaUw0VXVYeXAtRVVXY2dIM0lHYmFiVGJGYzdaQnNDX1MyOEJVYw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Flinktr.ee%2FFantasyFootballScout&amp;v=S6nnoKMukXo">https://linktr.ee/FantasyFootballScout</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✍️ Be Better at FPL: Click here to sign up for a FFScout Membership - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbFpiTHotRktzQ3V1RW8tMmw1MzVoV1NSWVdZQXxBQ3Jtc0tsTUM3N1A4UjI0T3hqSlpuS3BmUWp5b0s0YVlqeVM3YThCM2ZXM0JzUUwyUV80V3NkSHR3SFFwSjVQTlU2d0RyYUtIa1RmTUpNd0VQOTFZNHBhbUNJYjY5NDAwNHRFOGRGeEZqRi1WbnhDb1FwQ0E1VQ&amp;q=http%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2FFFSYouTubeMembership&amp;v=S6nnoKMukXo">http://bit.ly/FFSYouTubeMembership</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>Follow Fantasy Football Scout:</p><p>💸 Twitter (News): <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqazBZR015ZnY3YnFaZ3RhVlVuLUI4S05NU3g5Z3xBQ3Jtc0ttS1hSVktuODExZ0dISW9Ma1AyM1haQWQ3MnFCRHk5VUFOZmdPeEdsTlZZdG1xYlI2ZXYyWE9OYmo0UW83UzZqeVA3YTNTUXNveV