      <title>DOUBLE ARMBAND DILEMMAS | Captaincy GW36 | Fantasy Premier League 22/23</title>
      <description>Brighton supporter Joe chats to Newcastle fan and Fantasy Football writer Marc about the best captaincy candidates for FPL GW36, in which the Magpies and Seagulls play twice. Which Newcastle striker is best? Or should we consider a Brighton asset? And what of a certain Norwegian record breaker at Man City?
