      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>Brighton supporter Joe chats to Newcastle fan and Fantasy Football writer Marc about the best captaincy candidates for FPL GW36, in which the Magpies and Seagulls play twice. Which Newcastle striker is best? Or should we consider a Brighton asset? And what of a certain Norwegian record breaker at Man City?</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>Timestamps</p><p>0:00 Starts</p><p>1:30 Defences to Target</p><p>17:55 Best Players xGI</p><p>34:25 Joe and Marc's Top 3 Picks</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✔️ Subscribe to the channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa2pZV3VQQ3RLTFg5TTR2Z2dVUkZCd0NJdU5fd3xBQ3Jtc0tuNVNYOUM0RmNxbnF4a2NvMmlkVnBuREEyVzE3WFVFRDUtdFZZUlVpb0NGRFpOa2NRMHM5NGpRVll1QTNDN2hDMkx6WHAyZ3RqZHh3SzJqMTRtVm1iRlJTdUxacHpHQVN6aTZCYnlGZU9qemRXRk1DMA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F3yg0I28&amp;v=wh-8rXph7vs">https://bit.ly/3yg0I28</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>All our video content is also available as audio only, on Spotify, Apple, or anywhere else you get your podcasts <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbkJ5T25MbXdvS1lnb0xaRHdkUU1LREhxa2tWUXxBQ3Jtc0tsNHc1TmJ1eXo0ZGhlZE5lWjlEdXlSZ1FfTEZKVkZaRnJSYnBxRTBhel9aazZqaGpZQWVKSTN2ZkdHQ2tuaERHUERkbFB1QXNaLTlBY2JCbUl4QWtGNEt2bG1RRTNSU2dSWWE1cURzbWZVeGE2OXJjbw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Flinktr.ee%2FFantasyFootballScout&amp;v=wh-8rXph7vs">https://linktr.ee/FantasyFootballScout</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✍️ Be Better at FPL: Click here to sign up for a FFScout Membership - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa09najd4Q2RXbEloVTNPbmk3RW43UHNRdFZBQXxBQ3Jtc0trWjFQVTlPQjlmSzJndDBlY2Vjb1otZzNCVlF1TnFPLTBDMUcwSHFHS3J3SFFiSDdWMEc2LUp2VklQRXJBZ3ptS01zelMycE9lWi1uZGR4ZGhWMUxxM2tCRlNyRTBJbEkyRWF1bkFsbU9wRDNXdENkVQ&amp;q=http%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2FFFSYouTubeMembership&amp;v=wh-8rXph7vs">http://bit.ly/FFSYouTubeMembership</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>Follow Fantasy Football Scout:<