        <![CDATA[<p>As the UK enjoys another May holiday, to commemorate the coronation of King Charles III, the Scoutcast crew look ahead to Gameweek 36, when Newcastle and Brighton assets play twice. Which Magpies striker will they get, Wilson or Isak? Or will they get both?</p><p><br></p><p>Plus all the usual features, including Live Chat Q&amp;A.</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>Timestamps</p><p><br></p><p>0:00 Starts</p><p>3:05 GW35 Review</p><p>20:11 Wilson v Isak</p><p>40:40 GW36 Differentials</p><p>49:49 GW36 Team Reveals</p><p>1:00:31 Live Chat Q&amp;A</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>Scoutcast Community League standings <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbTZpcmh4QkdkLVhwcndFUVV4bTZUckpTUjhmZ3xBQ3Jtc0tuWG5jZnJneUp0blRqQ0Q1Qmw2N0hGUFZ1WmpjYktkWV8zbzhmZ05HRVFBcXU4ZXpHa2t6dDNrQ2JsRXEtRm4xblBNYXI2aEhYVDFNZjFFUzZ5UVlZS1ZWbXZhcUQzbmlFRXZZamtjbHRuUEVndUIzQQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Ffantasy.premierleague.com%2Fleagues%2F489731%2Fstandings%2Fc&amp;v=qJMQPv726UI">https://fantasy.premierleague.com/lea...</a></p><p><br></p><p>Scoutcast Community League code - myt9g1</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✔️ Subscribe to the channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbUlNdGtGUHRpNDFSWGFIbXNnMDhGOUxEYkI4QXxBQ3Jtc0ttRW9OdUdMdm5OaFV4U2FPM3ZqYW9aejMydUFJX1lTdldZcU5wNWlISXBtTjZoVWJ0bVRPeXlTbXZGd3F0UWwyVnItQ2ZqN0M1VERoeDBLMnBEYUEyZG1ZelZRSE43MDBKOWVodXF4RUwySjJrUXE3Zw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F3yg0I28&amp;v=qJMQPv726UI">https://bit.ly/3yg0I28</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>All our video content is also available as audio only, on Spotify, Apple, or anywhere else you get your podcasts <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbUxYMnZuek5tenE5VXJaN05JdlBSNTJPTEpJQXxBQ3Jtc0ttUmxmZ3BVZVJyNkF4MG5TU3A0ZFpzenZMUHZ4bzhxWFl0eUpubDN6TzMzczZuT3d0QUN3RlI4cmVQNzNaX0VwRlpWNmFGWW9SZ1VlTmJlZ0kyaVJTdFNUdmZ2MjdKbkY2WUR3bl9tenh5QTNkS1UzTQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Flinktr.ee%2