      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>Joe chats to Fantasy Football Scout editor Neale about the latest team news developments ahead of Gameweek 34. With several teams playing twice, we reveal the crucial line up news for FPL managers from the managers press conferences.</p><p><br></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✔️ Subscribe to the channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbDItTmowRF91ZFJMX3ZjcGFvbDFndmsyNDlKUXxBQ3Jtc0tuRGxWUVZYRGRkeGlIbDZvV1ptVlVRZTFhWk9KLWdEQ2hhR3dWQWpvYzF4eFdtOFZ3TFFQWm9TOHJuQVA0SnQtYl9zS1BQM3FUcWc0ZklabUx1ZDE4TEFoLUtlMzhqN0tBaUprSldIeTlqaXpXRjRBNA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F3yg0I28&amp;v=R3mWNmW38sg">https://bit.ly/3yg0I28</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>All our video content is also available as audio only, on Spotify, Apple, or anywhere else you get your podcasts <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbmVmTll1N3pucnZHeS1wQjV2WVpXeVc0SG9mUXxBQ3Jtc0ttRTlIYk1RYkVyVk14YW0zTkJRanlfNW94MXJpcmgtQWJLR2tLMXlzTUEzbXUtamdsZnZ4WGZTZGJ0TVQ0dXU5WmhiUEJHNlZrUTU1NkxUMDJwcDB5MkpHWExqdldCTko5SlM2bW5sSzZYbm5fbmxYaw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Flinktr.ee%2FFantasyFootballScout&amp;v=R3mWNmW38sg">https://linktr.ee/FantasyFootballScout</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✍️ Be Better at FPL: Click here to sign up for a FFScout Membership - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbHVna1BwcFlQSHhlNlc0MFNMZkZNUGlBSlY5QXxBQ3Jtc0tsYTRiWExoYmFMQXk5NW1TWVd6aUdjWFVFaWcxeUlRQmU1ZjY0VFNQck9oRlZqaDdXejd2NlJaODlld0lUWl9iTjZITnFleUo4dG0xaGpuQWZrU1N6S3gtZHNFVEsxNGgyTDdrTHBBUWNqMDNtaU9tcw&amp;q=http%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2FFFSYouTubeMembership&amp;v=R3mWNmW38sg">http://bit.ly/FFSYouTubeMembership</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>Follow Fantasy Football Scout:</p><p>💸 Twitter (News): <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa3JDeElTVTYwaGJjU1lyZTJ0UElid0NZZzZ1d3xBQ3Jtc0tseV9EOEUyTmxDdEwzS0lpMGRSS21QREtuTk11eXhRV2YyVnQxVVAwZD