    <item>
      <title>DEVILISH DECISIONS AHEAD | FPL GW33+34 Goals Imminent | Fantasy Premier League 22/23</title>
      <description>Joe and Tom once again look at the latest under the radar FPL gems on Fantasy Football Scout's goals and assists imminent tables, which help to predict future FPL returns. They look ahead to both Gameweeks 33 and Double Gameweek 34. Who from teams playing twice from this weekend will haul?
━━━━━━━━━━━━━
