        <![CDATA[<p>Andy North is joined by Rich to look ahead to the midweek Gameweek 33 matches, where Fantasy Premier League managers will be mostly taking stock before another hectic double set of fixtures takes place in Gameweek 34. They look at the best options for the midweek calm and the storm of fixtures that is to come from this Saturday.</p><p><br></p><p>Who are the best players to consider for the this week, the double and beyond?</p><p><br></p><p>Plus all the usual features, including captaincy, team reveals, community team and live chat Q&amp;A</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>Scoutcast Community League standings <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbHM0cjl4blhQaVo2UEl5Zlg3NEY3ckV6bDdGZ3xBQ3Jtc0tuQ2dnXzVpcEV5VGdtT0t6MzhqWXRMdU9GNjEtVlVVY2RUOGF2UXlRY01EYmc1MloyMi01NUhfUTNiQVlWTk9rSXJsNS1ZeFljN1VCOFk1Y1paR2xueVdDeF9XWXp6bWZCTDJkcWN4amtVM1FhU1o1UQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Ffantasy.premierleague.com%2Fleagues%2F489731%2Fstandings%2Fc&amp;v=tBOUonyXo54">https://fantasy.premierleague.com/lea...</a></p><p><br></p><p>Scoutcast Community League code - myt9g1</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✔️ Subscribe to the channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbVpva2xRZ2dKalNRVXVKOGZZZk5WLUduaGlLZ3xBQ3Jtc0trcldVdEVVQlJURnBfd1ZNaHdWVEt6S256VURXLU1iMHlMbS03Mld5VnM4T2pvazFhdWpKVUJQd19POVBpTTdqMEt2S0FmeVA0dEVIV2s1Y3NqVXVSanFhS0ZXa3lRMHVCUlNIejBkcWE0d3MxclE0VQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F3yg0I28&amp;v=tBOUonyXo54">https://bit.ly/3yg0I28</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>All our video content is also available as audio only, on Spotify, Apple, or anywhere else you get your podcasts <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa2wzMXJoQWkycWVCQlRUQTlDdmZ0UW0xNGNad3xBQ3Jtc0tsLV9VVGtPVGNsSUs2YmZfcTZPQUVKMU9KWG5OLVZnX21uWnk0RWNvZkFzWnc4a19SbExMOF9mcVhMZlg2bnZkdnllZW43by1xa0FSVTBQMEg2Tm9FdjZWeS0zU1hYRGRZdXNyQk8tRUU2dXlZSC0waw&amp