        <![CDATA[<p>Pras (@Pras_fpl) is joined by Hibbo (@Hibbo_FPL) to look at the burning questions for FPL managers ahead of Blank Gameweek 32. We do a deep dive on all the major teams involved and share our latest freehit drafts.</p><p>(0:00) Intro</p><p>(5:30) Match-ups data</p><p>(13:57) Liverpool</p><p>(30:06) Arsenal</p><p>(45:22) Crystal Palace</p><p>(54:27) Aston Villa</p><p>(57:40) Brentford / Leicester / Fulham / Bournmouth</p><p>(01:05:55) Non-FH questions</p><p>(01:12:00) Hibbo's FH draft</p><p>(01:17:17) Pras' FH draft</p><p><br></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━ </p><p><br></p><p>✔️ Subscribe to the channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbWRlck0xYU1DYzZKSXRzS2JOUVZweXlxRkZ1UXxBQ3Jtc0ttcm5vUG4yOHJFZU1oQ0VwYk9rWXNhY3d3cmxqVFN3Rk44M2FPU0lzYWNkQk42NTZ0SmRxbTJ6Yjg3Skp5X19FNm1YVEJiMnJuR3A2dzZ5bWZoTF9VZ1NRLWNsb2ZIbTFkLWFZdGRhWTd1LThYNEtxOA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F3yg0I28&amp;v=xYVFC8IR9Pc">https://bit.ly/3yg0I28</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>All our video content is also available as audio only, on Spotify, Apple, or anywhere else you get your podcasts <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbUc5bDQ5alMtM2RUQVV0SkV3c0NvaV9qMDU2d3xBQ3Jtc0trcWE0X3BKeWZ3VVRBRU1ZT2txbW5nMU11Z1ZCTW1GOWo3a3hnUDNvSU1aeW9ZTEl1S3RIbHppOGpCaHNOa2xQVkFkdFRUY1ZKTFcxT2JkaEozSUlPLVlRUTk4cVhTRV9NOXJZQlp3OGtUa01adThWVQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Flinktr.ee%2FFantasyFootballScout&amp;v=xYVFC8IR9Pc">https://linktr.ee/FantasyFootballScout</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✍️ Be Better at FPL: Click here to sign up for a FFScout Membership - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbmlLUVF6Wkd5VF9pU2ZrRGpjUmZZRTVtZzhyUXxBQ3Jtc0trbzJySmRWYXM2QXMxd3llUFFwNjR2aVJaU2RYaUhNZENobFV1THg2LTVuUm8yU1RQNktrbV9OU19laXh1clBiUmtmcFVYY25iai1QMjJ4Y3B0V2sxdDNXSHd4bXhqUEtmRTdPbVdyMEhERUpDZldjcw&amp;q=http%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2FFFSYouTubeMembership&amp;v=xYVFC8IR9Pc">http://bit.ly/