      <title>BEST FREE HIT DIFFERENTIALS | FPL GW32 Goals Imminent | Fantasy Premier League 22/23</title>
      <description>Joe and Tom once again look at the latest under the radar FPL gems on Fantasy Football Scout's goals and assists imminent tables, which help to predict future FPL returns. With a Blank Gameweek and plenty of Free Hit chips in play they focus on the best differentials from this limited fixture weekend of Premier League action.

Plus: Team Reveals, Live Q&amp;A Chat and more
