      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>Joe and Tom once again look at the latest under the radar FPL gems on Fantasy Football Scout's goals and assists imminent tables, which help to predict future FPL returns. With a Blank Gameweek and plenty of Free Hit chips in play they focus on the best differentials from this limited fixture weekend of Premier League action.</p><p><br></p><p>Plus: Team Reveals, Live Q&amp;A Chat and more</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>Timestamps</p><p>(0:00) Starts</p><p>(2:46) How we got on in GW31</p><p>(19:03) Goals Imminent GW32</p><p>(32:10) Assists Imminent GW32</p><p>(35:02) Best Differentials GW32</p><p>(45:49) GW32 plans and FH draft</p><p>(1:05:04) Live Chat Q&amp;A</p><p><br></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✔️ Subscribe to the channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbW9FazRaSEpuTTBQeWx2b1ZJbXNaNWs5OFdKZ3xBQ3Jtc0tsUU9Mc0FUemtlN2pWQUl2Tlpidll6bmdvbzl4dmt1OXpzSVVBS09ZUWg1N3pMMjBzSHQwS0NubDB1blh2UndwN3N1emUtTkhLRVlfVVlab01TMVdoRHF4VVNkMEpGaHlveHJ6SEhUaTBBdGRfNDEtQQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F3yg0I28&amp;v=TZytbUHD7q8">https://bit.ly/3yg0I28</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>All our video content is also available as audio only, on Spotify, Apple, or anywhere else you get your podcasts <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbWFQaHl0TEI3azAwQzU5Wms1dDJMeTg0a0doUXxBQ3Jtc0tsa0NCRE5EVGdYRkh6ODBKa0xiMmlHdWxOSHMxTnVQZlhXaXBRYzNmTGRfMWJBUWM4VFlTR3hXZmh1Q0Y5UElZMUFPRjVMSmp5dFpZaWk2RS14YTVacFh0TE50VFNTNlR1ZzlHa0E2WVNlNm9CWEFLWQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Flinktr.ee%2FFantasyFootballScout&amp;v=TZytbUHD7q8">https://linktr.ee/FantasyFootballScout</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✍️ Be Better at FPL: Click here to sign up for a FFScout Membership - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa2xJekZOajJJSmRReVRMcHZxZG11QWxISVZvQXxBQ3Jtc0trUXl3QVpJdEpEb19ZaXRaOHVhZmFVY1V3N2QtUl9PZkNfLXQ1NVZTZFlyV05KYjEzbkVlVXpNT0NsOGczUE1qU3dQNktCVWx4SEthM