      <title>BLANKETY BLANK | Scoutcast GW32 | Fantasy Premier League 22/23</title>
      <description>Andy North is joined by Seb and Rich to look ahead to Gameweek 32 and beyond. It's a blank gameweek this time around as the likes of Brighton and Manchester City focus on FA Cup glory. Whether using a chip or not our trio look at the best players for FPL managers to bring in and strategies to deploy.

Plus all the usual features, including captaincy, team reveals, community team and live chat Q&amp;A
