        <![CDATA[<p>Andy North is joined by Seb and Rich to look ahead to Gameweek 32 and beyond. It's a blank gameweek this time around as the likes of Brighton and Manchester City focus on FA Cup glory. Whether using a chip or not our trio look at the best players for FPL managers to bring in and strategies to deploy.</p><p><br></p><p>Plus all the usual features, including captaincy, team reveals, community team and live chat Q&amp;A</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>Scoutcast Community League standings <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbm5FTDJLT19SZ1AxT25TdlJpRmxDRktBdDRMZ3xBQ3Jtc0tuUllKTjRvTkdYcnlJT3BIOE9MVTdXa1pZd0lRcHZpYWJhX3lNVXBrSGVvY1dBemVCSFliZ3BQcVlkblJvNEgtN3hHbVdNSDNVM0dfMnVGdWNJb2pETFQzRVEwd0cyNFRfdXFWcUlMdnUyTWo1OW45aw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Ffantasy.premierleague.com%2Fleagues%2F489731%2Fstandings%2Fc&amp;v=9JxrTpo3NGk">https://fantasy.premierleague.com/lea...</a></p><p><br></p><p>Scoutcast Community League code - myt9g1</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✔️ Subscribe to the channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbjlKZ2U1UTcwUXRGMXZwM1QzVVhXSXVhSzlQUXxBQ3Jtc0trUC1NMUh3VWZqWlVnLVhLMTluT1RrVTBZNFpwY2NfQ0MyTERieTB3dHJpV2U1RHhuOEZZeW1Bbmt3VmhIbDRYWGcyTTZQUGRhNm83MVRkZ09mRGw5T2dSNDJDUFYyemNkNzl5cFEybFJYYmhFZDBfNA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F3yg0I28&amp;v=9JxrTpo3NGk">https://bit.ly/3yg0I28</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>All our video content is also available as audio only, on Spotify, Apple, or anywhere else you get your podcasts <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbk9KcWRvN0NIaEEtUWJwQ1BaUy1GU1dTZm1Md3xBQ3Jtc0tsNkFoZW43MVNCcEhsOEd6WTFia1hNX2RFTmRRRU0zQzlha09ZYXlzVktCOVd0QzRtT3E0TlhzTU5BWWdVMFZJc1BQTVc2MnRRbk9KV3JScjU0V3lDY0lEVm5pRkFBV0h3TXdZMjJSaGV4TUF1VTJyRQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Flinktr.ee%2FFantasyFootballScout&amp;v=9JxrTpo3NGk">https://linktr.ee/FantasyFootballScout</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✍️ Be Bet