        <![CDATA[<p>Joe chats to Fantasy Football Scout editor Neale about the latest team news developments ahead of Gameweek 31. Who will Pep Guardiola field against a lacklustre Leicester, a team under new management from this week?</p><p><br></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✔️ Subscribe to the channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa2lmWllDZ0dycW5fVkxuSEVfN3dvSFJyWlZnZ3xBQ3Jtc0tsTDJXUzdUVk5JNU4yODUzTXQ4MTh5c0NZaXBSNkRuWEs4czNxeFRDR1RXSVhGd3ZKenpNWkZLX09iMXJVbERSV0lncmloOFFXZW5WUDZsZ0JkWE05VVRJZ0pLQ1IwN0NrQjdZWHBIRkpEd2dUMG1vbw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F3yg0I28&amp;v=yiaCkF83MuI">https://bit.ly/3yg0I28</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>All our video content is also available as audio only, on Spotify, Apple, or anywhere else you get your podcasts <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa1c0bFBxamlpR190OVp2MlF4R29fc293ckFKQXxBQ3Jtc0tuVUFJYm5DREk0OTdQLWVabUY4NDhEMUpKQVdTbVJQc1hfUUFNR3JpUUFNYU9RUXhnQVlBeWJmYm5kanVraE1Sci1RUTM3Y3JmWHJPOFFmMVdsNzl1b091S0sxNjBDREVvZU92WlhvREFNN1I2T3Rxbw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Flinktr.ee%2FFantasyFootballScout&amp;v=yiaCkF83MuI">https://linktr.ee/FantasyFootballScout</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✍️ Be Better at FPL: Click here to sign up for a FFScout Membership - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbjdKMVlwcmYwek92allZSnU4MlFGa1JQaUF1d3xBQ3Jtc0tueEpHSG12dXMyUHdFN25hbUh4VDBSNFNuS0NkZFFVcGlwSmNtdnNxbWt5VzROZ2FiSWl1Z2hmdFpwRTBaYlE3Y0xHR3ZaVkU0QnlJYXAxdkViZlQ5ampuUVRJaERtQUtTS0xDYXNVY2VwcERxWVZYTQ&amp;q=http%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2FFFSYouTubeMembership&amp;v=yiaCkF83MuI">http://bit.ly/FFSYouTubeMembership</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>Follow Fantasy Football Scout:</p><p>💸 Twitter (News): <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbUVzQk1VdzJQVmNPRC1xN09FWER1UXJiVVViQXxBQ3Jtc0tuWUZoc3FwVVlEYnhtR3M3Y2NsakNRSGRaVjFFNS1OdjRSSGR5ZExoUzZVc2ZwY3diSmIwQzBY