        <![CDATA[<p>Joe and Tom once again look at the latest under the radar FPL gems on Fantasy Football Scout's goals and assists imminent tables, which help to predict future FPL returns. There are plenty of big hitters who could be due a return in Gameweek 31, especially among Chelsea's ranks.</p><p><br></p><p>Timestamps</p><p>(0:00) Starts</p><p>(2:35) How we got on in GW30</p><p>(13:35) Goals Imminent GW31</p><p>(29:04) Assists Imminent GW31</p><p>(34:25) Tom &amp; Joe's GW31 Team Reveals</p><p>(50:52) Live Chat Q&amp;A</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✔️ Subscribe to the channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbV9Jc0FzZmpDYmlxNEVoUFJMSkZPanFCOU1Sd3xBQ3Jtc0tud1VnU083UG5QNHFHWDBLY1l6bEd1Z3hwTUFXb3lkSm9HVUNob3Q2Vmw0OWIwX0ZZSEg4ZXpwSEx6UFNha0hVVU45SF9teUZPNzdOdmtsLWtOdDFFZWxIZFpWYlE1V1hIeFJPaVAxX1pBOGRMeWxDWQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F3yg0I28&amp;v=x8Dkato2R5g">https://bit.ly/3yg0I28</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>All our video content is also available as audio only, on Spotify, Apple, or anywhere else you get your podcasts <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbFJFdVpYeU5EbUNFZm13ZVZRZl9Pc0VwcDFLZ3xBQ3Jtc0tuN2ZuWDdUNWVTMTNKakdoZkZCS0twNkM1U3ZPZ1MzenhZeWt1QUZZMEt4bWtnSFFYSVdlZGxzWUVMeGd5bDBBcFFJN2xQN1NkS0RHVk1NLUU4MGJWdDFKTC01VGNkbVZzWTJHSjdUeG1yS0dtbGhpcw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Flinktr.ee%2FFantasyFootballScout&amp;v=x8Dkato2R5g">https://linktr.ee/FantasyFootballScout</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✍️ Be Better at FPL: Click here to sign up for a FFScout Membership - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbnpaaHNCVjVib21oa0lBZVhLMTlOYzVuNDYxQXxBQ3Jtc0ttTkdjU280ZWUzVjJNT3NhaDI0WXJOUHlfVF8tZTZ1dGpKaE9jUm0tYnFleUNNMGdQVzYxQjZHMVE2ZFBVVFZ4NkhySFBGUFFBTTM0UWIxTENHQzRTQ0JRdXlRQ2RUaXV6WXVacDN2bEk5cmdlZkZSZw&amp;q=http%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2FFFSYouTubeMembership&amp;v=x8Dkato2R5g">http://bit.ly/FFSYouTubeMembership</a></p><p