      <title>CITY SLICKERS | Burning Questions GW 31 | Fantasy Premier League 22/23</title>
      <description>Andy (FPL_Sonaldo) is joined by Pras (@Pras_fpl) to look at the burning questions for FPL managers ahead of Gameweek 31. We do a deep dive on FH32 vs FH34 vs FH37 and discuss what paths managers will need to take for each strategy.
