      <title>WILL HAALAND START? | FPL GW30 Team News | Fantasy Premier League 22/23</title>
      <description>Joe chats to Fantasy Football Scout's press conferences guru Neale about the latest line up and injury developments ahead of Gameweek 30's deadline. Erling Haaland is back in training, but will the Manchester City striker be ready to start this weekend?

