        <![CDATA[<p>Joe chats to Fantasy Football Scout's press conferences guru Neale about the latest line up and injury developments ahead of Gameweek 30's deadline. Erling Haaland is back in training, but will the Manchester City striker be ready to start this weekend?</p><p><br></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✔️ Subscribe to the channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa0lQak9KNmpRUDhMZE44ZlZ6em5SYzA3N0ZMZ3xBQ3Jtc0tsSjZnWUZESGkxdjFnSWtkd1RIdk1UM05Td0lDNXRNNlAtQ0lyTXZoa2x2eC1acUNNcFdqbDBTR1A5azg1OUpZdEQ3c0ZfdmJxTE1EWDlqVUZyYWYyTDBiVHBuTEZDMXZTYkpIeUwxTXhXMmdrNUZ1aw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F3yg0I28&amp;v=TCDnAyxvdko">https://bit.ly/3yg0I28</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>All our video content is also available as audio only, on Spotify, Apple, or anywhere else you get your podcasts <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa2RZaHQ3UktMZmktMFlpN1hhc3hZRGNBMkZuZ3xBQ3Jtc0tsay1SZms1VWtfY0QyWEtrV0VXRWZKbEFDR0JIQU0ySXdEMElZTFNaYkNib1lzQkhDdlgzcll0NnVDVFlzRjJkeTNQZUpJS2d6M1hhUmEzM0hVMlFIQmk5WG1VdHZHZW9fRUE3bHhINzJld0ZlMHA1UQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Flinktr.ee%2FFantasyFootballScout&amp;v=TCDnAyxvdko">https://linktr.ee/FantasyFootballScout</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✍️ Be Better at FPL: Click here to sign up for a FFScout Membership - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbUZ4LWp3cFFaMndrNXlkTmhkR2lIcmtXTTlZZ3xBQ3Jtc0ttV3VpOUhJZ3ZLcW9oVnpxRXNiUjJVSnFhYWN6bUpTbEFySEN2UW5BYzF4VUt5c3hkeGlNTjNzOWdYTGxCR0lRR1F5QmpxbXN2OE1iNjdPZlo0dXpKenh6N3BQQjF5NERHOENrVXVFc0EzR0xKT2hLbw&amp;q=http%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2FFFSYouTubeMembership&amp;v=TCDnAyxvdko">http://bit.ly/FFSYouTubeMembership</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>Follow Fantasy Football Scout:</p><p>💸 Twitter (News): <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbHNGalQwSzQ5MmV1V1kwbkJfN1pzdnZlYTdsUXxBQ3Jtc0ttMG5FQ3R3TjVBZ0kyX094bHN6empocUtkMz