        <![CDATA[<p>Joe takes a look at the best captaincy candidates ahead of GW30. With uncertainty around Erling Haaland's minutes Fantasy managers may look elsewhere. Joe considers the best alternatives this week to the Man City striker.</p><p><br></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✔️ Subscribe to the channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbHpfVmxCUEp0T1Z0Rkd0X3ppdUdSTDNXRlB2d3xBQ3Jtc0tteEtiZENldEtTNEpUaFVhOG9LM19ScVV0V29FWnZBX3lqUk9hbDc4Tkppd1BDRE1OX2tsUXFBQndSTmxtMllha3RhZzExRmgtWHVuTzhIRHNTcXgySEp6VWI0YldZT3VFbDluemxqMTRVNk5fLTM3TQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F3yg0I28&amp;v=FgOBNPPbkW0">https://bit.ly/3yg0I28</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>All our video content is also available as audio only, on Spotify, Apple, or anywhere else you get your podcasts <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa0ZzcEhQX2luUmtKOWEtdTVhS3YxbDUxamZid3xBQ3Jtc0tsNnZISmNWSG9oX3gydkxfU1hoUDFHeVBzNW9QekFBTmxQSjA2V0dLb0RHZTlBdUZRYTV2U0I2NTNoYWxjOXlBLW9VRE92SzVRNWxxU0hCcm1CSm9jOXdReHB0SFE2NVI4VkRNWktFQlgxZDJvZEJjcw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Flinktr.ee%2FFantasyFootballScout&amp;v=FgOBNPPbkW0">https://linktr.ee/FantasyFootballScout</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✍️ Be Better at FPL: Click here to sign up for a FFScout Membership - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbXFHRl91TjdPaEwxUHlWd1ZLdU1xZVBHamFnQXxBQ3Jtc0tsWXB4R09tOE1kWlNVQzI1S1NsNk1tRnNpYm9xbl9fbmpEZHdEWHZGQkpQV0VhaEtwWVNQU3hocXZxOE1uQzZDendoZHM1Vm5wME4tdWdWMF9YSHkwb3B6MzE5b29SOGdsOU9EWEo4aFZDZV9JX3prbw&amp;q=http%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2FFFSYouTubeMembership&amp;v=FgOBNPPbkW0">http://bit.ly/FFSYouTubeMembership</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>Follow Fantasy Football Scout:</p><p>💸 Twitter (News): <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa1Ffc0YtLWhpSWQ5enZXeGM5SFBsQUF1X0psUXxBQ3Jtc0trOGhSSnEtUEU5YmcwdjJhRDVtN3J3MWJUOU1mQkxnOXl3cWxNVkV2dFZNUkV1bV90eF