      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>Andy (FPL_Sonaldo) is joined by Pras (@Pras_fpl) to look at the burning questions for FPL managers ahead of Gameweek 30. If Haaland is fit to play this weekend, is he essential? Or can he wait amid Manchester City's congested fixtures?</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✔️ Subscribe to the channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbG5fTnlqc1pDUGdHbVRobUpFVTh2clhsRjA3d3xBQ3Jtc0tsWEx0UDRTMll1TEM1anBZN2tLdGhPVnhOT3c3ajAxRXNpbl9VcTJUTDZ1QS1zU2tEUFhqeWlURU4wblEwejZOZ3BYVHpndzZjcWItU1BhYXZSUzlFLXhxd2oxQ0RTbmFxWlRUM3h4V1oxak1rQzB2NA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F3yg0I28&amp;v=nzM1fNCF3aE">https://bit.ly/3yg0I28</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>All our video content is also available as audio only, on Spotify, Apple, or anywhere else you get your podcasts <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbnhDbksxRmVycG5tbjJpODZaZ0F0cmtkQkVnd3xBQ3Jtc0tsTXA1STZnRExYcmJ0WmFUaURGRmNmb1o0dlU2MTBRRXE1bjBUNllCY0dZNGhocGJHQmZpdUhGVUVrQ2dQZDZMOHJpY1ZjZFdwOHVocWo3ZGJlSEUtSmtoaVBHaXJNT1FHbDVXRWx6eHpTcF8yYmFMcw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Flinktr.ee%2FFantasyFootballScout&amp;v=nzM1fNCF3aE">https://linktr.ee/FantasyFootballScout</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✍️ Be Better at FPL: Click here to sign up for a FFScout Membership - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbXpfam0wcHZjcmhMS1hSNjROVHliYjVITVRSZ3xBQ3Jtc0ttd3lNNWhWdUhEYmV3QVVoSWlhWlVrVkg0SFo4cDhKSFgzUXdQV1NnUnFJbURLNjFqQW40eE5hUWtDWkZIcU9rVUV0RGlZRWVXWVhySkpzSzVtQnhYa2c1VHo3ZEo0elRDc3VHQ0F4X0gtZlBwTVYxQQ&amp;q=http%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2FFFSYouTubeMembership&amp;v=nzM1fNCF3aE">http://bit.ly/FFSYouTubeMembership</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>Follow Fantasy Football Scout:</p><p>💸 Twitter (News): <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa1Myd19lY3lFblNVeW9HZ2MxVHJUbjZuNC1JQXxBQ3Jtc0trYTlHeTFOcEkwRjRwOWVxVGRzZkxNREgzczJIMEVVS3drOG1VRDlPTzZ4Q2hRVW1