      <title>RANKIUS LEVIOSA! | Scoutcast GW30 | Fantasy Premier League 22/23</title>
      <description>Graham Potter may have parted ways with Chelsea at the Weekend but his wizardry namesake looks to have left a little magic for the Scoutcasters, as they look ahead to GW30 and beyond with a nice green arrow and rise in the rankings.

Rich and Andy consider the best players with a double remaining, the top BGW32 options and all the usual features. Seb is a little unwell but should be fit and firing for next week.
(0:00) Starts
(2:45) GW29 Review So Far
(10:58) Is Haaland Essential?
(17:10) Fixture Schedule
(30:00) Best BGW32 Players
(44:59) Best Doublers For The Run In
(51:30) Andy and Rich's GW30 Team
(58:16) Live Q&amp;A

