      <title>MAN CITY RAMPANT! | FPL Stats of The Day GW30 | Fantasy Premier League 22/23</title>
      <description>Welcome to FPL Stats of the day, where Karam (@KFPLInvestigator) is on hand to talk about the key numbers after the Gameweek 29 Saturday games and to look ahead to Gameweek 30.

