      <title>RASHFORD &amp; HAALAND FITNESS UPDATES | FPL GW29 Team News | Fantasy Premier League 22/23</title>
      <description>Joe chats to Fantasy Football Scout's press conferences guru Neale about the latest line up and injury developments ahead of Gameweek 29's deadline. Who will be fit to play following the international break? Is Manchester City's Erling Haaland available? And will captaincy favourite Marcus Rashford recover from injury in time?
(00:00) Start
(2:25) Man City vs Liverpool
(6:24) Arsenal vs Leeds
(9:09) Bournemouth vs Fulham
(10:24) Brighton vs Brentford
(13:14) Crystal Palace vs Leicester
(16:39) Nottingham Forest vs Wolves
(19:38) Chelsea vs Aston Villa
(21:25) West Ham vs Southampton
(23:09) Newcastle vs Man United
(26:16) Everton vs Spurs
(27:45) Team News Roundup
