        <![CDATA[<p>Andy (FPL_Sonaldo) is joined by Pras (@Pras_fpl) to look at the wealth of options for FPL Managers in Double Gameweek 29 and beyond. Midfielders are of particular interest in this biggest Double of the campaign.</p><p><br></p><p>(0:00) Start</p><p>(2:03) Macro View</p><p>(6:06) Rest Times</p><p>(13:27) Chip Usage</p><p>(15:44) Defenders </p><p>(34:19) Mids</p><p>(49:32) Forwards</p><p>(58:06) BB29 v BB34</p><p>(1:03:39) FH 32 v FH 34 FH37</p><p>(1:05:57) Wildcard Strategies</p><p>(1:09:51) Pras Team</p><p>(1:14:59) Sonaldo Team</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✔️ Subscribe to the channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa2F0NnVreFBsX19DZ3JXdFcxNS1pVnhjTXAwd3xBQ3Jtc0trblMzZGRUbDJaWGpLU1JzNTdzSjZKQmp2aXB0Rl9pMjIzMTQ1c0R3MTVKU3FpbDVnQzU2WnF0MHVha1NFX05EM0VSbXRjeUw4Q2ctSGdxY3R6OGZJV05VeTN0aTc4TDdPVWcwQ2VwNkhEeTRhd19Kaw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F3yg0I28&amp;v=ZFsnoXt-YUA">https://bit.ly/3yg0I28</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>All our video content is also available as audio only, on Spotify, Apple, or anywhere else you get your podcasts <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa1gwT1lJWGREMTI0bXIzZ1V0MmVDMHN5cXAtd3xBQ3Jtc0tsWnQ1WnJWZXpZQVdOOTJra2dXR2dSbllzeVAwZGpLN3phSXZSZzVyUGxXQmhRUkx5NmtvU3FuR2dTUFZNdXoxYWpiMWtBYU9JQVdHUmF0Vzc4andLeGp3RWtJSjBoWTBzWWgyWEZyT01IYmptYlhmRQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Flinktr.ee%2FFantasyFootballScout&amp;v=ZFsnoXt-YUA">https://linktr.ee/FantasyFootballScout</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✍️ Be Better at FPL: Click here to sign up for a FFScout Membership - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbnRDNXZKVzJxLUxUNWZDN2VKcjVUOVE0Ri1TUXxBQ3Jtc0trX0dlLTZhSWhVZE9KWHFLMVg1RlR3N3VCQnVneUVWa0V4cGh1bzUzSWJPdVFRZVBmQUppMVZhUDdaV2J1TzFFTEVFTEVsTVVFZGJwMWhGNl9kTVZuekdjMF9XM3FpR1RNZWMtcjJHUFczLTFVd05HUQ&amp;q=http%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2FFFSYouTubeMembership&amp;v=ZFsnoXt-YUA">http://bit.ly/FFSYouTub