    <item>
      <title>THE SAKA RACE | Scoutcast GW29 | Fantasy Premier League 22/23</title>
      <description>Andy (@FPLMode), Rich (@flapjackfpl) and Seb (@SebWassell) look ahead to Double Gameweek 29 and beyond. With so many teams playing twice in DGW 29 sacrifices need to be made. Do FPL managers dare race to remove Arsenal assets, like Odegaard and Saka, to free up space in their teams? Meanwhile, does Conte's departure at Spurs give Kane and co more time?

PLUS : All the usual features, team reveals, community team and more

Timestamps
