Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</itunes:summary>
      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>Andy (@FPLMode), Rich (@flapjackfpl) and Seb (@SebWassell) look ahead to Double Gameweek 29 and beyond. With so many teams playing twice in DGW 29 sacrifices need to be made. Do FPL managers dare race to remove Arsenal assets, like Odegaard and Saka, to free up space in their teams? Meanwhile, does Conte's departure at Spurs give Kane and co more time?</p><p><br></p><p>PLUS : All the usual features, team reveals, community team and more</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Timestamps</strong></p><p>(0:00) Starts</p><p>(3:03 GW 28 Review</p><p>(11:59) Salah v Bruno</p><p>(28:43) Fixture Overview</p><p>(42:43) Best DGW29 BB</p><p>(56:53) Best DGW34 BB</p><p>(1:07:34) GW29 Team Reveals</p><p>(1:22:22) Live Chat Q&amp;A</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>Scoutcast Community League standings <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbTQxcnB3VnRLdEVxNDlaZXNCb3RmckM5Q3g2d3xBQ3Jtc0tsQ0FObjVtWnNRYzlvUER4OTZVWVFPXzdSQkR6VHNWY3hDY2pvejFqSDVibGYtVldlaUYzaXBJT0V1QnVROGkzS1hoUTlvOHBBSThGajd5bU5QRl91U0RBR2VldzZHS3N3NDR3QUMxMEc5eFVvRVROOA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Ffantasy.premierleague.com%2Fleagues%2F489731%2Fstandings%2Fc&amp;v=oiGcAaialQA">https://fantasy.premierleague.com/lea...</a></p><p><br></p><p>Scoutcast Community League code - myt9g1</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✔️ Subscribe to the channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbDQ5OWZDdklDaFR5eHh6NmxFRTRIbWlOMFFEd3xBQ3Jtc0tueVNTSU1pWFdST2IxQVoxbjJzOHZMM3VBS2Z2Y3NEVWZwckFQTXQ2N0EwOU1oZXM4UjNtcFJCZFVCdk1rbTVOOXE5QXNUZmptVWZadlZPZnFjTXFfUGpLVXZ0OUIwZU0tR0VRZDJyZ09mOXZrZVctVQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F3yg0I28&amp;v=oiGcAaialQA">https://bit.ly/3yg0I28</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>All our video content is also available as audio only, on Spotify, Apple, or anywhere else you get your podcasts <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbEctbHNyOFoyRVF5ZE9GSkIyMFV1ZkVUMUtzZ3xBQ3Jtc0tsRm9KWHl