        <![CDATA[<p>Welcome to FPL Stats of the day, where Karam (@KFPLInvestigator) is on hand to talk about the key numbers after the GW28 Saturday games and to look ahead to Double Gameweek 29!</p><p><br></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✔️ Subscribe to the channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbDlTX2NKaUNpczJFSXp6UXV6WTdIOEtmTlhzd3xBQ3Jtc0tuY2xYNHFVZDlfd2p2aDZkQVRiVDJMNjg0ekpMTDk0TTFqb2NCQVpFWVBsRUxac2pnWjl6OEdhWTc3SXlXaHVTN24tdk9JRE9JTnZyV3FvbXVONUFDUlhIYWhOSEFhZElmZkU2TGlRZFlCWTNTMjMtOA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F3yg0I28&amp;v=OP2yEq0uIDc">https://bit.ly/3yg0I28</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✍️ Be Better at FPL: Click here to sign up for a FFScout Membership - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqazQ4bmVORGc4V0dBVExfVGIwMWEtQTVScFZBZ3xBQ3Jtc0ttMmYzQ1JTZU1GOEdIdE5vVHY3d0dVNzZ5UXBVcXRwWktGalQ4SGlFcVNsNDdPSzBEZGVzT3R1bi1SM3dMZHg1dERFY1UzaTBObDNLMzdYM05lUlVlMGMxRG9LM1BETlIyWG45dE0yYm1RMm1tWTZabw&amp;q=http%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2FFFSYouTubeMembership&amp;v=OP2yEq0uIDc">http://bit.ly/FFSYouTubeMembership</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>Follow Fantasy Football Scout:</p><p>💸 Twitter (News): <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbnc4WFZ4STRMNXQ5VlJPYlhEUUFLOVR1d0l4d3xBQ3Jtc0tta0V2WjRubFhXSWVnNkhqQ0gwU1ZLaEZoVzNBdWZ3a3FKa0phNm1oWkFOZWxhbTd6M0Q1V0g5MDFiN1hLVHJETXJFZWNTRS0zZmFYaGpZUjM2TVFoVnRJaUdtNFZrZ0dkR2RTX1Y1eWVwZUpXalAxRQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Ftwitter.com%2Fffscout&amp;v=OP2yEq0uIDc">https://twitter.com/ffscout</a></p><p>💸 Twitter (Community): <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbDBzR3RjVElhc04ydjB2cWtKX2llS2lwc2xUZ3xBQ3Jtc0tsdGtHbEZyNWxWNE53aWdrMlo5N3dydU1wSFdDTVJyNFZrYS1nM21DZUtOUzg4T2t6cnlPR3NuOXgxbkkxMlJLWTAxN0NjRkdQb2tnZWwyNGpHR014ZmV2TTdvUWNoakdxdnFhQW43OWRMeWllNW54Zw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Ftwitter.com%2Fffs_community&amp;v=OP2yEq0uIDc">https://twitter.com/ffs_c