        <![CDATA[<p>Joe and Tom once again look at the latest under the radar FPL gems on Fantasy Football Scout's goals and assists imminent tables, which help to predict future FPL returns. There are some notable Fantasy Football legends returning to the table. Will they leap off amid a flurry of goals in Blank Gameweek 28?</p><p>Plus: Tom and Joe's GW28 plans and Live Chat Q&amp;A</p><p>(0:00) Starts</p><p>(3:24) GW27 Tables Reviewed</p><p>(10:57) GW28 Goals Imminent </p><p>(20:30) GW28 Assists Imminent</p><p>(37:22) Tom and Joe's GW28 Team Reveals</p><p>(52:27) Live Chat Q&amp;A</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✔️ Subscribe to the channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa1dBZ3RBcU1KODhhNU5MZW5JTU0wYWFLOWZsZ3xBQ3Jtc0ttVDBrbnNfRTBTcldMTlFPMWlnekg4QnN6RlAzNy11ZHpkcEZlWXAzajFhVDkxRUZvWjlpd19PSDJFUEtKNWptdmFQLWJUTTdfVFRWWlNvczRKZUstVWNqWEtsUlpGdkhPbGRPdUQ3NTBUR2VhWlM4aw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F3yg0I28&amp;v=yKSby8ZY7cg">https://bit.ly/3yg0I28</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>All our video content is also available as audio only, on Spotify, Apple, or anywhere else you get your podcasts <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbDY5S0ZKczNtM25QVS1XaG9pemp6Q0ZRTHlnQXxBQ3Jtc0tsR05yV3RPRG0yRGFIVnEzaWJmSFdneFhlQ3N1NkF1b2dWQUhvRFVjQ0JJNTVIdjRmMi01aU5zRzYzLUhNeXhkQkRPTU1CMmZpR2cwNDRVWlZRNm50LTliNE94OGZiOEE0eDNubURrdlBqNk56MERROA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Flinktr.ee%2FFantasyFootballScout&amp;v=yKSby8ZY7cg">https://linktr.ee/FantasyFootballScout</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✍️ Be Better at FPL: Click here to sign up for a FFScout Membership - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbWFMMjE4LUhhR3M3c29kMjJObU43ZlBWZENRZ3xBQ3Jtc0ttWGxfWFpCOFdOZWlBeWNhU1FScHM5MlFEVFpuaGRJWjhxTFZiWUVhLTZyYkR6ajRvNUlSZFg2UmVmQXBnT0xFblcxYTRObDRBNUM5b3ZpTDlZcnl0UjhMNW9yQUxPeEIzeFJhSHZPeU9sWmFKUUl4OA&amp;q=http%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2FFFSYouTubeMembership&amp;v=