      <title>WHICH DOUBLE GAMEWEEKERS START? | FPL GW27 Team News | Fantasy Premier League 22/23</title>
      <description>Joe and Marc look at the latest team and injuries news ahead of the Fantasy Premier League Gameweek 27 deadline. With four team playing twice they will paying close attention to news from their managers. Fantasy Football Scout writer Marc stepped in for a sidelined Neale, who will be back next week.
(00:00) Start
(1:50) Bournemouth vs Liverpool
(4:31) Everton vs Brentford
(6:32) Leeds vs Brighton
(10:24) Leicester vs Chelsea
(13:20) Spurs vs Forest
(15:06) Palace vs Man City
(17:14) Fulham vs Arsenal
(20:08) Man United vs Southampton
(22:11) West Ham vs Aston Villa
(24:41) Newcastle vs Wolves
(27:00) Round Up
(29:20) Outro

