      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>Andy is joined by Seb, who is filling in for Pras while he is on annual leave, to tackle the latest burning questions facing FPL managers. How will Liverpool's demolition of Manchester United at the weekend alter their plans? What are the best strategies ahead? And who makes their Double Gameweek teams this weekend and beyond?</p><p><br></p><p>Plus: Gameweek 27 Team Reveals and Live Chat Q&amp;A</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>(0:00) Intro &amp; Reflections</p><p>(7:34) GW27 fixtures, chip usage, eo</p><p>(10:05) Brighton</p><p>(33:51) Brentford (Toney)</p><p>(39:28) WC27 Draft (FPL_Jan)</p><p>(47:11) WC27 Draft (fpl_tactician)</p><p>(50:00) WC27 Draft (Seb)</p><p>(51:42) WC28 Draft (FPL_Kante)</p><p>(56:24) Sonaldo Team</p><p>(58:03) Seb Team &amp; Discussion </p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✔️ Subscribe to the channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbFRseVU4QTZYTzFXdUVBSjNzRVA2TDJXRUw4UXxBQ3Jtc0ttcmd2MXlWcjltaHkxVGlrMHNwdktLT1dxazVmUXhtZXVQVUx6dm1mZzd6WFJSNFZiSndoSFVaZXZ3amstM3lYalUydV9Dd0JTaENCZXFsLXBBMF8tZHZmZjJjX25xMDhXdWN2TXBHQlM4T2dqdWtQMA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F3yg0I28&amp;v=Dk7yzpaSOCQ">https://bit.ly/3yg0I28</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✍️ Be Better at FPL: Click here to sign up for a FFScout Membership - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbjYwb0VOV0FGM29SWGFUTTdBX1dmanhRa0R6Z3xBQ3Jtc0tubUdxR0NJTUVBYmlkanItVVE3Y3g3VV80M0xFREtVMWZqNTcwdmtyT0pIemIzR3dmNk5YUExFbVMxOFlXVWh2cUdJMVlFN0VRdDNESGhKUHZnQmxGQ3h5ZzJCN3RzZWhIVjhfdnd6d28zUVpZMTJ1Yw&amp;q=http%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2FFFSYouTubeMembership&amp;v=Dk7yzpaSOCQ">http://bit.ly/FFSYouTubeMembership</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>Follow Fantasy Football Scout:</p><p>💸 Twitter (News): <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbVBkOWxObWFxMDRzZmdxM1p3aENrdEFJSDBnZ3xBQ3Jtc0ttZE1hbHBIMUNnci1jLVY3M1dlSzBHQmtRVWNoMzdCRUJmTXczbkdTRVlfX0w0OWlzbU1JWjBpeS1p