        <![CDATA[<p>Joe and Tom once again look at the latest under the radar FPL gems on Fantasy Football Scout's goals and assists imminent tables. Joe is wildcarding this week and faces some tough choices. Which players on this week's stats tables will make his final selection?</p><p>(0:00) Starts</p><p>(3:16) GW26 Reviewed</p><p>(12:55) Goals Imminent DGW27</p><p>(24:36) Assists Imminent DGW27</p><p>(33:36) Best BHA and BRE DGW27 assets</p><p>(39:56) Joe's GW27 Wildcard Team Reveal</p><p>(47:44) Tom's GW27 Team</p><p>(52:38) Live Chat Q&amp;A</p><p>Plus: Tom's GW27 plans and Live Chat Q&amp;A</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✔️ Subscribe to the channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbXhRNnhEck9oM3FSS2RzSUoxcDdwUkJ2Z1BLUXxBQ3Jtc0tuemF4VVNhc1JlYllGOHhTS2pyWlV6ZFNZaHFIeXkxcGgyRGZpc2YtaGJ0NVhxenJNVDBmOFdsd3FGT0x3U0FJWUR5Tm90Vk9iTHVCRmFRM0hOOURrbEhheTJpUzh0cUgtMWxFMnRJQ0FqQ2dOekxiVQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F3yg0I28&amp;v=prbWT0pEKcc">https://bit.ly/3yg0I28</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✍️ Be Better at FPL: Click here to sign up for a FFScout Membership - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbHFsclY1dURMTXpzYnFkbDBsMzhwVWxlN3ZDd3xBQ3Jtc0ttcmJ3bUJWNG1faE85bXNtNWIyVWVuTHB0QjhzM0szc3FCNlVYWVU5VlVsM3lmOEllZWpzcFNQRlB1N1hwaUsyOWI4VzdVeThsSG9BM0hBaTEwcXBDRXdqUW1WTGRxWml0RnFOWDkzanVLaGJhdmdFcw&amp;q=http%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2FFFSYouTubeMembership&amp;v=prbWT0pEKcc">http://bit.ly/FFSYouTubeMembership</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>Follow Fantasy Football Scout:</p><p>💸 Twitter (News): <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbjhzSkZxWURLTHB0RjNVQ3VXc0VoOTNMNG4zUXxBQ3Jtc0tud2RaSXFZYjRzb3VZcGhLOTQzRGxpdmE0UUt3VndHZi1RNlUwMVJaanJfZEd2ZkxZM1dwNk93aEhfSU9vdHFkU3hZdWc4QkVKSDRhVjRKb0VTbW85bmN3LVFIN0tKVWFDNHlacmVnMXk0NndvX19Ecw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Ftwitter.com%2Fffscout&amp;v=prbWT0pEKcc">https://twitter.com/ffscout</a></p><p>💸 Twitte