      <description>Andy (@FPLMode), Rich (@flapjackfpl) and Seb (@SebWassell) look back at their wildcards, which Liverpool's thrashing of Manchester United ruined for many. But will they bounce back in Double Gameweek 27? This show was streamed live during Brentford's game with Fulham, to give our trio some hope to turn their red arrows green.

