        <![CDATA[<p>Andy (@FPLMode), Rich (@flapjackfpl) and Seb (@SebWassell) look back at their wildcards, which Liverpool's thrashing of Manchester United ruined for many. But will they bounce back in Double Gameweek 27? This show was streamed live during Brentford's game with Fulham, to give our trio some hope to turn their red arrows green.</p><p><br></p><p>Plus: Team Reveals, Captaincy, Q&amp;A, Community Team and more</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>Timestamps</p><p>(0:00) Starts</p><p>(3:44) GW26 Wildcards Reviewed</p><p>(20:20) Goalkeeper problems</p><p>(36:12) Fixture Strategy</p><p>(36:44) GW27 Wildcard Drafts</p><p>(56:24) Andy, Seb and Rich's GW27 Teams</p><p>(1:04:54) Community Team</p><p>(1:07:13) Live Chat Q&amp;A</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>Scoutcast Community League standings <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa1JKRmE3ZGVIQnRKcENGZEgxdmVZN0tUSy1DZ3xBQ3Jtc0tuOGxIZFlOVjJNek9CRU5icWc2dml0ZEQyekpqU0lDeDkzMzQ2eXo5QmxQRXRHSUJ6aFo2czB3R3JGZEF2U1prUWhiNUJFTmtLbFRDbkVNd0drU1pTeG5fZlIzOHR2X01hX09kb2YxTDV2SWtMRGdmdw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Ffantasy.premierleague.com%2Fleagues%2F489731%2Fstandings%2Fc&amp;v=d3OFfXwBr3Q">https://fantasy.premierleague.com/lea...</a></p><p><br></p><p>Scoutcast Community League code - myt9g1</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✔️ Subscribe to the channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbGQtTVZmbGpVdTRFeWdhYmpsUkFScWE3b0NqZ3xBQ3Jtc0tuamV6U3NYaXQ1YkZmMjJlRDJEOHZHRU5TZENnMFdXRlBkek43Wkx3Yk9BT3U0MUUtZDRsOFE3czY5SGlpajk2cFN0cmh6N0ZmTGxhUk80dm1MY3d6YVVUMjBRZlI0TDV6SF82dGVaVUxLdVBRNUt6RQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F3yg0I28&amp;v=d3OFfXwBr3Q">https://bit.ly/3yg0I28</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✍️ Be Better at FPL: Click here to sign up for a FFScout Membership - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbE04Zkswa0xhS1U4OHV5cG55bEpMS1R1MXhyUXxBQ3Jtc0tuZ3dPOWVPekoxSzNueG90VmFjY1p2MDd0aHM5Y1dqS0Jiem04Qk