      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>Joe and Tom once again look at the latest under the radar FPL gems on Fantasy Football Scout's goals and assists imminent tables. With Double Gameweeks on the horizon, Brighton and Brentford are gathering interest. But which of their players are due a return and worthy of investment? Plus: Gameweek 26 Team Reveals and Live Chat Q&amp;A</p><p><strong>Timestamps</strong></p><p>(0:00) Start</p><p>(3:23) DGW25 Review</p><p>(10:58) Goals Imminent GW26</p><p>(30:38) Assists Imminent GW26</p><p>(43:08) Joe and Tom's GW26 Teams</p><p>(55:33) Live Chat Q&amp;A</p><p><br></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✔️ Subscribe to the channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbjVVWHZDTm9XbnJPN3dRcENrRkloR3FDUzZ0Z3xBQ3Jtc0tuWXVYczVVNy1fWFFjUzZpVkgzbV9KMHNNX3doOE9wWENsWUJMdGdTRnF3cktIZVF2bUI5cHJaM2xpRk1jVkFIanpwWlg4ejk3TTlCNi1VNVVRSzF5M2tObXBnTUtzLUx4Um4ybXJQWVljbTRuaTJPVQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F3yg0I28&amp;v=Yxzn4VP8bxU">https://bit.ly/3yg0I28</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✍️ Be Better at FPL: Click here to sign up for a FFScout Membership - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqblM1V2RfWi1FeHNRQUYyTWdYaUs2bFJyNFFiZ3xBQ3Jtc0tsaVAtcUIzNS1JcDk0dG5mMW9pOWxOSVVGcFczSVNkeXMwNTRDZGNrTEpRdUQ0TzZWalc4cWp1TFlHWWxnSERBTy1vNXFMNGpKcG1nbFRIb0RPT2QyMFhpYUZLckN3clA4a013NThWZmQ4Y1QwS0RFSQ&amp;q=http%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2FFFSYouTubeMembership&amp;v=Yxzn4VP8bxU">http://bit.ly/FFSYouTubeMembership</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>Follow Fantasy Football Scout:</p><p>💸 Twitter (News): <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa1NQcTNCeHlOSUlzb1N4aWxucE1haF9IaXgwZ3xBQ3Jtc0tuMVEzTDJtaFlub3VCLV9hUkNqOFpDeG1JVmRKc0V1MHh6bzdXOERESmFncWtuLUNKRUp0UlhrOTE2ekNQbmZYRnY1ZUp6Y0Q5ME9VSUV5bTI3WHN6MUpaS0doYktBckwwdDZFSWd2ZDctVmYyWmtLSQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Ftwitter.com%2Fffscout&amp;v=Yxzn4VP8bxU">https://twitter.com/ffscout</a></p><p>💸 Twitter (Community): 