        <![CDATA[<p>&lt;p&gt;Joe is filling in for Andy to join Pras for this latest edition of Burning Questions. New Double Gameweeks have been announced for the coming weeks. How does this impact on their plans? Meanwhile Liverpool and Arsenal are among teams playing twice in DGW25. But who are the best assets to bring in?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;</p><p>&lt;p&gt;Plus: Gameweek 25 Team Reveals and Live Chat Q&amp;A&lt;p&gt;</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p><strong>Timestamps</strong></p><p>(0:00) Start</p><p>(2:55) Macro View</p><p>(22:55) Liverpool attackers</p><p>(33:12) Liverpool defenders</p><p>(38:55) Captaincy</p><p>(44:14) Pras' team</p><p>(48:35) Joe's team</p><p>(57:04) Q&amp;A</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✔️ Subscribe to the channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbGhRYzlDNnctZW9XUHZsUXl5QUVGcXhsTkc4QXxBQ3Jtc0tuOVVxSkZvakg0ZnM2Qm5TeV9zdkdkNVQyMlh2SkY2Mm1zQkJGNUNLbTJzX1RsMzlhUDhTYTI3M0ZWNTR6cGhDSEhMTklQMWV1Z2t4UllQQWRrOGo1eGdlZXI2bXZRaHB2TGp5N0k2aTJzOG1tWU1odw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F3yg0I28&amp;v=hYPaLTpCeBI">https://bit.ly/3yg0I28</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✍️ Be Better at FPL: Click here to sign up for a FFScout Membership - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqazk5WHplMEIyTlQ4cldPeXF3VW5uU3M1UERZQXxBQ3Jtc0trQTRJanBqWFJnazh2YzFFbGlfVm02RXRHMnlYQXJpbWtvTS1FRWVpck9Gelk5QThxMG9tTWM1czFDR3VVWTdKY0dXSmNUMEFHTWhocE1MaGhnV29xSkw2eGc5N3ZseGpoNXRpTW9OU0p6Vk4yX2lKNA&amp;q=http%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2FFFSYouTubeMembership&amp;v=hYPaLTpCeBI">http://bit.ly/FFSYouTubeMembership</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>Follow Fantasy Football Scout:</p><p>💸 Twitter (News): <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbTNET1hLQzFGTDlNb2pZemlUQWthYU9naXljQXxBQ3Jtc0trZ3VmYTFLbDV0OFpvUmIzWlp1ZFlrOV9nNGVPcEZ1WWdrajFZTlQzRWlTSWVZUHhqbkZJUEFDYkRZVkkwU1puZEFJY3FQY1NxZWdPbUUzakhNWEwxck9GMHNLNzM5OVA1RXEtMUJqN1FiUkcxWWtpVQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Ftwitt