        <![CDATA[<p>Andy (@FPLMode) is joined by Rich (@flapjackfpl) to look ahead to DGW25. Liverpool are coming into form just in time for their Double Gameweek. But will there be tears of joy or sadness for FPL managers investing in Mohamed Salah and co?</p><p><strong>Timestamps</strong></p><p>0:00 Intro</p><p>3:41 Andy's points</p><p>5:53 Rich's points</p><p>11:55 Fixtures</p><p>21:44 GW25 doublers</p><p>38:45 Darwin vs Gakpo</p><p>44:23 Andy bus team</p><p>53:55 Rich's bus team</p><p>58:25 Community team</p><p>1:01:05 Q&amp;A</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>Scoutcast Community League standings <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbENDQ19UTVRyZkN2RXYtS2p6NHBuSVgwRnNwUXxBQ3Jtc0tuakc1MmJQem82dHp4M3o1SkVYcld4bXBLd2dBdlhYQk9YTHdrbzhaS0hCSjhuakQ5M3VkZ0piMFBOOFVNVlFNMjl2U0lHenlEMUFGb1gtNndSTjB1S294eW5Xb3ZGZm5JYWRPYUQtRmdqaEFzamxIVQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Ffantasy.premierleague.com%2Fleagues%2F489731%2Fstandings%2Fc&amp;v=IEpVNINpaX8">https://fantasy.premierleague.com/lea...</a></p><p><br></p><p>Scoutcast Community League code - myt9g1</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✔️ Subscribe to the channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbnBTY0xTX25LZzF0SXB4SGZYTi1tc1lCUHJiQXxBQ3Jtc0trdy12RlUzMVA0V0JOcElpOXlmVEJ1bHhzV1pJQVlDS3hPT0h6dm5vVGRTSmhhSjd5WmtfZzkwMWVBdTZKb1NwNkVLRng3MFJKU0x2SUZvSHdETEpYSDRSUE44Mjg2eExadTRHTGJoWURWLWJMNUg3OA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F3yg0I28&amp;v=IEpVNINpaX8">https://bit.ly/3yg0I28</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✍️ Be Better at FPL: Click here to sign up for a FFScout Membership - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbUxuRnZhWEtYRzFfZWVZSW14emM2c1EycERhZ3xBQ3Jtc0tuVlg2V1hkYWYtQWNnbHlISHVIZWh2TGg2Ujh3VHo4X0JVUC1NX19SNldXX19QTTdELWY4OG9seFZKaW85dGY2TEo3SURPN3MtbmZrMjRiNUdEQks2VUdIMy1HcEwwODM4Sy02WHZoS2M0aDlnVGZZRQ&amp;q=http%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2FFFSYouTubeMembership&amp;v=IEpVNINpaX8">http://bit.ly/FFSYouTubeMemb