      <description>Andy (@FPL_Sonaldo) and Pras (@Pras_FPL) host another edition of Burning Questions for Fantasy Football managers. This time they go 'macro' to discuss the strategies needed to navigate the blank and double gameweeks ahead. Could a Free Hit in GW25 be optimal? Our duo look in detail at the raft of possible tactics to use.
