    <item>
      <title>More to come from Liverpool? | FPL GW24 Goals Imminent | Fantasy Premier League 22/23</title>
      <description>Joe and Tom once again look at the latest under the radar FPL gems on Fantasy Football Scout's goals and assists imminent tables. Liverpool finally got back to winning ways this week against Everton. But is there more to come from the Klopp's troops ahead of their Double Gameweek?

Plus: Gameweek 24 Team Reveals and Live Chat Q&amp;A
