      <title>Double Rotation Fears | Scoutcast GW23 | Fantasy Premier League 22/23</title>
      <description>Andy (@FPLMode) is joined by Seb (@SebWassell) and Rich (@flapjackfpl) to look to DGW23. Arsenal and Manchester City play twice. But who can be relied on to start and deliver? Will Arteta's new recruits and Pep roulette create rotation chaos and scupper their plans to triple up on assets from these two top sides?
