      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>Joe and Neale look at the latest team and injuries news ahead of the Fantasy Premier League Gameweek 20 deadline. Will Darwin Nunez be fit for Liverpool's clash with Chelsea? And what is the latest from Pep Guardiola on Man City's rotating line up as they prepare to host Wolves?</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✔️ Subscribe to the channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbGpaT0sxLUhTblNLQkRsa0JsVjB3TV9rcmI0Z3xBQ3Jtc0ttbTBibHZ2NHFkMVdsZnlSZWg0aV9kSWk3c1J1OFViZ0Jud1pkMVd1cTN4UU4wM3dhUk1vNnFnX2VzVFNIRFVablZhSW1LUjZRU19BdFp4X0daSTYtbnRVYjROOFlCeWw3ZkxOMzFfWVJMVF9kRDVpcw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F3yg0I28&amp;v=5PeOg8oKUao">https://bit.ly/3yg0I28</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✍️ Be Better at FPL: Click here to sign up for a FFScout Membership - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa01sVlprbFBWbXdYUkttMzZ3MzVzalFiLUlSUXxBQ3Jtc0tsUzZjSG1henRLak14dlREelc3c0EyeTRYYVU4VWhNc0R2bzZFQ050SnpZb3VKX3cwTHVnVXB5X0lyLW9JTUxreVF2TXAtelQwNWM0cXlqQjZTZ0IxaFUzeTlEZnZpWnpzekEwTjM5a29kVHdFbXdMRQ&amp;q=http%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2FFFSYouTubeMembership&amp;v=5PeOg8oKUao">http://bit.ly/FFSYouTubeMembership</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>Follow Fantasy Football Scout:</p><p>💸 Twitter (News): <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa054SmVrWm5uWGFsUmdaak5DN0FKSDhCX21qZ3xBQ3Jtc0tuejcyWUNYUGlDMk10LVlpM0FPNUUxZ2hNa3dqTEs1WXhmUFNFTmRXRVItS3RSY25qNDR1el9Lc3d3VlBZOF9XaDI0NGdNaGdvUld0T0xaR29zdVV0N0tIN05KWkhjMEdFSkEtTmFDNEV1Nldodnlpaw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Ftwitter.com%2Fffscout&amp;v=5PeOg8oKUao">https://twitter.com/ffscout</a></p><p>💸 Twitter (Community): <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbmtkUnpYN05ZQ3daWkktb0RLdGFCaFFZZ2JDUXxBQ3Jtc0ttZGtnNC1QeDZ2dndUM2RWdndqekFTZWEyVU4yTllpckdabkg0R1R3NnZEdzNYZGF1TGxPRGZtdGUycTdLRUV0NjNPLVVhcEE0VVZleEkxb1g1RFpNMzRyRWoybzdGTUtPblZ5UlFnY0ZLX3d4czdyZw&