      <title>Under the radar gems revealed| FPL GW21 Goals Imminent | Fantasy Premier League 22/23</title>
      <description>Fresh from their goal prediction success following last week's show, Joe and Tom once look at the latest under achievers and under the radar gems on the goals and assists imminent tables. Will some notable Man City and Spurs players soon deliver on their strong underlying stats? And which cheap midfielders have impressed?
Plus: Gameweek 21 Team Reveals and Live Chat Q&amp;A

