      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>Fresh from their goal prediction success following last week's show, Joe and Tom once look at the latest under achievers and under the radar gems on the goals and assists imminent tables. Will some notable Man City and Spurs players soon deliver on their strong underlying stats? And which cheap midfielders have impressed?</p><p>Plus: Gameweek 21 Team Reveals and Live Chat Q&amp;A</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Timestamps</strong></p><p>0:20 Starts</p><p>2:16 How the tables did last week</p><p>10:50 Goals imminent GW21</p><p>23:20 Podcast sponsor (goldin.co)</p><p>24:16 Assists imminent GW21</p><p>35:41 Tom’s GW21 team</p><p>39:52 Joes GW21 team</p><p>46:00 March v Mitoma verdict</p><p>47:55 Q&amp;A</p><p>1:06:46 Ends</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✔️ Subscribe to the channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa1I3NnFka09ZSmdSdFVvTHVCOFlsa3g5cmw1d3xBQ3Jtc0tubXJCUm91NW1GRkpwbTJJZDZXVUFMTkVSUERRVEtuZmttcUJ0dHp4MDZiREoxOEpQZzI3ZnhjLUFIWTRYckE2Ymp2X3ZzRlRWY0JKdVVQMUFVQTZDNXFWZm1DcUNMc092TG55X0pkMFJyYlhIMUJXbw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F3yg0I28&amp;v=PPzzGgaciA4">https://bit.ly/3yg0I28</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✍️ Be Better at FPL: Click here to sign up for a FFScout Membership - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbEZURVpRZGh1WjVKV1VrcjAxR293bV9ucE9KUXxBQ3Jtc0trbzBqWG9JMGRud0czLUk0OTY4cU5MSl9JN1RncHlIYXZrVTU5TERFQ1Z3V05ySlcxalRmSTQ3aWU0NDd1NzBacElCZEVfQzUwQU1iaHFlRllIX1hZWGN1WFhNTzI0ZDJ6NF91VlAwVjBjaGVURTVsSQ&amp;q=http%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2FFFSYouTubeMembership&amp;v=PPzzGgaciA4">http://bit.ly/FFSYouTubeMembership</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>Follow Fantasy Football Scout:</p><p>💸 Twitter (News): <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa3hxTjJhcWV0UDBUYmtFUEk3dEZVZ3dfLVNGQXxBQ3Jtc0trNDV3YnhuQ3ZoMm9qZTdyMWp1Vkp5OUp1OXEyTWhaeC10NVZBU0FhaWg3NnlCdUYxY2RsaW5mUDJ6UG9jZHRuV2F2bzVNWmhrNll4aVE3dnI3UzVyS1AwR0c4cn