    <item>
      <title>Who will start for Man City? | FPL GW20 Team News | Fantasy Premier League 22/23</title>
      <description>Joe and Neale look at the latest team and injuries news ahead of the Fantasy Premier League Gameweek 20 deadline. It's a Double Gameweek! But which Manchester City stars will start ahead of their two matches, against Spurs and Manchester United? And what of those rumours about an injury to one of Liverpool's stars?
