      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>Joe and Neale look at the latest team and injuries news ahead of the Fantasy Premier League Gameweek 20 deadline. It's a Double Gameweek! But which Manchester City stars will start ahead of their two matches, against Spurs and Manchester United? And what of those rumours about an injury to one of Liverpool's stars?</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✔️ Subscribe to the channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbnJlcmFzTmZFRkN6WURZMGs3RWZSeERmRTVfUXxBQ3Jtc0tucGtNWFZUaVMtRk9zbzAtRzJyaVNvNmQwbk5fY054aU1VUktXODZISzM5RjlWZkRZd3hlVGJ2VlphTFdlMTA5dHdOVjF4NElXUHpIR2dGc0t1WHVab2wxUTlpUXkxQ29QV1p1UlRPVURycFRDcFVrUQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F3yg0I28&amp;v=haRVZ9P5VAM">https://bit.ly/3yg0I28</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✍️ Be Better at FPL: Click here to sign up for a FFScout Membership - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbFYzTC1YSmJ0TWtVUDliV3JuUmVOVjM4NF9sZ3xBQ3Jtc0tuQ1pzNFF6NXdOMUVDTnROLWxUcVJlS0JGV3ZDcy1uRlFNMlhsQmxuR0tTWWctLTlLTTFldUtDT0twRVFTbVp6dmZFQkJ4ZkUta2ZKZ1JXandVR1F6dkkwSjIxb1pzTzZzeHQ1cXFwcVFWUWFEeUJ2Yw&amp;q=http%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2FFFSYouTubeMembership&amp;v=haRVZ9P5VAM">http://bit.ly/FFSYouTubeMembership</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>Follow Fantasy Football Scout:</p><p>💸 Twitter (News): <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa1FBbGJxVEE0c05aUWVqRDRVMUJ4S3Z5ajZsZ3xBQ3Jtc0ttaGlfcFZBOHRIOWZOZUlzbzRJeXpFTzdrdG4yMXZjVnJBNUU0M2tzU2RwSVVIbTZYVVJ6VmRtbmJBZVBCQ3RrRExsN1diQ21qLVBwTFdhWlBxNXMyZ2JEaFc1bU11blVESFZYejI2UXpjWTVLY0hFRQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Ftwitter.com%2Fffscout&amp;v=haRVZ9P5VAM">https://twitter.com/ffscout</a></p><p>💸 Twitter (Community): <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbHF2MmRBbXF5bFUxZTI5MHJBMlpCR3JyMGZjQXxBQ3Jtc0trUFl0VmxvZ0hjMlNWVVdaQjYyZjVDVmZvN20tWU1zYmpkLUlwZDlNMmxBeEo1MWRXaVlxTjhidE93cHd0aVI4TEdDbS1HcFRHV29lZmdJd040QTR0TX