        <![CDATA[<p>Az (@FFScout_Az) chats to the undisputed king of FPL team news, Neale Rigg (@SkontoRigga) about the key team news ahead of Gameweek 17. With players returning from the WC and starts for many top players in doubt, will we get any indication as to who is fit and available to help with our GW17 drafts?</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>Take part in the FFS Survey!</p><p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbDJTZVhuQzVaWXJYakJ0QWlVNGhnS1Bia1NZQXxBQ3Jtc0ttWlgyVTltTUdCVzhhSkRqM3dVVDI2ZFZqVVc2NDN6Nk9CUjdBeHBHMm5oVk1rMnZMTThnR0RZZ1pmSFpNRXZEdEF5QWRpYW1menZDbDRKemxPSTFZeXdxZzhmbHQ1aG1ZNmtsSXJFbUJNSGlQZEk5SQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F3hIjjjr&amp;v=FtoYpcvUEYw">https://bit.ly/3hIjjjr</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✔️ Subscribe to the channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbEdhTjdTUVRCOHdMa0dmTnVTeFJjMURqRks4d3xBQ3Jtc0trMHRMNEE1bVhaSmZLWTJVOVAtN0tWczFEeUtDcm1nS2NMS2hSVEpCUWJQYU9veHpOdVZRMktjNTV4SEpkSnBrX2loZGxoY3RGN1I3c0ZQVVo4UkY4VUZ2X18talpaZGZCZHNoeU5pQS10cl96aDhGdw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F3yg0I28&amp;v=FtoYpcvUEYw">https://bit.ly/3yg0I28</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✍️ Be Better at FPL: Click here to sign up for a FFScout Membership - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbWd6dHlsVEZXVTFndXJUcElTQ0xOWWcwU3FOd3xBQ3Jtc0ttdlFjWmZjbWFsVTVhVGc3TTA4b0hpMnhvQjJ5TmJpUzc3ZEwwQkZ6U2NyV2RVbFk2T19fZkctcTF2WW5wcFc5dXlwMzkxRGVYbjdsb3FRRXpoMldZamIwV0kwSmdkVllDbXlOUzdCZzExWWR6NUZNZw&amp;q=http%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2FFFSYouTubeMembership&amp;v=FtoYpcvUEYw">http://bit.ly/FFSYouTubeMembership</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>Follow Fantasy Football Scout:</p><p>💸 Twitter (News): <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbjZuSWNDY2FLT1dZRjljSFk3dlQzdFhla194UXxBQ3Jtc0ttQTNmR3VTTzE5UVl6emktcHdkYXluNWVxQXN6WS04M2d3TjgzR1AzVGQxX0hyS3Vra2R1WHdac3BFaG5LNWxFa0QwOEVPeGEzMnlNSFFMUXdRc