      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>The first of a revamped Scoutcast sees Andy (@FPLMode) joined by Seb (@SebWassell) and Rich (@Flapjackfpl) ahead of the exciting return of FPL with GW17 on the horizon!</p><p><br></p><p>The trio chat World Cup minutes, the upcoming FPL calendar, whether player form carries over from GW16 and their GW17 teams!</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>Take part in the FFS Survey!</p><p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbmRuaERmVkt5bk9XTk1IY3llNFE3bTJvcEt1UXxBQ3Jtc0tuVmhDa25HMGpiZ2xWUDBQUFlKRmNTa29BaGRLbkJQcVhwTnh6Y2xJbnk5eDJ2S0twNjdDdUxhcldxd3hLcU5YREREY3BHeWhlc241bmFQa2FrUDNVN1JXTWNZZ1pmN0ZQWldBTVozZ0hVTVhKVGZoVQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fform.typeform.com%2Fto%2FCURRaFW8&amp;v=ejTb36xy_U0">https://form.typeform.com/to/CURRaFW8</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>Scoutcast Community League standings <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbkJ0Z00waV9RVHVRYWJkUzFFR09vaFBtUlUxUXxBQ3Jtc0tuY1ZwYzhFT2R5T3pYUVJkX1JwV2hINW83MVdvMDJuNDNGdnZQME51N3FJZmVFTl9oRnNjdEYtQlRlbVg1RFlqcFVVTHlabXA3Si0wcS1MZ0hVSWhhWW5udkxSdTRqRjIxdWVrQUszTm9YWTRBWDdROA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Ffantasy.premierleague.com%2Fleagues%2F489731%2Fstandings%2Fc&amp;v=ejTb36xy_U0">https://fantasy.premierleague.com/lea...</a></p><p><br></p><p>Scoutcast Community League code - myt9g1</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✔️ Subscribe to the channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqazJyTFdyWUU2Umw5YU52UHZnVTJOV3RMSHhQQXxBQ3Jtc0trUFUyam9TTmFScW5UdXJSRlhvM290VXZWQWlhWERSMWhFRVV1czg3cHFyM0owS3hWcEpkYVo4WUlhbUxESmVaMGR1eDJBRkNZaVpJWEpZb1I3U3JmSHRTUEoya0RDQ3FySmZWRTZSR0ZXczdBcGtNOA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F3yg0I28&amp;v=ejTb36xy_U0">https://bit.ly/3yg0I28</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✍️ Be Better at FPL: Click here to sign up for a FFScout Membership - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbTdZMlZBUUpVUW1UN1E0dzBUV29pcV8xU0lW