        <![CDATA[<p>Joe (@FFScout_Joe) and Tom (@FPLCruyff74) reveal their top picks for the Final and 3rd Play Place match in the FIFA World Cup Fantasy Football game, with an eye on the Sky World Cup game too. They look back at the best player stats so far and reveal their top 3 picks.</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✔️ Subscribe to the channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbC1lV2EzX01Ua19TZEFNNHpHUmlvSnJGaEstUXxBQ3Jtc0tuN1dNY2l0R1R2cGRUajBOT1dYakRCTWg2TmF1SWpLdC1UZTg3UWFoYlRLeDc3WUN2ZmItZHVBdVBIc2RubEJ4dWR2YmFGcFZoZGJEQ1dDWHMwQkF4WTV4WWRWY3VqSXJzQlhhN19CcnpxUGFXRVNYZw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F3yg0I28&amp;v=me1MQ09UCyo">https://bit.ly/3yg0I28</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>⚽TalkSport Fan Zones: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbnZVcm5MR0JIaGctNTVTTFVFM3dhdV94a0l0d3xBQ3Jtc0tuc3RmN3pBem03TDFqellPMG5lQUp6YUNaVXJwMC11U1ktQ1F3cTJteDZYTl9xTWRMRE9pMGMyOEtTdUhiUllkc3I3ZGtNbF8xNUV5dmI4M3g3a1oyNk9mUEpLMjZHU1Y4QzE3dGFrRy1IUTNBaVFvbw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2FFFSTalkSportFanzone&amp;v=me1MQ09UCyo">https://bit.ly/FFSTalkSportFanzone</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>☁️ Sky World Cup Fantasy Football</p><p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa0w0dTUybUJ5clAyU3pSU2RIZXB0SGJOazlTQXxBQ3Jtc0ttTF95SFlZR1gwaTIyaEpIM19WUWprbThJWmVYWW1vbGUzQ2IzM0xuc2hWTk53cTN6QUNWZXdNX2hqV3pSbi1ZVG5mdXB5bkllSVJGNjRWa19zMUxjYlNqQUlZbkluemZwNGdoVF9MV1FlbUtVMmV4OA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2FFFSWorldCupEditorial&amp;v=me1MQ09UCyo">https://bit.ly/FFSWorldCupEditorial</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✍️ Be Better at FPL: Click here to sign up for a FFScout Membership - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa3hpREtobGR6RlF2ejdUQWpJN0lTdk9DX1FtQXxBQ3Jtc0ttSTd0R01xWVRQeTlqQWdhQS15RzFVY0FyZl9LeUdTcElib1dGVnFLUTg3WF92TVotbWFJTEJid1JaM2FVa0U0eWFJRmpUWGs2TnczTkd0N3AwRWlLTzdfYmRKcWo3ZXA1VmtXQVEtcm5ZbD