        <![CDATA[<p>Joe (@FFScout_Joe) chats to the undisputed king of FPL team news, Neale Rigg (@SkontoRigga) about the key team news ahead of Gameweek 16. Pep Guardiola's news conference quotes will be of particular interest for Fantasy Football managers as they finalise their <a href="https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/gw16">#gw16</a> teams before the World Cup break.</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✔️ Subscribe to the channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbVAtckZSazk5bEZfcHA3aTFwSlhLYXlveGtKQXxBQ3Jtc0tuWFpyTC1FYXAxYmpnNE5GZmRtNks0MnV4Rk5TWjFiX0ZOenFBbThJejZkcUNBOWNNcDI1a0JubGhUUTJxSEVoaVdZM3k4ZkpONDlLQ1hRSVhJb19RZDdVY0d5amhjM2psNTVCbmd2ZF9BbjBSNVlQaw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F3yg0I28&amp;v=Gu1mhmiGaKM">https://bit.ly/3yg0I28</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✍️ Be Better at FPL: Click here to sign up for a FFScout Membership - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbFRUOHYtdHNGanNISUUwc3hoU3NGWF95T0RaUXxBQ3Jtc0tsRnJkY2ExZnpGQVVqbHFkeVNMSTBUZ2xOQTZmNkUxV2NncUdEX3FuN1ZHZHZaNi1CcEN2RUk2YmZOcEVDa3NoN2RYODVBZ05CMG1NYm1rbFEzQXZoYXFqWUt2eWpxZUdXQ0dqX19YNURWODZqcjh6bw&amp;q=http%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2FFFSYouTubeMembership&amp;v=Gu1mhmiGaKM">http://bit.ly/FFSYouTubeMembership</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>Follow Fantasy Football Scout:</p><p>💸 Twitter (News): <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbVBja1BtUVJ3NkFlcmU1WjBudWRIaFdEYVpqZ3xBQ3Jtc0ttS082WEpoOTlUanJhSHdIZ0pmYmJkeWNGRW80U0w2cFpfLS03c0ZKQ1FacEpsYUpkaWpCVXl0dm01SGl6YlJxODN4aXloU3ZtTWpNejV1Y1VjbFpZYm1zSnVSb3pWMXVzUmtZWXh3bHZUblRsOUZlMA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Ftwitter.com%2Fffscout&amp;v=Gu1mhmiGaKM">https://twitter.com/ffscout</a></p><p>💸 Twitter (Community): <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbXRwSVZwbGVLcEFqcHFMSXZKd2NEN3FkZVRiUXxBQ3Jtc0trZ3dJNkY2NG95SXVOaWh1SWxlWnN4RFJHdFMzSkJfc2VIWGFDSWhDamJaNF9yY1lKUTE1XzZaeFZwdVE4