    <item>
      <title>FPL GW16 Old School! | Scoutcast | Fantasy Premier League 22/23 | Gameweek 16</title>
      <description>Joe and Rich are joined by original Scoutcast co-host and the world's first ever FPL podcaster Granville for Joe's final evening Scoutcast show before he focuses on daytime video content for FFScout. To mark the occasion Granville will chat about the origins of the show he started more than a decade ago with FPL Blackbox's Mark Sutherns.

With a Past, Present and Future theme to the show Rich focuses on matters at hand - the best one-week punts for #gw16. Meanwhile, Joe looks to the future and how our post-World Cup teams could shape up.

Meanwhile, Andy is recovering from illness - after he took Erling Haaland out for a hit last week!
Plus: all the usual features including team reveals, captains and more.
0:00 Starts
4:43 GW15 Round Up, inc. 'Granny's Miffed'
18:38 Scoutcast through the years
48:58 Community Q&amp;A
1:04:56 GW16 One Week Punts
1:16:23 Post World Cup FPL Planning
1:43:10 Community Team
1:49:08 GW16 Team Reveals
