        <![CDATA[<p>Joe and Tom assess the best FPL captaincy candidates for Gameweek 16. After returning from a short injury lay off, to score for Manchester City against Fulham last time out, Erling Haaland is back on the captaincy radar for FPL managers. It seems unlikely that City's next opponents, Brentford, will be able to keep him quiet.</p><p><br></p><p>But there is a raft of alternative options to consider in this final Gameweek before the World Cup, especially Liverpool talisman Mohamed Salah, who squares up to managerless Southampton at Anfield.</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✔️ Subscribe to the channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbVZfVHdpelM5T3M2RF9XZkpERHdxdm1Pd3VCQXxBQ3Jtc0tuUWxFUVBFTW5yYXp3N1hzLWZubjN1dVdaVndMLUgtZzBGYzdwSjV6MUdBYnBFMzBkVGh5cDhxdmNIVHpiT2xXN1pCdDdnUURCUy12ejhGNE5XWWJhXzFYTUR5emRwZHlJMUpaVk1KZHptemtaRWU4WQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F3yg0I28&amp;v=S0d1f1TivJo">https://bit.ly/3yg0I28</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✍️ Be Better at FPL: Click here to sign up for a FFScout Membership - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa2J5NWdtck83WUZJOGcwZlY2TXNDbWMwdzgtQXxBQ3Jtc0tsR1NEcEQtVG9RYkRQVllmcEw4OHNYb2hzRkZiQTVXV29oRllDOFdtYkh0MlRnU0VVTnRlNWNqdHRVSHM2VDQ2VkcwdzE1TFVGV2NyMG5lcWswanE0eVpwSzVubENhY3NySU80TTB4VEhwYVluaUFMYw&amp;q=http%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2FFFSYouTubeMembership&amp;v=S0d1f1TivJo">http://bit.ly/FFSYouTubeMembership</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>Follow Fantasy Football Scout:</p><p>💸 Twitter (News): <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbENzbEd1QllCUl9sdGc0S2R2MEg1elNmMklGZ3xBQ3Jtc0tta1ZQR2hoUkZjRWQ2My1NZHY3ajh6ajdqY3VkUE1WNFdfU3VrNHJvY2tyUUp5RkEyRDVLRFJIT1hoXzNsQlpKa2hNME1YYzJpcERkTENrZndhZjVsNkRHckstVndOVzVSRHh5Q1JuOUNJT2RrWDM3TQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Ftwitter.com%2Fffscout&amp;v=S0d1f1TivJo">https://twitter.com/ffscout</a></p><p>💸 Twitter (Community): <a href="https://www.youtu