        <![CDATA[<p>Az (@ffscout_az) to the undisputed king - of FPL team news, Neale Rigg (@SkontoRigga) about the key team news ahead of Gameweek 15. Most notably, is Erling Haaland going to be fit to play?</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✔️ Subscribe to the channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqblZUaW5kVGFQd09lVVBQOXlYSDFxTnRPcE9ZUXxBQ3Jtc0trdmgtSjhEQ3lfUk9aT1VnU3NpQ3FrUm1JNTM3VE5pUno1X0N5cWNlMmZLajR5MnU0YmY3eTdITWtveFVoN1JpektSYWpsMjMxMndTWjlKby1QdF9yRG5EVG1vbDNCVS10eDF6NkEzMzZnaUZTSmpXSQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F3yg0I28&amp;v=JTBV7AMhy20">https://bit.ly/3yg0I28</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✍️ Be Better at FPL: Click here to sign up for a FFScout Membership - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbGg2YUhMRWluTElodlFmcnp4OVkxa054NHFSd3xBQ3Jtc0tuWlF2OE9FU3FtS3FDYlZLTW9JaFVoQ1A3S1lKb3JPckRLcHJVOHB5ZXBIMDNnNG5lck9IZXVYZnQxX25zMUxfMnFpOFFsa05NQUpxMnJwaTBTVFpmRENyLWYyYTYwc1BGWU83Ykk4RFB4ODZfWnBLTQ&amp;q=http%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2FFFSYouTubeMembership&amp;v=JTBV7AMhy20">http://bit.ly/FFSYouTubeMembership</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>Follow Fantasy Football Scout:</p><p>💸 Twitter (News): <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa193VW9YdFJuOVkyMjQ3V2FIQkFVQ19SajE0d3xBQ3Jtc0tsRXRVc0NLWmQ2M2g0MWJKMzVDRElJaTM2UUh4RVp0R0Y1WkdCc29GYWJMVVRZbjZNOGQxOUtzYWlweFJ1TGQ3ZlpjNlNjLW16LThXODltWGZfZUpCZmxIMlVFaVNUVGNhbmYzSzlNZWtpWFVNd0dzQQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Ftwitter.com%2Fffscout&amp;v=JTBV7AMhy20">https://twitter.com/ffscout</a></p><p>💸 Twitter (Community): <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa2JtcWJaclVCaGFuREo1aTUxcWY5bWtYMHNVd3xBQ3Jtc0tuVHAtRm0tNnQ1bDF0MzRrQmZuVUNBSVZKVjM0ZzN2cHd5YTlWS2lzcjMwSjFFTWNtSVlBeGpDbk1qeXZHNmRqWm9hc2RCU25zYmZPaXBVcE1RWUNjdENPYmtnTmdMQTJweTZCa0VXTUdhaEp5LWd4dw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Ftwitter.com%2Fffs_community&amp;v=JTBV7AMhy20">https://twitter.com/ffs_c