    <item>
      <title>First Female FPL Content Creator | Meet the Manager | Fantasy Premier League 22/23</title>
      <description>Joe (@FFScout_Joe) chats to @FPL NYM Youtube's first ever female FPL content creator. She talks about how she created her channel six years ago, the sexism she faced and how far FPL content has changed since then.

She also chats about her FPL career history and as a snapshot of her thinking she looks ahead to her #gw15 captaincy and transfer plans.

