        <![CDATA[<p>Joe (@FFScout_Joe) chats to <a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCXGSk5gJpFqPq5V6Ruun8Rw">@FPL NYM</a> Youtube's first ever female FPL content creator. She talks about how she created her channel six years ago, the sexism she faced and how far FPL content has changed since then.</p><p><br></p><p>She also chats about her FPL career history and as a snapshot of her thinking she looks ahead to her <a href="https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/gw15">#gw15</a> captaincy and transfer plans.</p><p><br></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✔️ Subscribe to the channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqblNjUDNLeW9CcVYwU0tsa2NvU0xTZHlDYXhBQXxBQ3Jtc0trdHVtUFoydlVMWWhLcGtFY2oyajBjSjRvdDJ6azQzNFRLUmEtb1A4a0RJSHFkLWFMS3NpRmZhRmlveGNiWWpVcTlIdDlaUEIxMFlRV2hZOWtOb2FnaE4wVXo2SlhCMFg1OEFRajR6cnFpQkN0eW14SQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F3yg0I28&amp;v=ife9h9hVosY">https://bit.ly/3yg0I28</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>🏆 Get key Fantasy Football tips and strategy over at fantasyfootballscout.co.uk</p><p>✍️ Become a Fantasy Football Scout Member - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbXZQZ0F2X0hBUVdSZkRGWFdMMTJpUktmbzZxZ3xBQ3Jtc0trUFg3bEdmbUg3MncyUnJDbmFuazJZT1FCRmEwNHpHOW9YUHI5TDFBT29kUmdFSzFrUjBYd3pxZVdmMTJRVER2WndjSHlDZXpOVDJfOGhrdFI0QmhJdFBSV0tYcklEdWlXRjhQWmJjOEp0YldaUjdmQQ&amp;q=http%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2FFFSYouTubeMembership&amp;v=ife9h9hVosY">http://bit.ly/FFSYouTubeMembership</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>Follow Fantasy Football Scout:</p><p>💸 Twitter (News): <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa3cxREZxdzVPTm1QYXJXQWNiQ2NZdVVpTmJwd3xBQ3Jtc0tueVF4SDM5MGs4MEVzMDYwWF9oQ05zcEM1alN4cG1SQllKcDdHaF9QTmIwaVMyWGpIYkUyMkJuUndTT1hpdF96THpweElRQWhTQk9rcWxyWU8xMHlVMHJfSzJEWFZZR2R3MkE2MGFKM2I3cXp3OHBPbw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Ftwitter.com%2Fffscout&amp;v=ife9h9hVosY">https://twitter.com/ffscout</a></p><p>💸 Twitter (Community): <a href=