    <item>
      <title>FPL GW15 Crash and Burn | Scoutcast | Fantasy Premier League 22/23 | Gameweek 15</title>
      <description>Andy is joined by Joe and Rich to discuss the key issues facing FPL managers ahead of Gameweek 15. Our trio's teams are crashing and burning their way to the conclusion of the first part of the season, ahead of the World Cup break and following a bruising Gameweek involving eleventh hour transfer mishaps. Could home advantage help them recover? Or can Newcastle's assets bring a smile to their faces. Meanwhile, Andy looks for some differentials as well as poses the community's questions

Plus: all the usual features including team reveals, captains and more.
