      <title>FPL GW15 KDB to the Rescue! | Fantasy Premier League 22/23 | Gameweek 15</title>
      <description>Joe and Tom assess the best FPL captaincy candidates for Gameweek 15. Injury doubts continue to surround usual top captaincy pick Erling Haaland, ahead of Man City's home clash with Fulham. Can his teammate Kevin De Bruyne provide FPL managers with a strong armband alternative? Or will Spurs star Harry Kane continue to heap misery on Liverpool's flagging season?
