    <item>
      <title>FPL GW11 Most improved players revealed | Scoutcast | Fantasy Premier League 22/23 | Gameweek 11</title>
      <description>Andy is joined by Joe (@FFScout_Joe) and Rich (@Flapjackfpl) to discuss the key issues facing FPL managers ahead of Gameweek 11 and beyond. This week our trio look at the most improved players this season so far...as well as those whose stats have nosedived in 2022/23.

Rich is bargain basement shopping for some enablers. Meanwhile, Andy goes strategic, as he looks at the remaining fixtures before the World Cup.

Plus: all the usual features including Community Q&amp;As, team reveals and more.
