    <item>
      <title>FPL GW11 Can Haaland Humiliate Liverpool? | Fantasy Premier League 22/23</title>
      <description>Joe and Tom assess the best FPL captaincy candidates for Gameweek 11. Haaland scored once again last time out and faces a shaky Liverpool backline this weekend. Will the Manchester City man humiliate Van Djik and co? Or will they find a way to stop him? Our duo also look at differential captaincy options for those wanting to mix up their captaincy choices.
━━━━━━━━━━━━━
