      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>Joe and Tom assess the best FPL captaincy candidates for Gameweek 11. Haaland scored once again last time out and faces a shaky Liverpool backline this weekend. Will the Manchester City man humiliate Van Djik and co? Or will they find a way to stop him? Our duo also look at differential captaincy options for those wanting to mix up their captaincy choices.</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✔️ Subscribe to the channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbEZWTjQ3ekdvSDBFdzF5V2ZqQk1lZTM2dmpwUXxBQ3Jtc0trb0hFbnBwZmJWM1BsQVkxRjd0U3F5X1RHSU03aVI3a0JsNnVCcTlidmVlMHVLRHR6WDNCR3pmU3l6b2xGUzhPQnRjV3U2WXJkU2RiOXRMM3l2ck1IMEVkY1lUaDYxQ2xnYmt2OFJKXzBlUXBubG45Zw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F3yg0I28&amp;v=sVXyyNJT0RI">https://bit.ly/3yg0I28</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✍️ Be Better at FPL: Click here to sign up for a FFScout Membership - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbjQwTkNEbUFTM2xoN1NuMjladl8tWXctc19qd3xBQ3Jtc0tubWlzWXJ0OGNpdEkzUlR4VXoySnZzSDh2ek1WazBmSFBDNDUxNjJuaEVBLXloWkswSUx5Q3Q0MGt6ZEVFc3hyWXhpMXJzZERsTFNHWVFCUjlqNG5SbWZ4bVREc0EyWWpuX2JzOUpjenR6Rkh3cDlQbw&amp;q=http%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2FFFSYouTubeMembership&amp;v=sVXyyNJT0RI">http://bit.ly/FFSYouTubeMembership</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>Follow Fantasy Football Scout:</p><p>💸 Twitter (News): <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbjNrMWJHbHhpLUs4eXp4QUpPaVIxVk1ieEwwd3xBQ3Jtc0tuZHp4WWVxanBHR09hZkJyeXM1bHZEOHB0bEI1MG9kMHI5TjJGX0F0Q3laSjF0YWUzN0N2V3dwNnM3MVIzRVBUUDdLTGlPUGk2eFJpekRrWENoZkRYWXF5OTducWpya3NUd1lKTDNnSDBJWmM3ZDVnRQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Ftwitter.com%2Fffscout&amp;v=sVXyyNJT0RI">https://twitter.com/ffscout</a></p><p>💸 Twitter (Community): <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbU5oMHBramxoSDEtWFF2bXB4aTZnM18ybUhPUXxBQ3Jtc0traFVOWU1odUFuYUh6aHlyWHRFeENnc3AtMDAxcWY0dmNHOWJCaUZFaUY2ZnlCQVMtREpmN0FO