      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>Join FPL Focal (@FPLFocal) for his FPL experts breakdown ahead of GW10.</p><p><br></p><p>The FPL Experts come together for Gameweek 10 of Fantasy Premier League 2022/23. Every week we reveal the expert draft, their transfers, captains and chip usage. This week we have a wildcard team too. Improve your rank and win your mini-league with expert insight and GW10 team selection!</p><p><br></p><p>Join FFScout 👉 <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbEdFZDVKcUh4WC1VeVQ4eUlhb3Vxd3pjYWgwQXxBQ3Jtc0trTGtLZnpoWGN2TWxLSnVMUjNmUzNUZ0l5b3NVNmJiR3JPTU56RXhaaDBPcnVrMW9TVG8wSU9TSjlpc0U4Njd3SmgtTS1vemMtbFFqTzQ1UUdRM19pX3Z3ZVFaamlkbmZFQnZKOHFLREo4cFpQWnRqMA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2FFPLFocal_FFScout&amp;v=QpiVCBLv9k4">https://bit.ly/FPLFocal_FFScout</a></p><p><br></p><p>🔗 <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbm11Nk52ZXRCQ2dLV2ptZ282NUtjeWVXMzZSQXxBQ3Jtc0trTGxXY0Z2OTRnNWZsRVZDbFMzdU85dUZGbmE3aXNwSXE2cGtIZkhvaFNZcV91R0ZEOTRrcjNLVFJmS2xnUnRmcW5nYUdPdFNEcWh5Q3ZoVDdqLWFtMjRIb0JnUDBPSG9PTmg2ZE9QMklvZ0FqQ2lGOA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fplanfpl.com%2F&amp;v=QpiVCBLv9k4">https://planfpl.com</a></p><p>🔗 <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbXFESVBJMlZDMVQ0M05WSlJsdjlLdFFLQl91UXxBQ3Jtc0trWUpPb2h2YmZhdHhNNjhJZWJKejdPeFcyV0xQTmoyNnJoeG5PSGxyeXdzTFpoMGdGY1QycTdYZ1JIMDlxWF83SHFmckhiT0h3dURhN095c1N6TVhleHE3WEZZaVBsVmNNeElGVUotbHBxbU1JVFhFUQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fpremierfantasytools.com%2F&amp;v=QpiVCBLv9k4">https://premierfantasytools.com</a></p><p><br></p><p>🔴 Become a Member: <a href="https://youtube.com/FPLFocal/join">https://youtube.com/FPLFocal/join</a></p><p>🟠 Become a Patron: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbGN1bzliRThaQW9oYl9QUHBpTzhXbk9BU3FHUXxBQ3Jtc0tra0NCRG1qZzMxaEVhQ3I1amxGT2hCMGtMa3AtQ2w0a2lDT3BSZ3VSaERkWlZJcHlVdXY2YThjR0VXbjNzWTJJajlNRVhwZUFxMDZqZFJUemVvMWNJa2