      <description>Rich (@FlapjackFPL) runs through four popular topics ahead of the GW10 deadline.

- Do we need the hattrick heroes from GW9?
- What do we do with Mitrovic ahead of any injury news?
- Are Almiron &amp; Xhaka options in the sub 5.5 million bracket?
- Are the premium defenders worth the outlay?
