      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>Rich (@FlapjackFPL) runs through four popular topics ahead of the GW10 deadline.</p><p><br></p><p>- Do we need the hattrick heroes from GW9?</p><p>- What do we do with Mitrovic ahead of any injury news?</p><p>- Are Almiron &amp; Xhaka options in the sub 5.5 million bracket?</p><p>- Are the premium defenders worth the outlay?</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✔️ Subscribe to the channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbmlKcm01bzEzZGlmNEppb18xLVdYdFVYNGhnZ3xBQ3Jtc0tsSnZ2c2N5aWFid3Z0bUtkNm9Da2p6VjRoMGdnNmFEa19uQjd4YlFMbzhCelhFaUphNU5xUkk3eS1yTlN1V2c2OEZkSUhRMEdWRVFEaVhpckxRSEtCTE1FdE1IT0VBQXFKSXZ1dExhdFFhNk0xSkEyVQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F3yg0I28&amp;v=4eJHG3VJ7s8">https://bit.ly/3yg0I28</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>🏆 Get key Fantasy Football tips and strategy over at fantasyfootballscout.co.uk</p><p>✍️ Become a Fantasy Football Scout Member - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbl8zSjR4SmZjdUd0dzl1YkZEcXpCUEVVNkVvQXxBQ3Jtc0tuRVd4MEk3LV9PVTQwUnQxMXY2cU1DRmZ3M25CSm5HWmpwa25jdmlrRVFEbXh0RmF0ek8teDdzcG1DSXFqX1FiTUJCdF94eVlBNndOa1VKa1dYT3cxT3oyekZKbjBEYzJkQzlKVXR4X0ZFMXNDWUNxVQ&amp;q=http%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2FFFSYouTubeMembership&amp;v=4eJHG3VJ7s8">http://bit.ly/FFSYouTubeMembership</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>Follow Fantasy Football Scout:</p><p>💸 Twitter (News): <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbUU0NWtYUUhjdmhiU0xnXzM1Q0J2bnBsT2FnQXxBQ3Jtc0trel9adDhIRlF5SnN1OTlFaXhGZWZBRWpXSHlDOENlX0pZSVRDZ3ZkSlRMUEw5VXU2VDZSeGdNdDZueTVtN2RxSlVxWHY3WGxRMHNua2xjMzJwNU1zWXRnZ1o3ZjBELTd3bEdjWW5xU0lGRXZaZnRPYw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Ftwitter.com%2Fffscout&amp;v=4eJHG3VJ7s8">https://twitter.com/ffscout</a></p><p>💸 Twitter (Community): <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqay1mbTJvd1RENS1uaDVST0hFXzV6QVdSVzRYQXxBQ3Jtc0trd0JnYk9NZ0VTVnhNWmJWenY3ZC1HQ0hJQ2JVSXBHSjhB