    <item>
      <title>FPL GW10 Next Four Gameweek Strategy | Scoutcast | Fantasy Premier League 22/23</title>
      <description>Andy is joined by Joe and new Scoutcast recruit Rich (@Flapjackfpl) to discuss the key issues facing FPL managers ahead of Gameweek 10 and beyond. This week our trio look ahead to the next four Gameweeks, in particularly how they plan to navigate Gameweek 12, when Manchester City and Arsenal blank.

Most attacking players, best captains and top teams are looked at. In addition, Joe catches up on Chelsea and Brighton's performance under their new managers.

Plus: all the usual features including Community Q&amp;As, team reveals and more.
