      <title>FPL GW10 Unstoppable Haaland | Fantasy Premier League 22/23 | Gameweek 10</title>
      <description>Joe and Tom assess the best FPL captaincy candidates for Gameweek 10. With Three hattricks on the bounce Manchester City striker Erling Haaland looks to be the default armband pick, especially with embattled Southampton up next. Has the Norwegian broken the captaincy choice in FPL? Can anyone really challenge him as captain? Is this the week to Triple Captain him?
