    <item>
      <title>FPL GW9 Best Premium Options | Scoutcast | Fantasy Premier League 22/23</title>
      <description>Andy is joined by Joe and Seb to discuss the key issues facing FPL managers ahead of Gameweek 9. The best premium options over the next few weeks are discussed, as are budget strikers to target. Elsewhere, Chelsea and Brighton's new management comes under the microscope.

