      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>Joe (@FFScout_Joe) chats to former professional footballer Jordie van der Laan (@Joccki_FPL) about how his footballing career has shaped his strong track record in FPL, with multiple strong finishes, including taking 55th sport in 2016/17.</p><p><br></p><p>They also talk FPL strategy ahead of the <a href="https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/gw9">#gw9</a> FPL season, with a keen eye on strikers.</p><p><br></p><p>In addition, Jordie chats about how he hit the headlines in 2019 when he landed in hot water after he skipped training for his side, Telstar, to attend Tottenham's champions league clash with PSV.</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✔️ Subscribe to the channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa0lBOWNkSlB4MGdiQkR0dmpwODRnWlpWaFVFQXxBQ3Jtc0trV2FQOUkxY0VxUEJybFVUZHBUcktSWUFNNVhtNlJRNmhoeEI4XzROZFlhVEJFdzRGbm94THhMdWNzaHRHWS04WGRRaktNTnRVTVNidmpRaU1kRDcwdHMxazVVdmtsNWc5VU5Hc0x0MUstWER5RDc2TQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F3yg0I28&amp;v=iOdm9NEaEZw">https://bit.ly/3yg0I28</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>🏆 Get key Fantasy Football tips and strategy over at fantasyfootballscout.co.uk</p><p>✍️ Become a Fantasy Football Scout Member - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbUthYU9hbnM2MUE4TzU2OXYwNDJsU2NnR2tFd3xBQ3Jtc0ttVEVsOV9mOU1KU0tjb0h0UWl2b2J3SGFSOXZwUEhjeEh6ZzVRalNtSDAxQ2psRlFMOFVHanQ0VGpmbVE2SGhCWmtNYVNKTXlvdHRtRFk0N0k5ZTR3RkRTXzMxN0xsRFdFWVc0ZWdBd0tLdFB6NGgwRQ&amp;q=http%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2FFFSYouTubeMembership&amp;v=iOdm9NEaEZw">http://bit.ly/FFSYouTubeMembership</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>Follow Fantasy Football Scout:</p><p>💸 Twitter (News): <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbEhLZ0lSUjY2QURmaEtDM2FrbXNSOUg3Q1hHQXxBQ3Jtc0ttTFEyc3ViZTBSME1fMTdFOHhEWFBZQ000WHVUN0lMdDIyeGRubF9OUlpPeWxiOFV6djJkdW1IWjBkYU95T2NVaWxpR1hnaUFzdUZwT2lBbjAzT0p4T0hqYkQzWVNKalBMbTRYZGZlbDJ6bVVOMW1idw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Ftwi