        <![CDATA[<p>Andy (@FPL_Sonaldo) and Pras (@Pras_fpl) are here to preview GW8 of the Fantasy Premier League Season and talk about the Burning Questions for your Gameweek 8 FPL teams.</p><p><br></p><p>0:20 Start</p><p>2:45 Sonaldo wildcard draft</p><p>23:01 Pras GW9 wildcard draft - pros/cons of GW8 vs GW9 wildcard</p><p>30:22 Alternative strategy discussion</p><p>45:05 Free hit draft and discussion</p><p>48:26 Pras bus team</p><p><br></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✔️ Subscribe to the channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbjdvM3dzcTBSZU1CVGJ3RW02Yk9mSlB1YldSQXxBQ3Jtc0ttYmRTUUxDV1EyRXRDZ2lRNjZxVGtuWHpmV2Rsb3pwcE5oNEVQLXp4N1c0Y0ljS0Q3QWtqY1Ayekw1NGdfSjRnU0E3UGh4aERHQ0lESTM3bGs1UUNLLVBKd3lxSG0zN0Q3M04zaWY0ZlZIOFViMjFlVQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F3yg0I28&amp;v=qa45lIDLGXI">https://bit.ly/3yg0I28</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✍️ Be Better at FPL: Click here to sign up for a FFScout Membership - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbUZETXZfank2bUF1cHNHMFVvM2lIby1NZjZkUXxBQ3Jtc0tsUklhSmVuZ19zVmxKZDlEWTBKZDZaSUpwU09ERWlHa2RmVWEwUEZBTzFDM0JYcjFYbktTTnlYV0Y1cWN1RXQ3WmwybzlYeUdFaGttZ0tqMnU3aDJNUDdZWFFqWEJQVGdOTlppa0pOZmp0Q1JEQ0w0aw&amp;q=http%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2FFFSYouTubeMembership&amp;v=qa45lIDLGXI">http://bit.ly/FFSYouTubeMembership</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>Follow Fantasy Football Scout:</p><p>💸 Twitter (News): <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqblhkZHROcFFMVV83c1VaM1N2REtQdGNlMG5rQXxBQ3Jtc0trN1RFZkFaVEtjQTVLSENjcUlPMzB5TktMLXJtM1Y2VDFxcEFIT0Z1ODJRRldzNEMzdTdYMU9BZTlPNEJqNFRyVmdQN0xmemxpS1lTVGRVMXZwdGlGeGFzTWVzeFNrODJERW9CS2JkZDBNakwzT3dRdw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Ftwitter.com%2Fffscout&amp;v=qa45lIDLGXI">https://twitter.com/ffscout</a></p><p>💸 Twitter (Community): <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbXdOWlpXdmYzZXNSRzk0dmpIRFRDMVM4Zl9Ud3xBQ3Jtc0tua3FJc