    <item>
      <title>FPL GW8 Wildcard Reveals | Scoutcast | Fantasy Premier League 22/23 | Gameweek 8</title>
      <description>Andy is joined by Joe and Seb to discuss the key issues facing FPL managers ahead of Gameweek 8. With three games postponed, Fantasy Premier League managers face some tough decisions. Wildcarding is the route our three Scoutcasters have taken as they reveal their drafts, the players to consider and the statistics that can influence FPL managers' decisions. They also consider other strategies to cope with GW8 such as spending hits and using the Free Hit chip.

Plus all the usual features including Community Q&amp;As and more.
