        <![CDATA[<p>Joe and Tom assess the best FPL captaincy candidates for Gameweek 8. Despite three postponed Fantasy Premier League fixtures this weekend there are still plenty of options for the captaincy. Can Fulham;s Mitrovic challenge favourites Erling Haaland and Harry Kane? All certainly face obliging defences.</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>Play Fanslide: Fanslide Link: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa0h1RlBITFVLdVM0eWVxV3AwaktiQUVvbTQ3Z3xBQ3Jtc0tuRjBNdmZWVVBuSUpvNncyQ25pTWhTRlpEcU1jeGNUTVdlaWdqdHFDYXFxbWNwM3pXblBvaWVDbzVXLTdWOHhELTl3S3plWWhNeWJFSHNkeHZRZjcybE5RWGxPWWxtN2hrbTM2TjBpLTVuQWNFUndkaw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fplay.fanslide.com%2Fffsv&amp;v=-qWxoqNWHZQ">https://play.fanslide.com/ffsv</a></p><p>18+, UK only, begambleaware.org.uk (edited)</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✔️ Subscribe to the channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa1I3SEhQTXFoUHF4Tzlaa1E4V1VJZDZTeXNjZ3xBQ3Jtc0tuTUU1RGY2VGtQaDZjZGhTREpNRmhjSXZUeHBOUGJsZHgwXzBVNGw0TW5NX3VGd1VDajBIY0lGLW4wR0VKRk1HcDE5TkVhTGpMMXpoT1Q1bDJackxCMlFyb3h2THpRNnN2M1BqMElHakJzc2htZGQ2QQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F3yg0I28&amp;v=-qWxoqNWHZQ">https://bit.ly/3yg0I28</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✍️ Be Better at FPL: Click here to sign up for a FFScout Membership - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbDJvMUJJVE5MZWZ6R2g2dGRuTEdvQmtTTENYUXxBQ3Jtc0trdlhWVS1yWGpLLTJyVFdhdTktaUNuYWE4N3BFNFZaVkNKN1ozeWdYZk9obXhIUXNGR1FUbjFuTFRTSWwyM1BidWIxSEFySTlKNHpQUVo4Y0s3dG9nblJpOXJZN0dPQ2NfN2VfWkExVjI1OTJ3ZVkwaw&amp;q=http%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2FFFSYouTubeMembership&amp;v=-qWxoqNWHZQ">http://bit.ly/FFSYouTubeMembership</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>Follow Fantasy Football Scout:</p><p>💸 Twitter (News): <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbVA3czZ6YVB0aWR5akw0M2hpMUFjbVE0b0paUXxBQ3Jtc0tsalpUOUoxTDJOaDdpYUdCUDFPQUtEbGcycThneVVQcUdye