      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>This is my (@FPLFocal) Team for Gameweek 7 of Fantasy Premier League 2022/23. There's plenty of FPL tips for your draft, and captaincy advice as always. After Haaland's hat trick GW7 captaincy is difficult between him and Salah!</p><p><br></p><p>🔴 Become a Member: <a href="https://youtube.com/FPLFocal/join">https://youtube.com/FPLFocal/join</a></p><p>🟠 Become a Patron: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqblhBVlN6LXFxZDVLWnI1XzNNYTJSOGFSVVB5QXxBQ3Jtc0tuLTZlaEhST1BoRFBfQXpUSU1RWG04UWpIb0NzOUNHQ2hlSUFuZnhaQTJvZkZGeUVFTFllT3dfbEVwY2hoUkFsZXZfbnVMTjB1WG1hcE5NNTFMOEp1dF9hS1Z3NmlRZGZFNVU5ZG9sOGdacUt2dlJnTQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fpatreon.com%2FFPLFocal&amp;v=bOcEXw9ezg4">https://patreon.com/FPLFocal</a></p><p>🟡 Early access to videos, private channel on Discord, badge by your name &amp; other goodies.</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>🔗 Links</p><p>⚔️ Mini-league: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa1A4bUR4aU5ERjVBSEdsOVZ4azJOMWVuR2g5UXxBQ3Jtc0ttVjlQVHhKZy1qWjNZQUhHcGxrbGhOWnNYbnFkZUd5eXFLb1hTVmZPLTlsVF9Fc0hSUk9jNUpKczcwY1V3cS00VG5TdHBqT2ZKU0pyMGYwTVpaaVlFdFMxZDEtSDJKNnB3VE04U21OdHNiTFV6MUZacw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Ffantasy.premierleague.com%2Fleagues%2Fauto-join%2Fohqb6d&amp;v=bOcEXw9ezg4">https://fantasy.premierleague.com/lea...</a> (code: ohqb6d)</p><p>🎁 Join FFScout 👉 <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbDNxMG9ZM2prR0FOcFVremlEVWIyeDlsT1hXZ3xBQ3Jtc0tuenFKbTNLakdQblRxZ1JyNzFyMnhFNERsU2xCNjRkbnFsd2k1NkVjcHhRZTN3X0poOFA4VEIyTGhMM3Q1bnpBWmNJaHE4UnVRSzVhOUFHRUFmczgzSXktLWVyU1ZNSWVDTmdCWjdfZDB5a3FUSU1nYw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2FFPLFocal_FFScout&amp;v=bOcEXw9ezg4">https://bit.ly/FPLFocal_FFScout</a></p><p>💬 <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbVFyZDhtMEJoNGcyWFNlYXZGUGMzTHJLaDhaUXxBQ3Jtc0tseWVHQjl3T1F3WHpYaVctTndJbk1VSVBoZjA4SXhHOHFRcHNWLTIwb0F5aDY2Tmdj