    <item>
      <title>FPL GW7 Template in Tatters? | Scoutcast | Fantasy Premier League 22/23 | Gameweek 7</title>
      <description>Andy is joined by Joe and Seb to discuss the key issues facing Fantasy Premier League managers ahead of Gameweek 7. With big at the back failing to impress and more midfielders and forwards hauling each week, is the early season template now redundant? Joe assesses the emerging options in his goals imminent table, Andy looks at forwards and Seb considers whether wildcarding is the best strategy.

Plus all the usual features, from Community Q&amp;A to team reveals and more.

