    <item>
      <title>Introducing Fanslide, new, in-play Fantasy Football!</title>
      <description>Az (@ffscout_az) chats to Joe (@_Fanslide) about a new Fantasy Football app where you are in control during a live game!

Created by a group of football-loving friends from London, Fanslide’s ‘in-play Fantasy Football’ is free-to-play and is already a big hit with fans.

You can select three players at any one time, ‘sliding’ them in when you think they’re about to have an impact on the match – be that scoring a goal or by winning tackles, blocking shots etc.

Time must be managed wisely, with each player having a 20-minute maximum. You can slide players in and out whenever you want, whether it’s based on your reading of the match or to save unused time for later in the game.

━━━━━━━━━━━━━
Download FanSlide!: https://play.fanslide.com/ffsv

How To Play: https://www.fantasyfootballscout.co.u...
Get Involved with Club!: https://www.clubgame.app/
━━━━━━━━━━━━━

#FPL #FantasyPremierLeague #PremierLeague #Fanslide Fantasy Football Scout, Fantasy Football Tips, Fantasy Football Advice, Fantasy Football Help, Fantasy Football Team
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
