        <![CDATA[<p>This is my (@FPLFocal) Team for Gameweek 4 of Fantasy Premier League 2022/23. There's plenty of FPL tips and captaincy advice as always. Salah, Haaland or Jesus for the captain armband is a tough one this week.</p><p><br></p><p>🔴 Become a Member: <a href="https://youtube.com/FPLFocal/join">https://youtube.com/FPLFocal/join</a></p><p>🟠 Become a Patron: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqblBLU1oxUUswN0E5Y2JiRWxJRkMya2IwTlBuQXxBQ3Jtc0ttMkh6VWxDLXBJZ1lUR2c0endZVDQ1ZUk5d2N3d28zcEdzQlBOc1hjek16QTlWcGNkanc2SkFCcmRCdXV4OFl1SWJFY19lT1ZLd3V4NFBHa1I5NFM5enZuVVlnMjFvaXFtcGV5TE4wckRzb0VaSWpvMA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fpatreon.com%2FFPLFocal&amp;v=fXk4Nx9iXVI">https://patreon.com/FPLFocal</a></p><p>🟡 Early access to videos, private channel on Discord, badge by your name &amp; other goodies.</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>🔗 Links</p><p>⚔️ Mini-league: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbjk5RjQxMDFGZXFyZEtoSFdGTjB0dHVYaHI3d3xBQ3Jtc0tuOUlXMzFjQkYyckVKQVBzb3ZtN1Rtajd2UlctNzVmT1BjbGZtWV9yMDRxWElfV0lOd202V2ZmZ3k4ZzJoVi05OE8wMHUwZzhESTF0Z082eXRNRkNySm4xNk80YkVHX3BSTUk1Vi1ySDNOM2RSNlZfMA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Ffantasy.premierleague.com%2Fleagues%2Fauto-join%2Fohqb6d&amp;v=fXk4Nx9iXVI">https://fantasy.premierleague.com/lea...</a> (code: ohqb6d)</p><p>🎁 Join FFScout 👉 <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa2x0d3laX2hsLUhBcnNnNmdIbnNyaEVZMmV0QXxBQ3Jtc0tsT1Fhd1VvSFp3dTJNSldHOU9nUnpxMDZMdG5WOG03RVFMcW9xWF8zUmk1djdUd3pmUjU2NXUwd0pCaVJ6N0VXaDAtMjlUdXFGUTd2VjRhcUE4NGNqaFRqaFRhdzdCaGlXdWRPVkdDcnlIb0JxdDg3aw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2FFPLFocal_FFScout&amp;v=fXk4Nx9iXVI">https://bit.ly/FPLFocal_FFScout</a></p><p>💬 <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa2tzSWVYWHVweFZNWU9HaWc3d3JQbW5VakFOd3xBQ3Jtc0tub2E5ekd3R0hiWTJkRmtwWTJJemJDbC1xWjlsOVlneXBraEtOcWtfc0RieVI0NzJzY2ljeGN4YjRhRHlveW