    <item>
      <title>FPL GW4 Mounting Problems | Scoutcast | Fantasy Premier League 22/23 | Gameweek 4</title>
      <description>Andy is joined by Joe and Seb as they prepare for FPL Gameweek 4 of the Fantasy Premier League 2022/23 season. With big name defenders blanking last time out, many FPL managers are wondering whether 'big at the back' has a future.

Meanwhile, problems are mounting up in midfield, with pricier options in the centre of the park stuttering. Joe assesses the forward options that could replace them , Seb looks at Leeds' budget options and Andy leads a discussion on the best team stats.

Plus - team reveals, community team, teacher Andy's Q&amp;A and more.
━━━━━━━━━━━━━
