    <item>
      <title>FPL GW4 Reliable Salah v the rest | Fantasy Premier League 22/23 | Gameweek 4</title>
      <description>Joe and Tom assess the best FPL captaincy candidates for Gameweek 4. With a goal against Manchester United last time out, Liverpool talisman Mohamed Salah looks a reliable pick against Bournemouth this weekend. But can Arsenal's effective ownership monster Jesus be ignored? And what of Kane and Haaland's armband credentials in #gw4 ?

