      <title>FPL Stand Up Comedian Tom Glover | Meet the Manager | Fantasy Premier League 22/23 | Gameweek 3</title>
      <description>FPL fans have seen his videos, now they can meet the manager. Joe (@FFScout_Joe) chats to Stand Up Comedian Tom Glover (@FPLFaceOff) whose popular Twitter videos offer a sideways look at how Fantasy Football managers really think. He chats about his inspiration, his surprise debut season success and the FPL Face Off podcast he co-hosts.

PLUS: Joe and Tom chat about his plans for GWK 4 as a snapshot of his thinking

