    <item>
      <title>FPL GW3 Template Busters! | Scoutcast | Fantasy Premier League 22/23 | Gameweek 3</title>
      <description>Andy is joined by Joe and Seb as they prepare for FPL Gameweek 3 of the Fantasy Premier League 2022/23 season. Armed with two free transfers the Scoutcasters are looking to mix it up for Gameweek and break the template. But which differentials will be stars or traps? Which attacking defenders are the best? And the crew take a deep dive into Arsenal's attacking prowess this campaign. 

PLUS: Team reveals, captaincy chat, community questions and more!

