      <title>FPL GW3 Jesus Now a Top Captaincy Pick | Fantasy Premier League 22/23 | Gameweek 3</title>
      <description>Joe and Tom assess the best FPL captaincy candidates for Gameweek 3. With a huge haul against Leicester last time out, Arsenal's Gabriel Jesus has emerged as a top ~Fantasy Premier League captaincy pick this time when he travels to newly promoted Bournemouth. But there's still plenty of choice for the armband, especially from the ranks of Liverpool, Spurs and Manchester City.
