      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>David Munday (@DavidMunday815) debriefs FPL managers from a hectic Gameweek 2, which included only a small haul for Erling Haaland owners, frustration for those who held the faith in Leon Bailey and big points for Gabriel Jesus and Gabriel Martinelli backers.</p><p><br></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✔️ Subscribe to the channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbnNYVnVzWm5qR25hWk1nZFdBUHY1WG5hNjk3d3xBQ3Jtc0ttNFE2WjJxQmNKa3RocWdwS2gtVWYwVjgtNmM2WEJzdGtUZkN1WHktaGtPemJEVzN3WllZS05OR0ZIV2pEM1A3dVRiSDZjcThHNnllREtQRlRnNnQ5NmJ6MWpjQVhoVEdVTG9zak1ROVlQejFFanZ6bw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F3yg0I28&amp;v=bZ4gpeJD6oo">https://bit.ly/3yg0I28</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>🏆 Get key Fantasy Football tips and strategy over at fantasyfootballscout.co.uk</p><p>✍️ Become a Fantasy Football Scout Member - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbG1nTVJzUFN2eVdWM01FVFhYdkxfb1JTM0JiUXxBQ3Jtc0tteHV5UFdDWFhwOGk3aXBKM0Rvci1HRTFxVl9JX1pzd3QyRG9WU3R0bFYybFVOS2xrU1drbmNpaXRaQjNISF9nVEpDbEUwbk1xMzVHaGF3SU5FanI3cFdjN29vandSdmVweVNOc1hTMmhjR0lSU1lZQQ&amp;q=http%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2FFFSYouTubeMembership&amp;v=bZ4gpeJD6oo">http://bit.ly/FFSYouTubeMembership</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>Follow Fantasy Football Scout:</p><p>💸 Twitter (News): <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa3VkVEwxTGtxaHBoSDBpN3dKTnpSTWlZbXVIQXxBQ3Jtc0tsdFJmM3R2SnQ4a0NQanJiZkgzZEVCcGFjOWxkTVk1MzRMSWNNMFNHWmNGMkVUSWhZYTdoeDZaRVdpWFhOeTRjT0NJS2FxN2tRc21fUDhoLTFrWklCWFIxdDhPMHFjYjZucFhqS1NJaDBxblpaRzNubw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Ftwitter.com%2Fffscout&amp;v=bZ4gpeJD6oo">https://twitter.com/ffscout</a></p><p>💸 Twitter (Community): <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbE5tVVlnc2tGY0tEN0FGYi1EYWw2RE1ndG04QXxBQ3Jtc0tuNnNBczJfeVN3d2w3dkpEZnJWZTU2VUtmME4zTTVvREhOdW1XZUVYRkFOS1ZxWTZGdnl0d3d2U0tKS0hYSGxhbVpKd21iTmU0cWwt