        <![CDATA[<p>Harry (<a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCcPWnCj5AKC19HaySZjb25g">@FPL Harry</a> ) Takes a look at the Forwards for this season in FPL.</p><p>Looking at a combination of underlying stats, FPL points, fixtures and general potential this season to help understand who is likely to score the most highly.</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✔️ Subscribe to the channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbWNuM1FySzhNZlhYVmxzNi1Zc0VrM3ZaNEFWUXxBQ3Jtc0tsZ1EyUzVsbEVOeE04VmhnOHA1am01cnQ0SzQ3RkdCa1FKZG00TzRxM0lFUkhDM0hUT1NPNUNVd0sxUmh3ZmpEbTdEbkV3ZHBOdGpxTEV4b1J3RWFwNi10cXdRdFNzSEE3c3BPTTA4bmFJanNHMU42RQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F3yg0I28&amp;v=bVOwW8GLGOk">https://bit.ly/3yg0I28</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>🏆 Get key Fantasy Football tips and strategy over at fantasyfootballscout.co.uk</p><p>✍️ Become a Fantasy Football Scout Member - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbHRYWXVwUWhVYVNydzJwSENQa0FrbWFCcFFPUXxBQ3Jtc0tuYnhoeHk0dXdHVC1WNHp0eW5MdVJvbXprWUpJMDR3Rlhrc3pwS3pydGZZM1d3b1BEcFVyQy1IYnlRd3BCNE5Oa0lHY0pHaEwwRTMzMkhvSElweTdyMVVnZE0yanFpRHhXdENLd0JjdDNGYm5NTm9HOA&amp;q=http%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2FFFSYouTubeMembership&amp;v=bVOwW8GLGOk">http://bit.ly/FFSYouTubeMembership</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>Follow Fantasy Football Scout:</p><p>💸 Twitter (News): <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa1FKVWNLSlRPaWZ1ckdGY01neG4zMWVWN2xiUXxBQ3Jtc0ttclo5YnI0bWpSbjQwU2lHd2JjN0JqTFVrVkdtQzl2ZDNDWjJNbTNfTlppckpNYWY1R2RRTkpEUHNiN1lIREpYcTRZUGlUUjdFckNBWElnNkpsRVBFaFJNd3FVLUtxU25hR1RSWWxYOEsyRVRLZ3Fucw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Ftwitter.com%2Fffscout&amp;v=bVOwW8GLGOk">https://twitter.com/ffscout</a></p><p>💸 Twitter (Community): <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbnlKMzBkRlhPLXFHdnI4M1JYVXY4aC00OHNPQXxBQ3Jtc0ttQzlGeVlyTGhILUY5RWZtS2FHbzh6VC1iUmpuRGttdGNoM1M3UU9yU3Bha2xjQ