      <title>FPL Journal creator Craig Priestley | Meet the Manager | Fantasy Premier League</title>
      <description>Joe chats to another FPL manager with an interesting story to tell and unique perspective on the game. This time he meets Craig Priestley who has created an FPL Journal to offer a back to basics approach to team management... and some colouring in along the way.
Plus: Craig reveals his impressive FPL record and thoughts ahead of #GW2.
