        <![CDATA[<p>Joe chats to another FPL manager with an interesting story to tell and unique perspective on the game. This time he meets Craig Priestley who has created an FPL Journal to offer a back to basics approach to team management... and some colouring in along the way.</p><p>Plus: Craig reveals his impressive FPL record and thoughts ahead of <a href="https://www.youtube.com/hashtag/gw2">#GW2</a>.</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>0:00 Starts</p><p>1:20 Craig chats about the FPL Journal</p><p>4:35 FPL Journal in action</p><p>15:28 Craig's career history</p><p>19:23 Craig's 2022/23 GW2 bus team as a snapshot</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✔️ Subscribe to the channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbklpNzFHZFZKWGVXMWNYQmpEM3djTHhGcTZpZ3xBQ3Jtc0trWHo0cFhhcnUzczRTNnVJODhMUV84MU1zZnhUemRjdHpBU2lESWpIdGExaDZzTVR5Qnhxa3JrU2xhNW1jWmtzTXM2alB3cHkzTHBHSFBMeXlkMmNDVVQxV0p6dmhiWmM4eE51QzNzc21XVS16N1NRMA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F3yg0I28&amp;v=hcm78bt9xkA">https://bit.ly/3yg0I28</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>🏆 Get key Fantasy Football tips and strategy over at fantasyfootballscout.co.uk</p><p>✍️ Become a Fantasy Football Scout Member - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbnFkODhBaHdlSzA0VjZrU3JhZGxFd3dHLTFQQXxBQ3Jtc0tuSjV6UHZWWll6UGM3VGNnNmpNb19sSmlrN2lEYnYwSVJtZ0JTUzYxMHRzU2l4MzIweUNlSHhXVlBTcGpwQWpKcGxJVHd6Wi14YVJIcV9ueTZLSDY2aFFla21IWmFDc2VxUU1PeExwZTN3MmFpT1FPUQ&amp;q=http%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2FFFSYouTubeMembership&amp;v=hcm78bt9xkA">http://bit.ly/FFSYouTubeMembership</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>Follow Fantasy Football Scout:</p><p>💸 Twitter (News): <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbElVUUZCNjZvcE5NZmZpTzBtdkxBWVBRdFdJQXxBQ3Jtc0tsdmtnNnpHem1mdEdlcjNNbjhwSUl2dkhLOXlJQWc2NzFndDF3YkJ3WEdJZzRnQzZJbTJGdEo5S3RTMlBNY194TGlBcHBlWUc4NVUyR1RBYi1WSDZGeGZxd2JUSWhVeDh0WlFFWmktU3ZJY0NRZElsUQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Ftwitter.com%