      <description>Andy (@FPL_Sonaldo) and Pras (@Pras_fpl) are joined by Baker (@BakerFPL343) to look back at Gameweek 1 to see what we've learnt. The three also preview GW2 of Fantasy Premier League Season and talk about the Burning Questions for Gameweek 2 FPL teams.
