    <item>
      <title>Lessons Learned Ahead Of GW2 | Scoutcast | FPL 22/23</title>
      <description>Andy is joined by Joe and Seb as they prepare for Gameweek 2 of the Fantasy Premier League 2022/23 season. What lessons have their learned from last week's opening fixtures? They sift through the GW 1 stats, with an eye on high owned flops and the early scorers of the campaign.

There's also quick fire questioning from Teacher Andy and the latest from the show's Community Team, as well as team reveals and more.

