    <item>
      <title>Haaland v Salah | Captaincy GW2 | FPL 22/23</title>
      <description>Joe and Tom assess the best FPL captaincy candidates for Gameweek 2. Man City's Erling Haaland arrived in style to the Premier League last time out with a brace at West Ham. Can he repeat his goal scoring heroics against newly promoted Bournemouth this weekend? And what of Liverpool's Mohamed Salah? Are we forgetting about his Fantasy Premier League points scoring potential?

━━━━━━━━━━━━━
0:21 Starts
2:35 GW2 Fixtures
5:53 Worst defences GW 1
9:24 Haaland v Salah comparison
14:43 Joe and Tom's Top 3 Picks

