      <title>Season Opener Team Reveals | Scoutcast | FPL 22/23</title>
      <description>Andy is joined by Joe and Seb as they prepare for the first Gameweek of the Fantasy Premier League 2022/23 season. Each of our Scoutcasters will reveal their latest drafts, the challenges they face and the key statistics they are looking at. The community will also be more involved beyond their usual questions with a community team for them to help build each week.

Follow the link to join the Scoutcast Community League and take on the Community team:
