        <![CDATA[<p>Harry (<a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCcPWnCj5AKC19HaySZjb25g">@FPL Harry</a> ) Takes a look at the best enablers for this season in FPL.</p><p><br></p><p>Looking at a combination of underlying stats, FPL points, fixtures and general potential this season to help understand who is likely to score the most highly.</p><p><br></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✔️ Subscribe to the channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbDhBVDJnYlVtOTk5Tmc0cnJOdnRkRVhFQ2lIQXxBQ3Jtc0ttak5iLTk2MjlGcHdUVXo2OS1YNTZrMmxpYl9LWHZtZVZnTzBpZTQ0aWdlT0x6amJtdWRlN05qSmU3Y0cyU21mRXhqczRtUFlTbXptZ2pkNmhLSlBEbkZNeHNpNXhYZkZKYl9nVUhwdERaazB1N3RzQQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F3yg0I28&amp;v=yUUkOEkL15w">https://bit.ly/3yg0I28</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>🏆 Get key Fantasy Football tips and strategy over at fantasyfootballscout.co.uk</p><p>✍️ Become a Fantasy Football Scout Member - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa0Y1OG96QUlKaHJWNm9WSHdsempWRm1KNFRzZ3xBQ3Jtc0tuZDlSbUMtYXFUa2t6ZDVFdWZ2a0haYmRjcjhUck5zalRWb1lLYW5CSC0xZjVoOEttX3R4X3NpTDJwQzlhcVdTSEN2d0NkRm9rbHNYd2l4UGp5dVYxdEtFWXZaanp3RWg0cTc2bHpGYVNoTWdFUnpBRQ&amp;q=http%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2FFFSYouTubeMembership&amp;v=yUUkOEkL15w">http://bit.ly/FFSYouTubeMembership</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>Follow Fantasy Football Scout:</p><p>💸 Twitter (News): <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa2ZlX3JrdWdZN2JGUTM1UmFENmw5blU4aG9zd3xBQ3Jtc0tucEFNVDBvVU9BVGRoc3pRTVJ5NkdOZm1hZldFU19MUmVPU180STZjWng5LTVNdDZyUDV3dndhZXZoelJBckdXdGJWdEp5ZVRlYWw1czUyd0daTXhYaUVMV3RKRDk2a3lMTlJGNW55Y0toY3lkQmVLMA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Ftwitter.com%2Fffscout&amp;v=yUUkOEkL15w">https://twitter.com/ffscout</a></p><p>💸 Twitter (Community): <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa1dtLURad1V3ZUxkWEZ5dEswMS1raGl6WmdWQXxBQ3Jtc0tsU0lRcy1GUjFMLWxUOHRyRHZMSExJZk1iZk