      <description>Az (@FFScout_Az chats to Obay (@FPL_Milanista) about his first draft for 22/23.

Obay has a steller record in FPL, and the new FFS Pro Pundit currently sits in 50th in the all time rankings on the Hall of Fame. He finished 473rd in 20/21 and 1547 in 21/22

