        <![CDATA[<p>Az (@FFScout_Az chats to Obay (@FPL_Milanista) about his first draft for 22/23.</p><p><br></p><p>Obay has a steller record in FPL, and the new FFS Pro Pundit currently sits in 50th in the all time rankings on the Hall of Fame. He finished 473rd in 20/21 and 1547 in 21/22</p><p><br></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>🏆 Check out key stats from the Premier League on fantasyfootballscout.co.uk</p><p>Become a Fantasy Football Scout Member - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbnE1UjNRX0lBd2RfZk9KWVpkejU1S1RUZmEtQXxBQ3Jtc0tsd19pNWk5SHdOdjlwWEdxMGl6ZWMwU3Z2YlZBRE13cC1WR0hTZnpyZkdPdzY1Z2s5YnI1bUVxRnU4aXV1U0llSjhfQjVDX2lnQ2pLbDQzcUkzRnltMTROY055TlJJWVdpRUVTdGh2a2VCTlc5bGtZUQ&amp;q=http%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2FFFSYouTubeMembership&amp;v=jJtlMnWUhGE">http://bit.ly/FFSYouTubeMembership</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p><br></p><p>📹 Subscribe: Main channel - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbXdYeHROOGRDamlGUnZTTEkyWG9ieHVUVlpKQXxBQ3Jtc0tuZU5OZzluT3JYZ0pzZk9MMDBkSkhJeWRpWlhQV2YtU3l2VWJyX2RFNU53ZGwyZ25tanFZbXl1elFKMTg3T0E5QUpfVDNaMHRjWjcxcmFwdjluZEw5X2RJTjhPMFVLV0hPODU5S2pocXRlRXB5QmhiMA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F392PzEY&amp;v=jJtlMnWUhGE">https://bit.ly/392PzEY</a></p><p>Sky Fantasy Football channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa2lnSDNtd1NmV2xrcWtpTy14R2lRcVduZDdrQXxBQ3Jtc0ttZ3diZTdWN0hDZU9XZm9NLU4yOE5pdlQ5cG1RMWxpc3lqd0VnRnZJcHRUdVdBb2xtLU16Wmx3aEQ5ZjlpbDhQcXRHY1hoeGVMeTdiZ1lkVmlnUmx3Y3RxNEtRZnhsZHc0ODI1MWRpamplb0lzM0tnWQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F3AtLaYq&amp;v=jJtlMnWUhGE">https://bit.ly/3AtLaYq</a></p><p><br></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>Follow Fantasy Football Scout:</p><p>💸 Twitter (News): <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbTNDU1RlbGVORTdWamZXVTZaYVBwdk93SEVZZ3xBQ3Jtc0trLWVVa0wyR3paYks1ejd5dGg5Z0VFWG42QjBQVFBqcjBXQjR3TlFDYXdZYTZNWXlSUlZtaDBhV0tPZ