      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>Is the template team any good? Ted &amp; Az look at the differences between the most popular players on twitter and on the FPL site itself. What are the potential weak points? Is it good to find ways to be different? All shall be revealed.</p><p><br></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✔️ Subscribe to the channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa0tQV3J0Y2w4WGRnSUw5R1ZKcm0xNERsdzRkUXxBQ3Jtc0tueERkSDZRN3VXQWNQZ3F5VzVnaExGc3VfT3FjSmpreDM2ekRGNThXUTJuZy1FaEExTWhhLTdKUmlpQTFFOU9uNEZocXdlTkZVaXlZRWRBbTd1WnVTcG9YZWlRemdTRmtNN2l0WDFuY09tQU9fT0k3Zw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F3yg0I28&amp;v=Cqjh1_GpyzQ">https://bit.ly/3yg0I28</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>🏆 Get key Fantasy Football tips and strategy over at fantasyfootballscout.co.uk</p><p>✍️ Become a Fantasy Football Scout Member - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbThVdk9abkRxekRlakFBemFwWGlQVmZpQ1J2UXxBQ3Jtc0trRk5BcXdGUHFpU09wTjZSMmM1WmlmUk5WaHBhRHZ1S1RPYVdESE95UlE0bHZFVVN5eC1oS3g2RFYwN0s0NmZsM2hYSkVCN1FTSk4yb21fSEVWTXFpSUg1b1ZnMTFqTVdUVTAxRXJqd25MVHBPZFFKOA&amp;q=http%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2FFFSYouTubeMembership&amp;v=Cqjh1_GpyzQ">http://bit.ly/FFSYouTubeMembership</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>Follow Fantasy Football Scout:</p><p>💸 Twitter (News): <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbFFFOGd5X21DeDFTLXJON01HZ092TjF0WDhDUXxBQ3Jtc0tucEpRdFJ1X1BNcHJUb3k1dWRVazVlUEN1QW1CQUhvWHoybVR4T1NEdFdWTWFiY2tzaGZDTkIwZ3ZZdXcxbzltWENlZW1WS0pMNWYwdUNWZExDX1lEMDVLdmtfZi1qb0lGUjBsZnotT2xuVGdUVHFMVQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Ftwitter.com%2Fffscout&amp;v=Cqjh1_GpyzQ">https://twitter.com/ffscout</a></p><p>💸 Twitter (Community): <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbElyNzgwaVJKaVl1ajhHOVl5VlQ0YzVFMENqd3xBQ3Jtc0ttaW1Ba2t3X05pZzVDUldfUUtVdGwzOExqQWZyMEw3VXNmSHExVDFzOFRlOUJfWklIeG5RQURTb1FfYnpTLVRWb3JZYm1uM3JadHdFUmpic1hGUFdGTUJUNTVP