        <![CDATA[<p>Az (@ffscout_az) talks to Tom (@FPLCruyff74) about his first draft ahead of the 22/23 season.</p><p>For anyone not aware, Fantasy Football Scout's deputy editor Tom has an unbelievable FPL record. In his 13 seasons playing, Tom has finished in the top 10k 8 times, with 5 of these inside the top 1k.</p><p>FFS YOUTUBE GRAPHICS SURVEY:</p><p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa09Qc2UzM01RNzFsSml2N2I0U3BMLVdmOUZtZ3xBQ3Jtc0traFRlNDVGa21pNjl2T3BVUkg2TzBuMnNESGFsRW9adjdlR1RLYmFrZUY2QS1RZ0w0RHFZRUM0bG5mdTlubkxSOEtzeFFuWlI5TU9UdExJSDZBMFBURWRSSlRTajdwRFJhTmlPbFhnTEhfYWt4ZzgyUQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fforms.gle%2FzpUzENzj8r93pD7L7&amp;v=S9fKkHhhkmo">https://forms.gle/zpUzENzj8r93pD7L7</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>🏆 Check out key stats from the Premier League on fantasyfootballscout.co.uk</p><p>Become a Fantasy Football Scout Member - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqazh0OGMzNWRkS21WNFFadWRfcFp4a0kybVZud3xBQ3Jtc0tsZjNZT24tOHF4X1NqVnBocDdZMFAyRHBubVRRcUNvMTZDbXM5WkRITnI1WGVUa1JuU3MwVkZxa29jUVdma2dZRzRFenpCTDNuU0NTN1JOR1ZsOFVWVW9rNkRueDM1d1d1QTN2UXMxMnBqQUViZGl0UQ&amp;q=http%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2FFFSYouTubeMembership&amp;v=S9fKkHhhkmo">http://bit.ly/FFSYouTubeMembership</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>📹 Subscribe: Main channel - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbV9DR3lnSDQtMXNHQWM1WFJqeHZhVVY3MHN5QXxBQ3Jtc0tuclUwWHFHYW1hU0tWZTM0TE1ETlJHQm1QaXMwVjVKMmIwdEdtUUhXeHY4ODBFc01DN2pXblV2eDdKbjZFVmN5b29oYlRmS0NFRzJXMElBeTNwSDZtNklybUhTSGNJcmxqcWJBVlRHVGxDYnpSODl1aw&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F392PzEY&amp;v=S9fKkHhhkmo">https://bit.ly/392PzEY</a></p><p>Sky Fantasy Football channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbGU1RE01bkxrNDRwWUpMVWkxZ2pObEYxTEJkZ3xBQ3Jtc0ttT2FQZm9oNnNoVkFBRUllNE9VeWRRbFBTbnFQOTI3a1VERTA3dW5BU2t1d1I0Z3RlLXRXQ1hyQllUSVJDQW5LZ0VmdWpQa3Bv