        <![CDATA[<p>Harry (<a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCcPWnCj5AKC19HaySZjb25g">@FPL Harry</a> ) Takes a look at the 9 Premium Defenders to find which we should be owning for Gameweek 1</p><p>Looking at a combination of underlying stats, FPL points, fixtures and general potential this season to help understand who is likely to score the most highly.</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✔️ Subscribe to the channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbmlzVGpFaExmTk82dzRzaS1iTGJmTXBPYVp5UXxBQ3Jtc0trV19FcUFpSUo0c2FBYWRVSkF0cWRmRVBnTXVjWVFUNUlIWkhmMTNPTE5rZlNOOXM0eWxMWmFfNmo1WW5tUjBjSlFZYUhOb0xxdHl0NkhValRlVEN1dUdrYUdRN2pLRXp5OUVKWXdIRFRDWVpRMkd5TQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F3yg0I28&amp;v=rTf3whX6chI">https://bit.ly/3yg0I28</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>🏆 Get key Fantasy Football tips and strategy over at fantasyfootballscout.co.uk</p><p>✍️ Become a Fantasy Football Scout Member - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa2hDaGxsR1BRR056M0I2c2JWeklHUU5SdXFMUXxBQ3Jtc0tsWklpRmpXLXRyT3dVbkgxdk9rWXFaYTVpUFVrN2hFUjFCVWJULW1lY2dPTHhjQnFYT2M5V056eWRCbzYwNUJ3dmJWdU5MLUpvMDU1c3lsTTNfRnhNejR5TmJlLVM4WmhYNXZHV0VaMnZwOUUxY3EtWQ&amp;q=http%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2FFFSYouTubeMembership&amp;v=rTf3whX6chI">http://bit.ly/FFSYouTubeMembership</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>Follow Fantasy Football Scout:</p><p>💸 Twitter (News): <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbWlwQ2V3QzZZVzc1ak1Ndnp6MUFyZ0lhMVY1QXxBQ3Jtc0tuNlZoTVI2bUpseC1ValFoTEM5bUtWb0liU1U0eEJMTEJpSGZ0Q2xQSjRDSGVXT3RzV0N6MUY5d0p2eXh4MmZPbWUzeGVDZm8zU2YxYkpnaGQ1WDhNRkdGUTNwV2g2akNsWEJTajBvOFB2OFU2eGpIQQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Ftwitter.com%2Fffscout&amp;v=rTf3whX6chI">https://twitter.com/ffscout</a></p><p>💸 Twitter (Community): <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbnBNUUFKRFc1US1lQzA4cVZ5WHNYZGx3Njh1QXxBQ3Jtc0tseTM0Mm1pOEJTVk9LNkpHajVOb