      <description>Joe (@ffscout_joe) talks to @FPLWire 's Zophar (@zophar666) about his first draft ahead of the 22/23 season.
Zoph is very keen on the value of attacking wingbacks at top sides as well as promoted teams' strikers. But he's less keen on midfield options in his unorthodox 5-2-3 formation. Tune in to find out more about his FPL team selection!
