      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>Joe (@ffscout_joe) talks to @FPLWire 's Zophar (@zophar666) about his first draft ahead of the 22/23 season.</p><p>Zoph is very keen on the value of attacking wingbacks at top sides as well as promoted teams' strikers. But he's less keen on midfield options in his unorthodox 5-2-3 formation. Tune in to find out more about his FPL team selection!</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>0:00 Welcome</p><p>1:20 Zophar's GWK 1 draft</p><p>12:00 Attacking defenders stats</p><p>14:50 Midfielder v Forward chat</p><p>19:50 Fixtures and potential wildcard thoughts</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>🏆 Check out key stats from the Premier League on fantasyfootballscout.co.uk</p><p>Become a Fantasy Football Scout Member - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqblBFU3NDYmxZbC1BX1JGTmF6U1hucWVQRElCZ3xBQ3Jtc0trRkt5dVlZWkw4VDV2dFdGM2JhRXhUdmRCUFlUR2d3dHgyclhaNWZMeUdBODhGUDNZZ1QySnhrNk01eVBUd3g2WlQybkhJYnNKZFRfbWRmV0pmdldkQWFiRmg0cElFa0d6bVhTZFczUXZVWl9KaWJHdw&amp;q=http%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2FFFSYouTubeMembership&amp;v=vUW81M9F2qI">http://bit.ly/FFSYouTubeMembership</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>📹 Subscribe: Main channel - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbi1QMzF3WmRYOG10cGpQQk5JVGI3bXd2Qkx5d3xBQ3Jtc0ttX0ZKc0ZnUDdxN28tZ1RKb2dlbzZHaEFEQ0d2OHpONng4SWZBWmgwTGJSa05iMDVmdllkUF9mWkJzTl80SkZjTG5PUlc2QVk2MlA2WmNXd3JBUjBSeXBUTWNkVEpXX3o0elFMSmx6Z0ViV09HdGhGSQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F392PzEY&amp;v=vUW81M9F2qI">https://bit.ly/392PzEY</a></p><p>Sky Fantasy Football channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbUNYRHcxbFRMRUhKWkl1UG1EZmp3YmFrTk43d3xBQ3Jtc0ttTGFmY3luMF8xYVNOYWpCbnhtLU1ZNWdhNV9OdlhKVENqcjFBOHotNG5URlgyUXFKSTdldkk1TFpYb2lxT1BwV3YtZVN6TnBuYTNpNTRuZ213NTVlNmlDTmdUWmxMLUJ1VERJOWRvald6a3g3TjVpTQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F3AtLaYq&amp;v=vUW81M9F2qI">https://bit.ly/3AtLaYq</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>Follow Fantasy Football Sco