      <title>Who is the best £8m FPL Midfielder? | Fantasy Premier League 2022/23</title>
      <description>Az (@ffscout_az) takes a look at seven £8m midfielders: James Maddison, Mason Mount, Bukayo Saka, Dejan Kulusevski, Luis Diaz, Ryiad Mahrez and Phil Foden.
Looking at a combination of underlying stats, points and returns from last season, Az attempts to answer the question: Who is the best £8m option for our FPL team selection?
