      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>Az (@ffscout_az) takes a look at seven £8m midfielders: James Maddison, Mason Mount, Bukayo Saka, Dejan Kulusevski, Luis Diaz, Ryiad Mahrez and Phil Foden.</p><p>Looking at a combination of underlying stats, points and returns from last season, Az attempts to answer the question: Who is the best £8m option for our FPL team selection?</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>✔️ Subscribe to the channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqblo3emFsMFB6eHl1N0NycTZ5U0ZYZTE2UU9vUXxBQ3Jtc0ttNGFNYzBwMzY1cW9zaXFucXNjZjV0N3plb1ctMFRfUmN6aDVSdXFlbXpZR1lCMXZzYS1jTUhLc2NlZ3JqVUtMS0Zkalg1NFVUalNzemNXV2Z5OGItRE1vVHF6ZWJoSGdDSG1UTm1wakZlZVdwMXJQQQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F3yg0I28&amp;v=yHU3dNR5fF0">https://bit.ly/3yg0I28</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>🏆 Get key Fantasy Football tips and strategy over at fantasyfootballscout.co.uk</p><p>✍️ Become a Fantasy Football Scout Member - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqa2NqcTJmNUdGdjNMRVZyWE14al9mVUZlZG4zQXxBQ3Jtc0trRFMwVGdHMUc1UVA4d3lsLW42WWxhZC1Nc08ybzBhVVNQdTFFajV1RjM3UU5hQjhlRGpyOG02RHlvWmUzd2w5MXRZMHZjVUpMVUdtTVlZY3UzbllBY0hqTnFsTlR5bW1hQVNaVjVWbTYwMENGNGppaw&amp;q=http%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2FFFSYouTubeMembership&amp;v=yHU3dNR5fF0">http://bit.ly/FFSYouTubeMembership</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>Follow Fantasy Football Scout:</p><p>💸 Twitter (News): <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbjBoNXBmWmh4b1JJbEtucnYwOHdiSE1vSnJHUXxBQ3Jtc0tuXzVUTEJhMnpPMlA5blpMVEJwa1owdXh3N2NrRFJHTXdmOEpkTG9mSl9ueU9waDNrYXNkcW00M29kTThic2NtdXNFZWxVd0FLaklIVTZ1RDRrck1takxpcGk5c3Y4VWlpUTRMWEY0Ung0b0x1Um40OA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Ftwitter.com%2Fffscout&amp;v=yHU3dNR5fF0">https://twitter.com/ffscout</a></p><p>💸 Twitter (Community): <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqazFHclZXeDhLVG1ONXpPOEJKRzhFd3UwSjhRd3xBQ3Jtc0tuT1BnYXJkSmtqM1BOUWcyRkdjbnJya1Vfa0l