      <title>Best Value FPL Picks | Fantasy Premier League 22/23</title>
      <description>Az (@ffscout_az) gets the spreadsheet out and takes a look at who could be the best value picks in FPL 22/23 based on last seasons points, with this years prices.
There's some interesting names amongst the players talked, including a few that you may not have thought of.
With this in mind, Az puts together a couple of different teams with players that, based on last season, could well outscore their price point. Will you be considering any of these options?
