      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>Az (@ffscout_az) takes a look at some of the most important players for our FPL teams ahead of Gameweek 1. Would we be foolish to go without the likes of Haaland, Salah, and Alexander-Arnold in our final teams?</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>🏆 Check out key stats from the Premier League on fantasyfootballscout.co.uk</p><p>Become a Fantasy Football Scout Member - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbHdGR1pnWkZoRG5sdHRyUTdHR05LTGlhRXVWQXxBQ3Jtc0tsVkRVMzQ1cUlUd1EyRlluak5DTzZmeUp2NGN1dUFkaVBtbW1NbHZjMHFYWmhfNDZxOFlPWWFUWkQ5bkNwdGpkNmI1VU82dDJlaEM3UzA3aGFxMjRoMnVURUNib01CMkgxQm5mc2ZBdmlOXzF0MldnWQ&amp;q=http%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2FFFSYouTubeMembership&amp;v=WoK9lsX1FNY">http://bit.ly/FFSYouTubeMembership</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>📹 Subscribe: Main channel - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqazRKWml4U0hPb2ZsV3ZFRk5qc3hxeFZJWkFVd3xBQ3Jtc0tsc3Z4bEszUmZiWlhDa2lkV3ZtSS1wN0xkZEJVc2RwTE15bDdvMXY5ZHlCd25xT0VQTVgzYjF3MFNFaEtoWWZiMnlOV25WdGltYVNIa3dZTXQ4dXQ3ZWZMZllhaV9PWnZFWmc1ZmZQMDlxc2Z4TEhCNA&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F392PzEY&amp;v=WoK9lsX1FNY">https://bit.ly/392PzEY</a></p><p>Sky Fantasy Football channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbUlIZlBhSmZGcEx4VU95Q2txUUNkRWVNelltd3xBQ3Jtc0ttckFrX19PZDZHUnBLSUJEQ2lmVHo3emt4TXlJZkxZdkxqZlptQ1dhSVFyRl9tZElYSnVBY2JpMk9sQldfVVQ1TE5QbFZoUGl3Rllkb3Y0S040SHNEdmp4T2RKRHVveV9QdEc0VVJDNmFuNHgtT3FvRQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F3AtLaYq&amp;v=WoK9lsX1FNY">https://bit.ly/3AtLaYq</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>Follow Fantasy Football Scout:</p><p>💸 Twitter (News): <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbnVyeHZ4ajV5TnBjaVd2bF9PSVhjU0dSMXJiZ3xBQ3Jtc0tteksyakF0TGdPNFd0My1rQVFMUFg4SFczNkp3N3MzbDJfODhOVUwxZFp0WG9yVHE4dU9rR19FUlFiRXlmSnI4eWRaUFg5Q3lyR2RqaVNQVEo2cTlXblU4Y0t0bmZURVZ6X0w5TEIyR25hYlFKOXJsTQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2F