    <item>
      <title>Season Review | Scoutcast | FPL 2021/22</title>
      <description>Joe and Andy look back on an eventful 2021/22 to see what lessons they can learn for when the next campaign launches this summer. The FPL community's thoughts on the season are also revealed.
They also look through the final stats tables to assess which players offered the best value, chance of bonus as well as their importance to their team. Top over and underperformers for the season are also looked at. How many will be in their teams when the 2022/23 starts?
