    <item>
      <title>2 x Top 1K Finishes in Last 4 Seasons | Meet the Manager | w /@Minus4Junior | FPL 202122</title>
      <description>Joe chats to another FPL manager with a unique insight into the game.
This time around he chats to Junior (@Minus4Junior) who has achieved two top 1,000 finishes, including one in the top 500, across his short 4 season career in FPL.
He’s very much a child of the Chips. He's never known anything else other than Free Hit planning and in recent years adapting his game to Covid and postponements.
Twelve week planning and close attention to 'price points' are among his top tips for success.
He also reveals his plans for Gameweek 38 in 2021/22 as a snapshot of his thinking.
━━━━━━━━━━━━
