      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>Joe chats to another FPL manager with a unique insight into the game.</p><p>This time around he chats to Junior (@Minus4Junior) who has achieved two top 1,000 finishes, including one in the top 500, across his short 4 season career in FPL.</p><p>He’s very much a child of the Chips. He's never known anything else other than Free Hit planning and in recent years adapting his game to Covid and postponements.</p><p>Twelve week planning and close attention to 'price points' are among his top tips for success.</p><p>He also reveals his plans for Gameweek 38 in 2021/22 as a snapshot of his thinking.</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>🏆 Check out key stats from the Premier League on fantasyfootballscout.co.uk</p><p>Become a Fantasy Football Scout Member - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbUlzU1VwU05HeDFXWlJkSDZPRkRrMDNRZEJOd3xBQ3Jtc0tuN2hNYTNOWE5IZy1KdFlkbWRNVUVjNUs3YXJ5d3Q5M3c5aGVQa001LTV2WkFFUGszV3UzMGozaHZ1UURDSVFYVmJEM2ViVTd6Ykx0X3R2YVhpR1ZUWjBXVlNKdm9iSzJ5M25pdUxTWXdGcVExUEZhcw&amp;q=http%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2FFFSYouTubeMembership&amp;v=5n7Ss9GoTAM">https://bit.ly/FFSYouTubeMembership</a></p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>📹 Subscribe:</p><p>Main channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbXIydW5GaVc4MW5PcE5Kd2c4V1BscDVEdFZjUXxBQ3Jtc0tsdGMtR3ZuQkIwdVZoZGF6TllxU3I2SFdoVk9NMWxnVndMVTNJWWhGY1RGdUs1N1FjUVlrakEwRFpwTXlvb05rbXZsZ2k2aEtDNXE0WmdGQkY2SGJtVTdmVHdHM2pLYjRWYV9YVWFIVjdxdlpLOEJ4TQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F392PzEY&amp;v=5n7Ss9GoTAM">https://bit.ly/392PzEY</a></p><p>Sky Fantasy Football channel: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqbHhYSVN1MXU0c19mcFpNTVRkWXVpVWFnR3ZFZ3xBQ3Jtc0tsRDhIdjhQbHpnZnhuUm9wTWRXSURaU0Q0V3VyY1BWMloyV0ZJMVZZSnEyMWgzek9DRmV0WmlBYkhRRGFrRzNHWGlEUG9zVkQ2QmJWMUQ1M3lpVmFxV0JXel9EQ1Utems4Vkd3VTl2eXpHMEtPVkRaVQ&amp;q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2F3AtLaYq&amp;v=5n7Ss9GoTAM">https://bit.ly/3AtLaYq<