      <title>Best Players for a Strong End to the Season | Scoutcast | FPL 2021/22 | GW37</title>
      <description>Joe and Andy chat about the key issues impacting FPL managers ahead of Double Gameweek 37. A raft of teams have two fixtures and there are plenty more challenges to grapple with, especially for those with a Chip left.
Our duo reveal their favourite players and strategies for the final two Gameweeks of the season. Joe conjures up Free Hit drafts for Gameweeks 37 and 38. Andy unveils his 11th hour XI...to help managers climb up the rankings.
Elsewhere, Erling Haaland's move to Manchester City comes under scrutiny. Just how much of a gamechanger will the prolific striker be for FPL managers?
PLUS: All the usual features and stats, including quickfire Q&amp;A as well as transfer and captaincy plans.
━━━━━━━━━━━━━
🏆 Check out key stats from the Premier League on fantasyfootballscout.co.uk
