    <item>
      <title>Taming the Monster Double Gameweek | Scoutcast | FPL 2021/22 | GW36</title>
      <description>Joe and Seb chat about the key issues impacting FPL managers ahead of Gameweek 36, which could be the most lucrative Double Gameweek yet this season. A dozen teams play twice in Gameweek 36, meaning a full set of double players is likely for many FPL managers. But how can they maxmise the fixtures to ensure the best players, , with a great chance of some monster hauls. are in place.
Seb reveals the 'perfect' Gameweek 36 line up, with an eye on the best chips to use and how the chipless can best emerge from this monster Gameweek.
PLUS: All the usual features, including quickfire Q&amp;A as well as transfer and captaincy plans.
━━━━━━━━━━━━━
