    <item>
      <title>Dare FPL Managers Ignore Salah? | GW36 Captaincy | FPL 2021/22</title>
      <description>Joe and Tom discuss the key captaincy issues ahead of Gameweek 36. With a rest last time out, enormous ownership and two fixtures, Liverpool's Mohamed Salah is the favourite among FFScout regulars for the armband. Avoiding him is a massive risk but there could be substantial gains to be made by opting for a different captain. There is certainly a tough captaincy decision ahead in what looks to be the most exciting Double Gameweek yet this campaign.
🏆 Check out key stats from the Premier League on fantasyfootballscout.co.uk
