    <item>
      <title>Difference Makers | Scoutcast | FPL 2021/22 | GW35</title>
      <description>Joe, Seb and Andy chat about the key issues impacting FPL managers ahead of Gameweek 35. Our trio are in search of differential points haulers to propel them up the rankings during the season run in. Meanwhile, Spurs erratic form and Chelsea's ongoing threat of rotation are looked at.
PLUS: All the usual features, including quickfire Q&amp;A as well as transfer and captaincy plans.
