    <item>
      <title>Top 300 Season &amp; Captain Picker Extraordinaire!| Meet the Manager w/ @KotuClassic | FPL 2021/22</title>
      <description>Joe chats to another FPL manager with a unique insight into the game.
This time around he's joined by Chama, who is in the top 300 during the final few Gameweeks of the 21/22 season after resolving to improve his captaincy scores.
With a raft of stellar armband hauls over the season he reveals how he makes his decisions and the plans he put in place to do well this season before the campaign began.
Vital viewing for FPL managers looking to improve how they pick their captain.
As a snapshot of his thinking he also discusses his Gameweek 33 plans!
