      <content:encoded>
        <![CDATA[<p>Joe, Andy &amp; Seb look ahead to Gameweek 32 and beyond in FPL.</p><p>With a raft of Double Gameweek fixtures announced for later this season there is plenty for our Scoutcast trio to consider. They also wonder whether Salah could be jettisoned due to his falling form. And Joe gets his shopping trolley ready for some bargain basement shopping in midfield and among attacking defenders.</p><p>Plus - all the usual features from quick fire questions and latest stats to team reveals and captaincy plans.</p><p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p><p>🏆 Check out key stats from the Premier League on fantasyfootballscout.co.uk</p><p>Become a Fantasy Football Scout Member - <a href="https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&amp;redir_token=QUFFLUhqazdmeENSRmcyQ2RmcnZMd0dhRmExcElMc25UZ3xBQ3Jtc0tuLXlGbURPODAxSHZRLUdTcTlJWk8yampab0JEb1FVRGtUYllsUm9tTzVKUE9GTmQ0bldxWmJLT3luZnFHbnVmUGJUck1iU0dZLXFESDNMNU9oQkJ0b3lCeFkyZWp5TjFpUzRCMnh6Y3ZWakQ2bGZtTQ&amp;q=http%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2FFFSYouTubeMembership">https://bit.ly/FFSYouTubeMembership</a></p><p> </p><p>Learn more about your ad choices. Visit <a href="https://podcastchoices.com/adchoices">podcastchoices.com/adchoices</a></p>]]>
