      <itunes:author>Fantasy Football Scout</itunes:author>
      <itunes:subtitle></itunes:subtitle>
      <itunes:summary>Joe, Andy &amp; Seb look ahead to Gameweek 31, which could be the worst Double Gameweek FPL Managers have ever known. Do they really want any Burnley and Everton players?
Nevertheless, there's plenty to discuss, including chip strategy and planning for two far more important Doubles - in Gameweeks 33 and 36.
Andy takes charge of hosting once again while Joe awaits his new tech. He may also answer some DIY questions following his garden decking heroics during the International Break.
Plus - all the usual features from quick fire questions and latest stats to team reveals and captaincy plans.
━━━━━━━━━━━━━
