    <item>
      <title>Single v Double Gameweekers | GW31 Captaincy | FPL 2021/22</title>
      <description>Joe and Tom discuss the key captaincy issues ahead of Gameweek 31. It's a Good, Bad and Ugly Gameweek after the international break. The good news is that it's a Double Gameweek. But the bad news is it features two unappealing sides in Burnley and Everton. The ugly news is that Burnley face their regular tough opponents, Kevin De Bruyne's Manchester City. There are certainly some tough choices ahead regarding the armband.
