    <item>
      <title>Tackling Rotation | Meet the Manager with Emma @jumpthewave | FPL</title>
      <description>Joe chats to Emma (@jumpthewave) who each week before the FPL deadline uses her data analysis skills to attempt to second guess the line ups of the likes of Manchester City and Chelsea.
She reveals how a family mini-league started her mission to use data to make better decisions in FPL. She also reveals how the FPL Community can help add further to her research and how she is aiming for another top finish for the 2021/22 season run in.
