    <item>
      <title>Inside FPL managers' minds| Meet the Manager with academic Daniel Whittaker | FPL</title>
      <description>Academic Daniel Whittaker (@FPL_Tikka) has just completed new research on how FPL managers consumer information and use it to decide on their weekly transfers, captain calls and strategies.
Here he exclusively reveals his initial findings and why the whole world can learn from the successful ways FPL managers consume information.
As a snapshot of how his research has helped his own FPL team he runs through his plans for Gameweek 29 and beyond.
