    <item>
      <title>Gameweek 29 | Scout the Gameweek featuring Sonaldo (@FPL_Sonaldo))  | FPL 2021/22</title>
      <description>This week FPLFamily's Sam is joined by FPL Sonaldo. They look at Gameweek 28 so far, discussing the injury to Jarrod Bowen, the players that have impressed and how making the wrong call on 50/50 decisions has hurt this week. 
Sam and Sonaldo also look ahead to Gameweek 30 focusing on the key players to own and how to invest in the key Double Gameweek teams - Spurs, Arsenal and Liverpool. 
They also discuss chip strategy and the all important captains armband. 
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
