    <item>
      <title>4 x Top 10K finishes! | Meet the Manager with @FPL Cam22 | FPL</title>
      <description>As part of the Meet the Manager series Joe catches up with Fantasy Football Scout regular poster and 4 x top 10K finisher Camzy ahead of Double Gameweek 26.

Camzy started playing FPL back in 2006, when he was just a teenager. Within three years he had finished in the top 100.

This excellent career record, as well as a three year break from the game, gives him a unique insight into how FPL has evolved in recent years.

He also reveals his chip strategy for the 2021/22 season run in as a snapshot of his thinking.
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
