    <item>
      <title>Transforming Fantasy Football | Meet the Manager with LiveFPLnet’s Ragabolly | FPL</title>
      <description>In this latest episode of Fantasy Football Scout’s Meet the Manager series Joe chats to Ragabolly about his @LiveFPLnet website, which has transformed Fantasy Premier League managers’ understanding of the game.

Launched in 2018, his LiveFPLnet set of tools has vastly expanded its roster of features over the years.

This includes viewing real time rank changes, tracking the performance of “legendary managers” and a “what if” tool, to see how players’ potential performance can alter rank.

Perhaps the most groundbreaking feature has been his look at effective ownership (which includes captaincy and chip use), among groups of FPL managers, including those nearby in the rankings.

Ragabolly also looks at how LiveFPLnet has impacted on his own impressive FPL team management over the years. He has finished inside the top 100K in ten of his 12 campaigns, with 2017/18’s finish of 2,821 his best yet.
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
      <pubDate>Fri, 07 Jan 2022 15:14:11 -0000</pubDate>
      <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
      <itunes:author>Fantasy Football Scout</itunes:author>
      <itunes:subtitle></itunes:subtitle>
