    <item>
      <title>Covid chaos! | Scoutcast | FPL 2021/22 | GW18</title>
      <description>Joe and Seb help FPL managers prepare for Gameweek 18. The Covid pandemic has wreaked havoc with the schedule already, with matches postponed and fears the season could be paused.

Our Scoutcast duo consider some of the key strategies to coping with Covid as an FPL manager as well as the best players and teams to consider for the weekend, or longer term should more matches be postponed.

Man City options are also considered, as well as all the usual features, from differentials to fixture frisking and more.
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
