    <item>
      <title>Putting the fun into FPL | Meet the Manager with Benny Blanco | FPL 2021/22</title>
      <description>In this latest episode of Fantasy Football Scout’s Meet the Manager series Joe chats to FPL Community Twitter celebrity ‘banter account’ @Benny_Blanco40 about how to make Fantasy Football fun again amid tough Gameweeks for many.
This includes details of his Gameweek 39 charity event, where fantasy managers will take on each other in a real life North v South football match. This is raising money for Street Child United and features many stars of the FPL Community.
Benny chats about his role as an FPL Community ‘joker’ and how even he has been taking FPL a little more seriously of late, with some strong finishes in recent years.
At the time of recording he is 16k in the ranking. In this latest episode he also reveals his plans for Gameweek 16 and beyond.
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
