    <item>
      <title>Dreaming of another Kane hattrick | Scoutcast | FPL 2021/22 | GW12</title>
      <link>http://www.fantasyfootballscout.co.uk</link>
      <description>Can Spurs' assets compete with the likes of Salah for FPL managers' attention? Joe and Andy consider whether Kane can replicate his international goal scoring heroics, in which he scored back to back hattricks. Meanwhile, Crystal Palace players are also under consideration with strong fixtures. And who is the best goalie to bring in to consider, especially given Brighton stopper Sanchez's suspension? Our Scoutcast pair consider these issues as well as all the usual features, from goals imminent and differentials to from fixture frisking and team reveals. 
Plus - the communities' 'uniKane' gallery gets an airing.  
━━━━━━━━━━━━━ 
