    <item>
      <title>Can Kane and Son challenge 'perma-captain' Salah?  | GW12 Captaincy | FPL 2021/22</title>
      <link>http://www.fantasyfootballscout.co.uk</link>
      <description>Liverpool's Mohammed Salah looks set to top the Gameweek 12 Captain's Poll, as he has for much of the season. But can Spurs' Kane and Son put up an effective challenge for the armband? Can Kane score a third hattrick in a row? Or is going against the Egyptian winger's huge ownership too much of a risk? 
These issues and more are discussed by Joe and Tom in this latest podcast from Fantasy Football Scout. 
