    <item>
      <title>The ‘Dad Coach’ with 3 x top 1k finishes | Meet the Manager with @SimpleGull | FPL</title>
      <link>http://www.fantasyfootballscout.co.uk</link>
      <description>Joe is joined by Dave Perrins, otherwise known as @SimpleGull, who has an excellent FPL career history, with 3 top 1,000 finishes. 
Also, as the leader of a course for new dads, he is committed to making FPL a family game by running a parents and kids league. This features some notable Fantasy Football managers in the FPL Community and their sons and daughters. 
He chats to Joe about his tips for success and how grown up FPL managers and their kids can enjoy the game together.
 ━━━━━━━━━━━━━ 
Dave's 'Big and Smalls' league for FPL managers and the kids can be found here https://fantasy.premierleague.com/leagues/699993/standings/c
 ━━━━━━━━━━━━━ 
Dave's career history can be found here https://fantasy.premierleague.com/entry/17548/event/11
 ━━━━━━━━━━━━━ 
