    <item>
      <title>Can Conte Transform Spurs? | Scoutcast | FPL 2021/22 | GW11</title>
      <link>http://www.fantasyfootballscout.co.uk</link>
      <description>Joe and Andy are back on the Scoutcast squad after a week off and are joined by @KylieFpl, who steps off the bench Livramento-style to cover for Seb, who is sidelined this time around. 
Our trio chat about how the arrival of Antonio Conte at Spurs could revitalise the fortunes of Son and Kane. High and low owned under performers are also covered and Kylie oversees a game of Buy, Sell, Hold as this season's template continues to evolve. 
Meanwhile, differentials are covered, the community team is tinkered with, fixtures are frisks and captaincy and transfer plans are revealed. 
━━━━━━━━━━━━━ 
