      <link>http://www.fantasyfootballscout.co.uk</link>
      <description>This week FPLFamily's Sam is joined by FPL Sonaldo, also known as Andy, to discuss all things Gameweek 9 and look ahead to Gameweek 10. 
 
Andy and Sam discuss captaining Salah, the best picks for Gameweek 10 as well as any players we should consider selling ahead of the deadline. They also discuss how many players managers should aim for from City, Chelsea and Liverpool as well as considering the injury issues as a result of Gameweek 9. 

