    <item>
      <title>Former pro footballer with 2 x top 5k finishes| Meet the Manager with @winter 2 close| FPL</title>
      <link>http://www.fantasyfootballscout.co.uk</link>
      <description>Joe chats to another FPL manager with a strong career record in the game. This time he meets ex professional footballer Vanya Guchev who has two top 5K finishes, one in the top 2, and is currently in the top 4K ahead of Gameweek 9 in the 2021/22 season. 
Former Ukranian league player Vanya (@winter_2-close) reveals the 'efficient' Premier League players who have impressed him so far. He also chats about his plans for Gameweek 9. 
━━━━━━━━━━━━━ 
Vanya's career history can be seen here https://fantasy.premierleague.com/entry/93/history
