      <link>http://www.fantasyfootballscout.co.uk</link>
      <description>New dads Seb and Andy return from paternity leave to join Joe to look ahead to Gameweek 9.
 Is Lukaku still worth investing in and trusting with the captaincy, despite his poor form? 
And why do we keep overlooking potentially better captaincy options in Salah, Vardy and Kane? 
There are fixtures to frisk, differentials to pick, midfielders to mull over and more.
