    <item>
      <title>Gameweek 8 | Scout the Gameweek featuring FPL Rabbi | FPL 2021/22</title>
      <link>http://www.fantasyfootballscout.co.uk</link>
      <description>In this weeks Scout The Gameweek FPL Family's Sam is joined by Daniel, FPL Rabbi, to look ahead to Gameweek 8. They look back on the lowest scoring Gameweek of the season so far, Gameweek 7 as well as assessing the issues that have arisen during the International Break with injuries. They also talk best teams and players to target for Gameweek.8 as well as discussing the best captain for the week. 

Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
