      <title>Gameweek 6 | Scout the Gameweek featuring FPL Milanista | FPL 2021/22</title>
      <link>http://www.fantasyfootballscout.co.uk</link>
      <description>This week FPL Family's Sam is joined by FPL Milanista himself Obay. They look back on Gameweek 5, discussing the amount of absent players, the importance of the bench and all the important talking points of the Gameweek. They address the Jota question, what FPL managers should do about Torres and James and Aston Villa plus much more. 
 
They also look ahead to Gameweek 6 thinking about best picks, differentials and who to captain - Ronaldo, Salah or someone else entirely!

