      <title>11 x Top 100k finisher reveals his GW5 team | Meet the Manager with Kareem Kahil | FPL</title>
      <link>http://www.fantasyfootballscout.co.uk</link>
      <description>Joe chats to FPL's 'Mr Consistency' Kareem Kahil who has 11 top 100K finishes. He knows how to finish a season strongly. But how can he push onto the next level and become a top 100 finisher? Kareem reveals how FPL managers can finish well and how he plans to push on and become more aggresive in the game. He also reveals how his freshly wildcarded side is set up for Gameweek 5. 
Kareem's team can be seen here https://fantasy.premierleague.com/entry/5118/history 
