      <title>Ronaldo, Lukaku or Both?  | Scoutcast | FPL 2021/22 | GW5</title>
      <link>http://www.fantasyfootballscout.co.uk</link>
      <description>Joe, Seb and Andy help FPL managers prepare for Gameweek 5. 
Which of Ronaldo or Lukaku are the best premium forwards to bring in? But can FPL managers get both? 
Plus, mid price forwards are on the bill, after a wave of injuries and suspensions up top. Leeds attack is analysed ahead of their kind run, fixtures are frisked, differentials are considered and teams, as well as captaincies, are revealed. 
