      <title>Gameweek 5 | Scout the Gameweek featuring Az | FPL 2021/22</title>
      <link>http://www.fantasyfootballscout.co.uk</link>
      <description>This week Sam and Az look back on the key talking points of Gameweek 4. They discuss Ronaldo's return to Old Trafford, Lukaku's form, Antonio's red card and the injury to DCL. 
 
They also look ahead to Gameweek 5 talking about 3 non negotiable for wildcarding players, the top differentials as well as the best cheap defenders in the game. 
 
of course they also look at who should wear the captains armband. 

