    <item>
      <title>Scout The Gameweek - Episode 17 - FPL Nymfria</title>
      <link>http://www.fantasyfootballscout.co.uk</link>
      <description>This week Sam is joined by FPL Nymfria to look back on Triple Gameweek 35 and ahead to Blank Gameweek 36. Sam and Nym recorded this ahead of the final 2 matches of Gameweek 36 between Aston Villa and Everton, and Man United and Liverpool. 

