    <item>
      <title>FPL Gameweek 34 Scoutcast | Fantasy Premier League Tips 2020/21</title>
      <link>http://www.fantasyfootballscout.co.uk</link>
      <description>Joe and Seb are joined by Rich, aka FlapjackFpl from the FPL Surgery podcast, to look at the key issues facing Fantasy Premier League managers ahead of Gameweek 34.
 Burnley’s Chris Wood (£6.3m) was the surprising stand out star of Gameweek 33 for many FPL managers, with a 20pt haul against Wolverhampton.
 But a points bonanza at some point soon for the New Zealand international was arguably predictable, given his stellar underlying statistics in recent weeks.
 The former Brighton striker was among ‘unfairly unfashionable’ picks the Scoutcast crew focused on two weeks ago and given his strong returns since, Joe once again looks at this list to find the next Chris Wood.
 Can Everton forward Dominic Calvert-Lewin (£7.5m) be back in vogue? Will FPL managers see beyond Matheus Pereira (£5.5m)’s West Brom label? And is it possible that Newcastle’s Joelinton (£5.7m) and Dwight Gayle (£5.9m) can continue delivering unexpected returns?
 Meanwhile, Leeds have dropped off the Fantasy Football catwalk in recent weeks due to a poor fixture run. But with a great set of games to round off the campaign they are looking trim and tailored once again. Leeds fan Seb leads the discussion through the best options.
 To make room for these passé potential points scorers more established players need to make way.
 The crew are on hand to ponder on the potential risks and rewards of removing Manchester United’s Bruno Fernandes and Liverpool’s Diogo Jota.
 In addition, the Scoutcast crew also look back on their Gameweek 33 highs and lows as well as reveal their upcoming transfer and captaincy plans.
 Rough with the Smooth features a painful looking bench, the remaining fixtures are frisked and Rich takes his turn to pick a differential.
 ━━━━━━━━━━━━━ 🏆 Want to improve your FPL Rank?
 Become a Fantasy Football Scout Member - https://bit.ly/2E54l2F ━━━━━━━━━━━━━ 📹 Subscribe:
 Main channel - https://bit.ly/392PzEY Second channel - https://bit.ly/3j5ze7j ━━━━━━━━━━━━━ Follow Fantasy Football Scout:
