 💸 Twitter: https://twitter.com/ffscout 📸 Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/ffscout_/ 👍 Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/fantasyfootballscout/

Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
