 💸 Twitter: https://twitter.com/ffscout 📸 Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/ffscout_/ 👍 Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/fantasyfootballscout/

Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
      <pubDate>Wed, 31 Mar 2021 07:07:31 -0000</pubDate>
      <itunes:title>FPL Gameweek 30 Scoutcast | Fantasy Premier League Tips 2020/21</itunes:title>
      <itunes:episodeType>full</itunes:episodeType>
      <itunes:episode>51</itunes:episode>
      <itunes:author>Fantasy Football Scout</itunes:author>
