    <item>
      <title>4 TOP 5000 FPL FINISHES! | MEET THE MANAGER - Tom Stephenson| Fantasy Premier League Tips</title>
      <link>http://www.fantasyfootballscout.co.uk</link>
      <description>Joe meets another FPL manager with a stellar track record of success.
 This time he is joined by Tom Stephenson, who has 4 Top 5,000 finishes and is aiming for a fifth this time around.
 Tom is second in our Live Hall of Fame list of some the best ever FPL managers and hasn't finished outside the top 40,000 in his last 12 campaigns. Remarkable consistency.
 Joe and Tom chat about his career, tips for success and plans for the remainder of the 20/21 season. This includes a sneak peak at Tom's Gameweek 31 wildcard plans.
