    <item>
      <title>Scout The Gameweek: Episode 4 - The FPL Experiment Podcast</title>
      <link>http://www.fantasyfootballscout.co.uk</link>
      <description>Sam from the FPL Family is back with another Scout The Gameweek Podcast. This week she's joined by Adam, Nick and Greg from the FPL Experiment Podcast. 
  
 Nick, Adam, Greg and Sam recorded this podcast whilst the Man City, Burnley, Leeds, Everton, Leicester and Fulham were all playing - and prior to the final three fixtures of the gameweek:
 Liverpool vs Brighton 
 Aston Vill vs West Ham 
 Spurs vs Chelsea
 Sam and the FPL Experiment Podcast guys discuss all things Gameweek 22 so far and use it to look ahead to Gameweek 23. They talk teams and players to target, captaincy options and the big game between Liverpool and Man City. 

Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
