      <link>http://www.fantasyfootballscout.co.uk</link>
      <description>Welcome to the new Fantasy Football Scout Podcast from the Scout Network - Scout The Gameweek hosted by Sam from the FPL Family. 
 This week Sam is joined by Ted from Ted Talk's FPL to look back at Gameweek 18 so far and ahead to double Gameweek 19. 
 Ted and Sam talk about the fixture changes, whether KDB is worth a -8 and chip strategy as well as so much more. 
 Sign up as an FFScout member bit.ly/2E54I82F

Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices</description>
