        <![CDATA[<p>Andy and David discuss the latest press conference news ahead of FPL Gameweek 18 to see if there's any changes that need to be made to our FPL Teams. </p> <p>🏆 Want to improve your FPL Rank? Become a Fantasy Football Scout Member - <a href="https://bit.ly/2E54l2F">https://bit.ly/2E54l2F</a></p> <p>📹 Subscribe: Main channel - https://bit.ly/392PzEY Second channel - https://bit.ly/3j5ze7j</p> <p>Follow Fantasy Football Scout: </p> <p>Twitter: <a href="https://twitter.com/ffscout">https://twitter.com/ffscout</a></p> <p>📸 Instagram: <a href="https://www.instagram.com/ffscout_/">https://www.instagram.com/ffscout_/</a></p> <p>👍 Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/fantasyfootballscout/</p>
